(321525, 24443, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is such a lovely composition and the foreground horse seems great. The big problem is the image size: wayyy too small and it makes it hard to see the image and evaluate it. Please submit pics closer to the max size allowed, i.e. 640 px. You''re hurting yourself scorewise with such small submissions.</td>', 'This is such a lovely composition and the foreground horse seems great. The big problem is the image size: wayyy too small and it makes it hard to see the image and evaluate it. Please submit pics closer to the max size allowed, i.e. 640 px. You''re hurting yourself scorewise with such small submissions.', '2003-06-11 03:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
