(321527, 24391, 9136, '<td valign="top">B! is one of my favorite magazines. This girl looks like she could be a cover model. I don''t really like the border though, and wish her face wasn''t so close up. 7.</td>', 'B! is one of my favorite magazines. This girl looks like she could be a cover model. I don''t really like the border though, and wish her face wasn''t so close up. 7.', '2003-06-11 03:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
