(322130, 24390, 7969, '<td valign="top">gorgeous.  where taken?</td>', 'gorgeous.  where taken?', '2003-06-11 13:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(322131, 24049, 8268, '<td valign="top">eeey.. nice picture.. =) its a good one for  magazine cover</td>', 'eeey.. nice picture.. =) its a good one for  magazine cover', '2003-06-11 13:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(322132, 24035, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot of the birds.  Too bad we are seeing their behinds intead of their heads.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot of the birds.  Too bad we are seeing their behinds intead of their heads.', '2003-06-11 13:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(322134, 24420, 7969, '<td valign="top">not only is it technically very well done, but it evokes an emotional response of simplicity and purity.  very very nice, my favorie shot so far</td>', 'not only is it technically very well done, but it evokes an emotional response of simplicity and purity.  very very nice, my favorie shot so far', '2003-06-11 13:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(322135, 24293, 5391, '<td valign="top">Absolutely excellent architectural shot.  Great nighttime exposure, and you''ve handled the perspective very well.  8</td>', 'Absolutely excellent architectural shot.  Great nighttime exposure, and you''ve handled the perspective very well.  8', '2003-06-11 13:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(322136, 24503, 9262, '<td valign="top">From the title, I was expecting birds and flowers. The moth was a little disapointing! Good composition.</td>', 'From the title, I was expecting birds and flowers. The moth was a little disapointing! Good composition.', '2003-06-11 13:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(322137, 24403, 8268, '<td valign="top">interesting pic.. but i dont think it could be used for fire magazine cover.   maybe in another mag.</td>', 'interesting pic.. but i dont think it could be used for fire magazine cover.   maybe in another mag.', '2003-06-11 13:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(322140, 23968, 9262, '<td valign="top">You almost never see pictures of horses baring their teeth! Well, I haven''t anyways. I can imagine the headline "When Horses Attack!" sprawled over the shot somewhere. <br/> <br/>Nice shot, great capture.</td>', 'You almost never see pictures of horses baring their teeth! Well, I haven''t anyways. I can imagine the headline "When Horses Attack!" sprawled over the shot somewhere.  Nice shot, great capture.', '2003-06-11 13:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(322141, 24390, 8268, '<td valign="top">good picture.. but, how do you take that ????    =)  very nice. .=)</td>', 'good picture.. but, how do you take that ????    =)  very nice. .=)', '2003-06-11 13:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(322142, 24181, 9262, '<td valign="top">I imagine we are going to see a lot of National Geographic shots. I would like to have seen a photo of flora/fauna/people like the magazine has rather than a shot of the magazine. Good attempt.</td>', 'I imagine we are going to see a lot of National Geographic shots. I would like to have seen a photo of flora/fauna/people like the magazine has rather than a shot of the magazine. Good attempt.', '2003-06-11 13:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(322143, 24076, 7969, '<td valign="top">did you struggle with whether or not to crop the power lines?</td>', 'did you struggle with whether or not to crop the power lines?', '2003-06-11 13:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(322144, 24312, 8268, '<td valign="top">nice pic. but.. her face expression is very "normal"..   anyway is a good pic, i love the focus and the blurred background.</td>', 'nice pic. but.. her face expression is very "normal"..   anyway is a good pic, i love the focus and the blurred background.', '2003-06-11 13:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(322145, 24480, 9262, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but the border ruins it, IMHO. I like the juxtaposition of the masks. Good composition.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but the border ruins it, IMHO. I like the juxtaposition of the masks. Good composition.', '2003-06-11 13:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(322146, 24460, 8268, '<td valign="top">it could be a nice picture, but it have grain ?</td>', 'it could be a nice picture, but it have grain ?', '2003-06-11 13:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(322147, 23924, 7994, '<td valign="top">I love the composition</td>', 'I love the composition', '2003-06-11 13:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(322148, 24077, 4543, '<td valign="top">This would be a nice humor photo.  How did you set this up?  Are you a police?</td>', 'This would be a nice humor photo.  How did you set this up?  Are you a police?', '2003-06-11 13:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(322150, 24505, 3669, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...I have a feeling that I''m getting a narrow view of this challenge.  This is a very well done photo, but I''m thinking that if I saw this cover on the news stand would I pick it up, finding interest in what I could read inside?  Probably not, unless there were other photos on the cover.  I don''t know if there was ever a picture taken of Bonnie and Clyde, that would be a great cover.</td>', 'Hmmm...I have a feeling that I''m getting a narrow view of this challenge.  This is a very well done photo, but I''m thinking that if I saw this cover on the news stand would I pick it up, finding interest in what I could read inside?  Probably not, unless there were other photos on the cover.  I don''t know if there was ever a picture taken of Bonnie and Clyde, that would be a great cover.', '2003-06-11 13:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(322152, 24393, 9262, '<td valign="top">This is the first photograph I have seen in this challenge that actually looks like it might be on a magazine cover. I would have liked to have seen it taken from a different angle so that the entire motorcycle would have been in the frame.</td>', 'This is the first photograph I have seen in this challenge that actually looks like it might be on a magazine cover. I would have liked to have seen it taken from a different angle so that the entire motorcycle would have been in the frame.', '2003-06-11 13:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(322153, 24080, 7994, '<td valign="top">Where is this? Looks beautiful, looks like Prague.</td>', 'Where is this? Looks beautiful, looks like Prague.', '2003-06-11 13:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(322154, 24390, 4543, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. You did a good job. 10</td>', 'Excellent photo. You did a good job. 10', '2003-06-11 13:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(322156, 24297, 9262, '<td valign="top">This shot would be better without the shadows on the house and street. Nice shot, well framed. I like how it is done from the corner rathe than from straight on. Good attempt!</td>', 'This shot would be better without the shadows on the house and street. Nice shot, well framed. I like how it is done from the corner rathe than from straight on. Good attempt!', '2003-06-11 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(322157, 24518, 4543, '<td valign="top">Seems to be out of focus.  A tripod would help or a steady hand.</td>', 'Seems to be out of focus.  A tripod would help or a steady hand.', '2003-06-11 13:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(322158, 24075, 9262, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred if both of the players in this shot were in focus. The blurriness of everything else is distracting. Nice composition.</td>', 'I would have preferred if both of the players in this shot were in focus. The blurriness of everything else is distracting. Nice composition.', '2003-06-11 13:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(322159, 24494, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is a great cover for your magazine.  The ripples on the water are nice.  However, the bird seems a little blurred.  I would have liked to see better detail.  Perhaps this was taken a little far away.  8 Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a great cover for your magazine.  The ripples on the water are nice.  However, the bird seems a little blurred.  I would have liked to see better detail.  Perhaps this was taken a little far away.  8 Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-11 13:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(322160, 23990, 8268, '<td valign="top">niiice pic.. =)   i love this one because its very simple, clear and beautiful..  obviously the girl is lovely, but the picture itself is lovely.. clear background, nice colors, good light..   BUT.. a recommendation would be take care of small details like: hair, blouse near neck and axilla.</td>', 'niiice pic.. =)   i love this one because its very simple, clear and beautiful..  obviously the girl is lovely, but the picture itself is lovely.. clear background, nice colors, good light..   BUT.. a recommendation would be take care of small details like: hair, blouse near neck and axilla.', '2003-06-11 13:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(322161, 24073, 5391, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the bit of boat in the lower right corner - it really completes the composition.  Nit-picking on the blown-out whites, however.  Seems just a touch hot to me.</td>', 'I particularly like the bit of boat in the lower right corner - it really completes the composition.  Nit-picking on the blown-out whites, however.  Seems just a touch hot to me.', '2003-06-11 13:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(322162, 24400, 8268, '<td valign="top">too blurry</td>', 'too blurry', '2003-06-11 13:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(322163, 24281, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!  The reflection in the water is lovely as well as the color in the sky.  I could definately see this on a magazine cover.</td>', 'Beautiful picture!  The reflection in the water is lovely as well as the color in the sky.  I could definately see this on a magazine cover.', '2003-06-11 13:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(322164, 24515, 8268, '<td valign="top">nice picture.. but take care of light reflections..</td>', 'nice picture.. but take care of light reflections..', '2003-06-11 13:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(322165, 24497, 4543, '<td valign="top">Nice but the lightning doesn''t seem to work here.</td>', 'Nice but the lightning doesn''t seem to work here.', '2003-06-11 13:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(322166, 24437, 5391, '<td valign="top">Not bad - lovely model, nice pose, good composition - the only that that I think could improve this would be a reflector to bounce a little fill light onto her face.  But actually quite a good shot.  Most shots I see like this wind up looking very ameteurish, but you''ve done quite well.</td>', 'Not bad - lovely model, nice pose, good composition - the only that that I think could improve this would be a reflector to bounce a little fill light onto her face.  But actually quite a good shot.  Most shots I see like this wind up looking very ameteurish, but you''ve done quite well.', '2003-06-11 13:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(322167, 24437, 4543, '<td valign="top">Nice, perfect pose, but would have preferred a little more light on her face.  Great job! 7</td>', 'Nice, perfect pose, but would have preferred a little more light on her face.  Great job! 7', '2003-06-11 13:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(322168, 24075, 8268, '<td valign="top">nice pic.. but it needs more definition specially in his face</td>', 'nice pic.. but it needs more definition specially in his face', '2003-06-11 13:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(322169, 24407, 3669, '<td valign="top">Yes, I could definately see this on the cover of your magazine.  There just seems to be some grainy noise that could possibly be easily cleaned up before you would send it to the editors for consideration.</td>', 'Yes, I could definately see this on the cover of your magazine.  There just seems to be some grainy noise that could possibly be easily cleaned up before you would send it to the editors for consideration.', '2003-06-11 13:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(322170, 24426, 7994, '<td valign="top">Looks like Rio. Is it? Great photo! 10</td>', 'Looks like Rio. Is it? Great photo! 10', '2003-06-11 13:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(322171, 24343, 2560, '<td valign="top">good compostion but needs a little deeper dof.</td>', 'good compostion but needs a little deeper dof.', '2003-06-11 13:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(322172, 24181, 4543, '<td valign="top">A picture of a magazine that is the same in your title won''t probably work here.</td>', 'A picture of a magazine that is the same in your title won''t probably work here.', '2003-06-11 13:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(322173, 24515, 7994, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Too much white space on the top though.</td>', 'Great photo. Too much white space on the top though.', '2003-06-11 13:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(322174, 24174, 8268, '<td valign="top">good picture.. =)</td>', 'good picture.. =)', '2003-06-11 13:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(322175, 24316, 3669, '<td valign="top">Yes, I could see this on the cover of your magazine.  However, using a different background would be a good idea.  I invision a space ship flying amoung the milky way here.  Or something like that...just an idea to make it more interesting.</td>', 'Yes, I could see this on the cover of your magazine.  However, using a different background would be a good idea.  I invision a space ship flying amoung the milky way here.  Or something like that...just an idea to make it more interesting.', '2003-06-11 13:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(322176, 24115, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I''ve done quite a few firearms shots, myself, and I know it can be difficult to get them to look very "clean" and handle reflections and shadows and whatnot.  I like your choice of background as an eye-catcher.  Maybe a little tight on the left side of the frame, but overall quite nice.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I''ve done quite a few firearms shots, myself, and I know it can be difficult to get them to look very "clean" and handle reflections and shadows and whatnot.  I like your choice of background as an eye-catcher.  Maybe a little tight on the left side of the frame, but overall quite nice.', '2003-06-11 13:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(322177, 24035, 8268, '<td valign="top">very good picture.. =)  but, some birds are blurry.. =(</td>', 'very good picture.. =)  but, some birds are blurry.. =(', '2003-06-11 13:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(322179, 24416, 3669, '<td valign="top">The leaves, especially the top ones seem a little overexposed.  Perhaps shielding the sun from them or moving them into the shade would have helped some.</td>', 'The leaves, especially the top ones seem a little overexposed.  Perhaps shielding the sun from them or moving them into the shade would have helped some.', '2003-06-11 13:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(322180, 24406, 8268, '<td valign="top">that frame is prohibited or not ?   nice pic.. =)</td>', 'that frame is prohibited or not ?   nice pic.. =)', '2003-06-11 13:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(322181, 24443, 9262, '<td valign="top">Wish this photo could have been bigger! It''s a very nice shot. I really like the composition. I would have liked to have seen more rolling hills in the background</td>', 'Wish this photo could have been bigger! It''s a very nice shot. I really like the composition. I would have liked to have seen more rolling hills in the background', '2003-06-11 13:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(322183, 24497, 8268, '<td valign="top">so blurry..  sorry, but i cant imagine a playboy cover like this..</td>', 'so blurry..  sorry, but i cant imagine a playboy cover like this..', '2003-06-11 13:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(322184, 24402, 3669, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!!  Extremely gourgeous shot.  I love how the sun is peeking out from the trees and the early morning misty feeling I get looking at this.  Most definately a great cover for your magazine.  10+  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Outstanding!!  Extremely gourgeous shot.  I love how the sun is peeking out from the trees and the early morning misty feeling I get looking at this.  Most definately a great cover for your magazine.  10+  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-11 13:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(322186, 24315, 4543, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, perfect magazine cover for Sports Illustrated if the Spurs win.  Go Spurs! 10</td>', 'This is a nice shot, perfect magazine cover for Sports Illustrated if the Spurs win.  Go Spurs! 10', '2003-06-11 13:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(322190, 23988, 4122, '<td valign="top">haha...too funny!</td>', 'haha...too funny!', '2003-06-11 13:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(322191, 24218, 4543, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, very glamour, beautiful model, perfect lightning.  Keep it coming! 10</td>', 'Nice shot, very glamour, beautiful model, perfect lightning.  Keep it coming! 10', '2003-06-11 13:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(322194, 24175, 4122, '<td valign="top">WOW! amazing capture. if there would have been more light it would be perfect!</td>', 'WOW! amazing capture. if there would have been more light it would be perfect!', '2003-06-11 13:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(322197, 24343, 8178, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft, but still a beautiful shot</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft, but still a beautiful shot', '2003-06-11 13:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(322198, 24255, 8533, '<td valign="top">The cake isn''t the focus of the shot - nothing really is. There''s little of the cake to be seen from this angle. The lighting is quite pretty but the detail on all the flowers is lost and the ferns look quite messy. The background is not very good at all - I can see a stepladder! I doubt this would ever make it onto a magazine cover.</td>', 'The cake isn''t the focus of the shot - nothing really is. There''s little of the cake to be seen from this angle. The lighting is quite pretty but the detail on all the flowers is lost and the ferns look quite messy. The background is not very good at all - I can see a stepladder! I doubt this would ever make it onto a magazine cover.', '2003-06-11 13:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(322199, 24418, 8533, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clean but not especially inspiring. Fine for a magazine cover, though, as it would be much busier with the text, logo etc over it.</td>', 'Very crisp and clean but not especially inspiring. Fine for a magazine cover, though, as it would be much busier with the text, logo etc over it.', '2003-06-11 13:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(322200, 24334, 8533, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - shame his face is in profile.</td>', 'Nice shot - shame his face is in profile.', '2003-06-11 13:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(322201, 24315, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wow, an amazing shot! Clean, sharp, the sport action is well captured. The expressions on the players'' faces tell a story, which would certainly encourage me to read the accompanying feature article. Plenty of space at the top for the mag title. This is certainly something I''d expect to see on the cover of sports illustrated. A professional-looking shot.</td>', 'Wow, an amazing shot! Clean, sharp, the sport action is well captured. The expressions on the players'' faces tell a story, which would certainly encourage me to read the accompanying feature article. Plenty of space at the top for the mag title. This is certainly something I''d expect to see on the cover of sports illustrated. A professional-looking shot.', '2003-06-11 13:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(322202, 24181, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice, well-composed and creatively lit shot.  I''m not sure that the challenge meant to actually take a photograph *of* a magazine cover, though...  I''ll give it a 6 for a technically good shot, however.</td>', 'This is a really nice, well-composed and creatively lit shot.  I''m not sure that the challenge meant to actually take a photograph *of* a magazine cover, though...  I''ll give it a 6 for a technically good shot, however.', '2003-06-11 13:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(322205, 24092, 8268, '<td valign="top">very very very nice picture.. =)    how do you do that ??   i would like to know with which camera and additional lenses.. =)  very good one .. congrats..</td>', 'very very very nice picture.. =)    how do you do that ??   i would like to know with which camera and additional lenses.. =)  very good one .. congrats..', '2003-06-11 13:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(322206, 24288, 7969, '<td valign="top">hard to decide if i am voting on the sculpture or the photo--</td>', 'hard to decide if i am voting on the sculpture or the photo--', '2003-06-11 13:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(322209, 24175, 8268, '<td valign="top">wow. :o)  very interesting.. =)  congrats..</td>', 'wow. :o)  very interesting.. =)  congrats..', '2003-06-11 13:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(322212, 24281, 8178, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot... but I hate to say it, might be a teeny bit boring for a cover. Maybe it''s just me?</td>', 'Beautiful shot... but I hate to say it, might be a teeny bit boring for a cover. Maybe it''s just me?', '2003-06-11 13:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(322214, 24423, 8268, '<td valign="top">nice =)</td>', 'nice =)', '2003-06-11 13:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(322215, 24037, 9295, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but the photo doesn''t seem cropped for a magazine cover so it doesn''t quite fit the challenge for me. I also think it would have been more effective on a bright, sunny day rather than the overcast.</td>', 'Nice concept but the photo doesn''t seem cropped for a magazine cover so it doesn''t quite fit the challenge for me. I also think it would have been more effective on a bright, sunny day rather than the overcast.', '2003-06-11 13:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(322218, 24422, 8268, '<td valign="top">come on..</td>', 'come on..', '2003-06-11 13:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(322219, 24320, 8533, '<td valign="top">The main subject looks unhappy and the movement has made the focus poor. The arm at the left of the picture is distracting and the man on the right is mostly obscured. I think it''s too busy and not sharp enough to be a magazine cover, and it''s also lacking any "wow" appeal.</td>', 'The main subject looks unhappy and the movement has made the focus poor. The arm at the left of the picture is distracting and the man on the right is mostly obscured. I think it''s too busy and not sharp enough to be a magazine cover, and it''s also lacking any "wow" appeal.', '2003-06-11 13:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(322220, 23990, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good tonal skin colors, although there is some light on the top right of her face that is causing a few shadows, but I think that adds a more natural feel and it doesnt distract. The background choice/colors are bright and clean. The pose is somewhat odd but it adds a good negative space on the left for the usual magazine blurbs. The model is very pretty and certainly a face I''d expect to see on Elle. The image looks very professional. Well done.</td>', 'Good tonal skin colors, although there is some light on the top right of her face that is causing a few shadows, but I think that adds a more natural feel and it doesnt distract. The background choice/colors are bright and clean. The pose is somewhat odd but it adds a good negative space on the left for the usual magazine blurbs. The model is very pretty and certainly a face I''d expect to see on Elle. The image looks very professional. Well done.', '2003-06-11 13:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(322221, 24421, 8533, '<td valign="top">Very poor focus on the subject and the background is too vast and too dull to make it to NG as a cover.</td>', 'Very poor focus on the subject and the background is too vast and too dull to make it to NG as a cover.', '2003-06-11 13:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(322222, 24494, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo and very appropriate for your magazine cover.  The placement of the subject allows for the magazine title and article blurbs. As far as the photo itself is concerned, I particularly like the ripples of the water toward the top of the page.</td>', 'This is a nice photo and very appropriate for your magazine cover.  The placement of the subject allows for the magazine title and article blurbs. As far as the photo itself is concerned, I particularly like the ripples of the water toward the top of the page.', '2003-06-11 13:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(322223, 24293, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very good shot and definately a good cover for your magazine.  I like the clean lines and shadows.  You must have used a special filter to give the lights the star shape.  Works well here.  Also, I like how the statue at the top of the building is raising its cross to the "star" above.   Too bad the cars had to show in your picture.</td>', 'Very good shot and definately a good cover for your magazine.  I like the clean lines and shadows.  You must have used a special filter to give the lights the star shape.  Works well here.  Also, I like how the statue at the top of the building is raising its cross to the "star" above.   Too bad the cars had to show in your picture.', '2003-06-11 13:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(322224, 24372, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot - well composed.  I like the border that you''ve chosen.  It fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'Very nice shot - well composed.  I like the border that you''ve chosen.  It fits the challenge very well.', '2003-06-11 13:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(322225, 24396, 8268, '<td valign="top">nice pic.. but it would be more interesting see mushrooms without any damage</td>', 'nice pic.. but it would be more interesting see mushrooms without any damage', '2003-06-11 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(322227, 24188, 8178, '<td valign="top">Nice work! I like the lighting a lot, it really accentuates the shadows on the body. The background pattern on the wall seems a bit distracting however, a smooth backdrop and/or a shorter dof would have been better. 8</td>', 'Nice work! I like the lighting a lot, it really accentuates the shadows on the body. The background pattern on the wall seems a bit distracting however, a smooth backdrop and/or a shorter dof would have been better. 8', '2003-06-11 13:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(322229, 24188, 8268, '<td valign="top">the background could be a better one..</td>', 'the background could be a better one..', '2003-06-11 14:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(322230, 24460, 6008, '<td valign="top">Oh how I wish my house looked like this! First impressions are that it''s a clean image (and clean staircase), and very classy-looking. The curve of the staircase is appealing to the eye and something that isnt common and so it gives a sense of interest. It would certainly be a cover I''d expect to see on Home and Design and it would encourage me to read the accompanying article. The only negative is something petty, but I find the whiteness of the border makes the white in the photograph to appear somewhat duller, which is a shame because otherwise the feel is a bright, airy room.</td>', 'Oh how I wish my house looked like this! First impressions are that it''s a clean image (and clean staircase), and very classy-looking. The curve of the staircase is appealing to the eye and something that isnt common and so it gives a sense of interest. It would certainly be a cover I''d expect to see on Home and Design and it would encourage me to read the accompanying article. The only negative is something petty, but I find the whiteness of the border makes the white in the photograph to appear somewhat duller, which is a shame because otherwise the feel is a bright, airy room.', '2003-06-11 14:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(322231, 24456, 8268, '<td valign="top">eeey. nice picture  =)  congrats..   just one recommendation.. did you modify the levels ?  it seems to have too much color.. to much contrast..</td>', 'eeey. nice picture  =)  congrats..   just one recommendation.. did you modify the levels ?  it seems to have too much color.. to much contrast..', '2003-06-11 14:01:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(322232, 24513, 9295, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great accompaniament to an article within the magazine, but when I try to picture the name of the magazine across the photo, I''m afraid you would lose too much of the detail and beauty of the colors.  Perhaps different cropping might have made it more suitable for the cover.  I love the colors.</td>', 'This looks like a great accompaniament to an article within the magazine, but when I try to picture the name of the magazine across the photo, I''m afraid you would lose too much of the detail and beauty of the colors.  Perhaps different cropping might have made it more suitable for the cover.  I love the colors.', '2003-06-11 14:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(322233, 24443, 8268, '<td valign="top">too small</td>', 'too small', '2003-06-11 14:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(322234, 24409, 9295, '<td valign="top">Different cropping might have allowed me to see it differently, but it just doesn''t look like a magazine cover to me.</td>', 'Different cropping might have allowed me to see it differently, but it just doesn''t look like a magazine cover to me.', '2003-06-11 14:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(322235, 24338, 8178, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! I like how the flag is perfectly in focus inside the drops. Great execution of an old idea.</td>', 'Cool shot! I like how the flag is perfectly in focus inside the drops. Great execution of an old idea.', '2003-06-11 14:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(322237, 24464, 8268, '<td valign="top">wow..  superb !  i just love this photo..  where and how do you do that ? i would like to know and learn.. =)     congrats.. definitly a good one. =)</td>', 'wow..  superb !  i just love this photo..  where and how do you do that ? i would like to know and learn.. =)     congrats.. definitly a good one. =)', '2003-06-11 14:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(322238, 23968, 6520, '<td valign="top">you recieve top honors 10</td>', 'you recieve top honors 10', '2003-06-11 14:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(322241, 24188, 6008, '<td valign="top">Yum! The shadows really enhance the six-pack and the choice of black and white helps with the mood. Having the face not be the main focus works, especially as the magazine is promoting health and fitness. There is enough space around the image for the magainze blurbs and I could really see this on the front cover on Men''s Fitness. The only negative is the over exposed area to the side of his shoulder.</td>', 'Yum! The shadows really enhance the six-pack and the choice of black and white helps with the mood. Having the face not be the main focus works, especially as the magazine is promoting health and fitness. There is enough space around the image for the magainze blurbs and I could really see this on the front cover on Men''s Fitness. The only negative is the over exposed area to the side of his shoulder.', '2003-06-11 14:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(322242, 24210, 2560, '<td valign="top">This could use a little bit more space on the left and recomposed without the bar in the lower right corner.  still a good shot.</td>', 'This could use a little bit more space on the left and recomposed without the bar in the lower right corner.  still a good shot.', '2003-06-11 14:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(322244, 24424, 9295, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo but doesn''t look like a magazine cover.  The shadow side of the strawberry seems a little too dark to me. Instead of it being the focus as it should, my eye is drawn more to the woman holding it than to the fruit itself.</td>', 'An interesting photo but doesn''t look like a magazine cover.  The shadow side of the strawberry seems a little too dark to me. Instead of it being the focus as it should, my eye is drawn more to the woman holding it than to the fruit itself.', '2003-06-11 14:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(322245, 24140, 8178, '<td valign="top">The cigar seems to blend right in to the stand. I would have liked a bit more of a contrast</td>', 'The cigar seems to blend right in to the stand. I would have liked a bit more of a contrast', '2003-06-11 14:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(322246, 24366, 8268, '<td valign="top">nice pic.. =)</td>', 'nice pic.. =)', '2003-06-11 14:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(322247, 24465, 8268, '<td valign="top">lovely photo.. =)   congrats.. =)</td>', 'lovely photo.. =)   congrats.. =)', '2003-06-11 14:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(322248, 24201, 9295, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I really like it, but it''s not cropped as a magazine cover shot so I have to take a few points off for that.</td>', 'Nice photo. I really like it, but it''s not cropped as a magazine cover shot so I have to take a few points off for that.', '2003-06-11 14:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(322249, 24080, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot - it would make a nice calendar photo.  I''d like a couple of puffy white clouds to balance out the blue sky, I think.  But overall very lovely.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot - it would make a nice calendar photo.  I''d like a couple of puffy white clouds to balance out the blue sky, I think.  But overall very lovely.', '2003-06-11 14:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(322250, 24369, 3669, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the haze that appears in this photo.  An empty baseball field just doesn''t yell magazine cover material to me.  Plus the angle of the shot appears off.  Plus, in this particuliar photo, the baseball diamond seems off.  Perhaps taking it on the 3rd base line or even home plate instead of outfield and getting the entire diamond in would make it better.  Keep shooting!  :-)  By the way, my sense of distance might be off, but is this a Little League field?</td>', 'I don''t like the haze that appears in this photo.  An empty baseball field just doesn''t yell magazine cover material to me.  Plus the angle of the shot appears off.  Plus, in this particuliar photo, the baseball diamond seems off.  Perhaps taking it on the 3rd base line or even home plate instead of outfield and getting the entire diamond in would make it better.  Keep shooting!  :-)  By the way, my sense of distance might be off, but is this a Little League field?', '2003-06-11 14:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(322251, 24396, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - fantastic shot!  Great macro work!  10</td>', 'Wow - fantastic shot!  Great macro work!  10', '2003-06-11 14:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(322252, 24288, 3697, '<td valign="top">Black and white was a great choice, and the lighting is fantastic. Awesome contrast between the black background and the white/grey of the statue.</td>', 'Black and white was a great choice, and the lighting is fantastic. Awesome contrast between the black background and the white/grey of the statue.', '2003-06-11 14:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(322253, 24401, 5391, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.  If we were allowed, I''d clone out that little imperfection just to the left of the subject.  But wonderful, clean, whites and beautiful color tones.  8</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.  If we were allowed, I''d clone out that little imperfection just to the left of the subject.  But wonderful, clean, whites and beautiful color tones.  8', '2003-06-11 14:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(322254, 24459, 8268, '<td valign="top">wow.. very interesting one.. =)</td>', 'wow.. very interesting one.. =)', '2003-06-11 14:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(322255, 24140, 6008, '<td valign="top">Simple and classy. I have no idea if that''s a good brand of cigar or not, but it''s something I''m sure would appear on your chosen magazine. I think the cigar is on some bark or maybe it''s the leaves or something, but whatever it is I like the texture and color, very complimentary to the cigar. The trail of smoke leads upwards to where I assume the title would be. Great image!</td>', 'Simple and classy. I have no idea if that''s a good brand of cigar or not, but it''s something I''m sure would appear on your chosen magazine. I think the cigar is on some bark or maybe it''s the leaves or something, but whatever it is I like the texture and color, very complimentary to the cigar. The trail of smoke leads upwards to where I assume the title would be. Great image!', '2003-06-11 14:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(322257, 24421, 5391, '<td valign="top">Since the insect is the subject, having a bit sharper focus would help.  Perhaps a tripod?</td>', 'Since the insect is the subject, having a bit sharper focus would help.  Perhaps a tripod?', '2003-06-11 14:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(322260, 24465, 9295, '<td valign="top">I can definitely see this as a magazine cover.  You have allowed room for the wording that would appear on the front and your shot certainly pertains to the content of the magazine.  The amber behind the silhouette of the grass is very beautiful.</td>', 'I can definitely see this as a magazine cover.  You have allowed room for the wording that would appear on the front and your shot certainly pertains to the content of the magazine.  The amber behind the silhouette of the grass is very beautiful.', '2003-06-11 14:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(322261, 24218, 8268, '<td valign="top">wojow.. =) very nice shoot.. =)</td>', 'wojow.. =) very nice shoot.. =)', '2003-06-11 14:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(322262, 24464, 8178, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silouette! 9</td>', 'Beautiful silouette! 9', '2003-06-11 14:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(322263, 24312, 3697, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of DOF, and the focus is tack sharp. Very nice entry.</td>', 'Excellent use of DOF, and the focus is tack sharp. Very nice entry.', '2003-06-11 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(322266, 24210, 9295, '<td valign="top">As a magazine cover, this fits the bill. You leave space for the title and article information but your focal point is bright and clear and lets the viewrer know the content of the magazine right off the bat.</td>', 'As a magazine cover, this fits the bill. You leave space for the title and article information but your focal point is bright and clear and lets the viewrer know the content of the magazine right off the bat.', '2003-06-11 14:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(322269, 24312, 6008, '<td valign="top">Great image! The expression on her face is good and the stop action is clean but obviously you can see the motion without needing any blur. The composition is great with an appropriate dof. I''m sure I would be encourged to read the accompanying article. It seems the sky wasnt working for you, but as a magazine cover it makes a great place to put the title so wouldnt be detrimental to the image at all.</td>', 'Great image! The expression on her face is good and the stop action is clean but obviously you can see the motion without needing any blur. The composition is great with an appropriate dof. I''m sure I would be encourged to read the accompanying article. It seems the sky wasnt working for you, but as a magazine cover it makes a great place to put the title so wouldnt be detrimental to the image at all.', '2003-06-11 14:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(322272, 24313, 9295, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t feel like a magazine cover photo. It''s not very eye-catching and it feels too cluttered for this challenge concept.  Instead of telling me this magazine is about Photography, my attention is drawn more to the guy''s rugby shirt since it''s really the only vivid color in the shot.</td>', 'It doesn''t feel like a magazine cover photo. It''s not very eye-catching and it feels too cluttered for this challenge concept.  Instead of telling me this magazine is about Photography, my attention is drawn more to the guy''s rugby shirt since it''s really the only vivid color in the shot.', '2003-06-11 14:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(322275, 24325, 9295, '<td valign="top">Because of the cropping, this feels more like an accompanying article photo than the magazine cover shot.  I like the sub-heading though.  Cute.</td>', 'Because of the cropping, this feels more like an accompanying article photo than the magazine cover shot.  I like the sub-heading though.  Cute.', '2003-06-11 14:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(322277, 24442, 6008, '<td valign="top">Great capture! The sports action and closeness of this shot is amazing. If he had been looking toward the camera with a neat expression it would have been even better, but you have to work with what you are given in these situations. I could easily see this on the front of the magazine. The only negative is that the colors look a little dull and flat, but looking at the sky it would seem you had a cold, dull day to shoot. Again, you have to work with what you got and what you got is pretty good!</td>', 'Great capture! The sports action and closeness of this shot is amazing. If he had been looking toward the camera with a neat expression it would have been even better, but you have to work with what you are given in these situations. I could easily see this on the front of the magazine. The only negative is that the colors look a little dull and flat, but looking at the sky it would seem you had a cold, dull day to shoot. Again, you have to work with what you got and what you got is pretty good!', '2003-06-11 14:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(322278, 24049, 8178, '<td valign="top">Good job. Needs a little more head room, I think</td>', 'Good job. Needs a little more head room, I think', '2003-06-11 14:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(322279, 24075, 5391, '<td valign="top">Good action shot.  Works well with the challenge.  7</td>', 'Good action shot.  Works well with the challenge.  7', '2003-06-11 14:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(322286, 23993, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  It would look great as a magazine cover because of the placement on the page, but also because the colors and textures are so vivid.  It would have been nice had a little bug not gotten to the leaves since I would think a gardening magazine of any kind would try to feature a near-perfect plant on their cover...unless of course the cover article is about how to deal with plant-eating bugs. LOL  Anyway, I think you fit the criteria of the challenge very nicely with this shot.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  It would look great as a magazine cover because of the placement on the page, but also because the colors and textures are so vivid.  It would have been nice had a little bug not gotten to the leaves since I would think a gardening magazine of any kind would try to feature a near-perfect plant on their cover...unless of course the cover article is about how to deal with plant-eating bugs. LOL  Anyway, I think you fit the criteria of the challenge very nicely with this shot.', '2003-06-11 14:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(322289, 24354, 5391, '<td valign="top">10.  Great shot, conveys a message as well as being technically well done and visually appealing.  Congrats!</td>', '10.  Great shot, conveys a message as well as being technically well done and visually appealing.  Congrats!', '2003-06-11 14:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(322291, 24140, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo that really fits the challenge... plenty of space for type, very well done.  Not sure I would have put the black border, but I don''t think it detracts substantially from the photo... The whisps of smoke produced by the cigar are pretty much "picture perfect"  very nicely done!</td>', 'This is a great photo that really fits the challenge... plenty of space for type, very well done.  Not sure I would have put the black border, but I don''t think it detracts substantially from the photo... The whisps of smoke produced by the cigar are pretty much "picture perfect"  very nicely done!', '2003-06-11 14:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(322295, 24289, 8760, '<td valign="top">Very funny !!! great Idea !....good photoshop work !</td>', 'Very funny !!! great Idea !....good photoshop work !', '2003-06-11 14:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(322296, 24354, 9295, '<td valign="top">Great concept, but to work as a magazine cover, you might have to rethink your placement of the rolls of film in proximity to the disk.  I know it may seem like I''m being too picky, but when I look at the shot, the first thing I''m thinking of is "would this work as a magazine cover?"  Once you add the words that appear on any magazine cover, it might not work as it is.  However, I do like the shot a lot, especially since you created something that fits neatly into your article title.</td>', 'Great concept, but to work as a magazine cover, you might have to rethink your placement of the rolls of film in proximity to the disk.  I know it may seem like I''m being too picky, but when I look at the shot, the first thing I''m thinking of is "would this work as a magazine cover?"  Once you add the words that appear on any magazine cover, it might not work as it is.  However, I do like the shot a lot, especially since you created something that fits neatly into your article title.', '2003-06-11 14:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(322297, 24140, 5391, '<td valign="top">Perfection!  I used to subscribe to this magazine, actually.  I can definitely see this - if not on their cover, at least inside somewhere.  Gorgeous lighting, fantastic composition, beautiful rich tones.  Makes me want to light up a stogie and have a good glass of single malt.  :)  10</td>', 'Perfection!  I used to subscribe to this magazine, actually.  I can definitely see this - if not on their cover, at least inside somewhere.  Gorgeous lighting, fantastic composition, beautiful rich tones.  Makes me want to light up a stogie and have a good glass of single malt.  :)  10', '2003-06-11 14:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(322298, 24030, 5391, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all!  I can see this on their cover.  Good job!</td>', 'Not bad at all!  I can see this on their cover.  Good job!', '2003-06-11 14:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(322300, 24460, 6900, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Could have used a plethora of titles for this one.  Good natural lighting, awesome composition.  I would have put a bit more or a bit less of that archway on the left.  9</td>', 'Nice shot!  Could have used a plethora of titles for this one.  Good natural lighting, awesome composition.  I would have put a bit more or a bit less of that archway on the left.  9', '2003-06-11 14:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(322302, 24056, 6008, '<td valign="top">Hrm, a flower picture (just kidding!) I really like this, it has great color and nicely sharp. The plain black background compliments it well and works as a format for a magazine. The tonal range of the petals is wonderful. The farthest right petal is a little soft, but it''s only really noticable because my eye seemed to get drawn to it moreso than the others. It''s something I would expect to see on the front cover of a gardening magazine. Well done</td>', 'Hrm, a flower picture (just kidding!) I really like this, it has great color and nicely sharp. The plain black background compliments it well and works as a format for a magazine. The tonal range of the petals is wonderful. The farthest right petal is a little soft, but it''s only really noticable because my eye seemed to get drawn to it moreso than the others. It''s something I would expect to see on the front cover of a gardening magazine. Well done', '2003-06-11 14:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(322303, 24035, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty photo, but I can''t see it as a magazine cover. Maybe if you had cropped it differently, but as it is, it doesn''t work for me.  I do like the interesting perspective of the birds and the blueness of the sky.</td>', 'This is a pretty photo, but I can''t see it as a magazine cover. Maybe if you had cropped it differently, but as it is, it doesn''t work for me.  I do like the interesting perspective of the birds and the blueness of the sky.', '2003-06-11 14:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(322305, 24464, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Cover material, definitely.  I particularly love the little bright spot under the arm.  This is a winner!  10</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Cover material, definitely.  I particularly love the little bright spot under the arm.  This is a winner!  10', '2003-06-11 14:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(322306, 24464, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful. The torquoise sky and softness of the shadowed hills is wonderful.  This is the first 10 I''ve given today. I''m not a photographer, but I know what I like!</td>', 'This is just beautiful. The torquoise sky and softness of the shadowed hills is wonderful.  This is the first 10 I''ve given today. I''m not a photographer, but I know what I like!', '2003-06-11 14:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(322308, 24442, 8178, '<td valign="top">This one is a winner for me. 10</td>', 'This one is a winner for me. 10', '2003-06-11 14:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(322311, 24339, 9295, '<td valign="top">Although not something I can see on the cover of a magazine, there''s something about this photo I just like.  I guess it''s the human interest element.</td>', 'Although not something I can see on the cover of a magazine, there''s something about this photo I just like.  I guess it''s the human interest element.', '2003-06-11 14:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(322316, 24282, 6008, '<td valign="top">There is certainly a great mood from this, a varied range of emotions. The image itself is good, powerful, and dramatic. It''s certainly something I''d expect to see on a magazine cover. The flames in the background are really effective, certainly adding to the drama. The helmet is a little dark, I''d probably like it a little lighter, but it''s more sombre dark. The flame on the right is a little distracting, but it also causes me to wonder how the image was taken. A ring of fire around the helmet in the center? The flames seem to be high and scary so I hope the owner of the helmet was around to aid you with them after the shots were taken. Great image!</td>', 'There is certainly a great mood from this, a varied range of emotions. The image itself is good, powerful, and dramatic. It''s certainly something I''d expect to see on a magazine cover. The flames in the background are really effective, certainly adding to the drama. The helmet is a little dark, I''d probably like it a little lighter, but it''s more sombre dark. The flame on the right is a little distracting, but it also causes me to wonder how the image was taken. A ring of fire around the helmet in the center? The flames seem to be high and scary so I hope the owner of the helmet was around to aid you with them after the shots were taken. Great image!', '2003-06-11 14:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(322322, 24269, 6008, '<td valign="top">Great image! The range of expressions on the faces really tells a story. A mixture of nerves and excitement but the middle lady seems very calm and reflective. This serves as a great introduction to an accompanying article. I''d certainly expect to see this on the front of a magazine. Wonderful photojournalism.</td>', 'Great image! The range of expressions on the faces really tells a story. A mixture of nerves and excitement but the middle lady seems very calm and reflective. This serves as a great introduction to an accompanying article. I''d certainly expect to see this on the front of a magazine. Wonderful photojournalism.', '2003-06-11 14:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(322323, 24390, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful.</td>', 'This is really beautiful.', '2003-06-11 14:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(322326, 23934, 9295, '<td valign="top">I think this is an amazing photo. It truly captured my eye when I looked at it on the gallery page.</td>', 'I think this is an amazing photo. It truly captured my eye when I looked at it on the gallery page.', '2003-06-11 14:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(322328, 23983, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image is very small and the photograph itself is very blurry. It looks almost like a photograph of a book. It doesnt look to be straight and so the background can be seen on the top left and it''s a little distracting. There also appears to be shadows across the image. I''m assuming you have a lower-end camera, and some things you could do to improve an image like this would be to use more natural light in order to help your camera focus more and thus get a more clearer image. It could also be that you held or had the book too close to the camera and the macro capabilities of your camera wasnt able to focus so close.</td>', 'The image is very small and the photograph itself is very blurry. It looks almost like a photograph of a book. It doesnt look to be straight and so the background can be seen on the top left and it''s a little distracting. There also appears to be shadows across the image. I''m assuming you have a lower-end camera, and some things you could do to improve an image like this would be to use more natural light in order to help your camera focus more and thus get a more clearer image. It could also be that you held or had the book too close to the camera and the macro capabilities of your camera wasnt able to focus so close.', '2003-06-11 14:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(322330, 24234, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting you chose to use.</td>', 'I like the lighting you chose to use.', '2003-06-11 14:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(322331, 24513, 1717, '<td valign="top">this is lovely!  maybe just a tad bit oversaturated, but it''s very nice.  good work.</td>', 'this is lovely!  maybe just a tad bit oversaturated, but it''s very nice.  good work.', '2003-06-11 14:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(322332, 24343, 6172, '<td valign="top">Poorly focused</td>', 'Poorly focused', '2003-06-11 14:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(322333, 24432, 9295, '<td valign="top">Much too dark. I can barely see your subject.</td>', 'Much too dark. I can barely see your subject.', '2003-06-11 14:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(322334, 24115, 9295, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good photo for your magazine, but it needs to be cropped differently to be a cover photo.</td>', 'I think this is a good photo for your magazine, but it needs to be cropped differently to be a cover photo.', '2003-06-11 14:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(322335, 24437, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice (hot!) model.  Very questionable composition, there isn''t room for the title at the top.  The lighting on the left side of her body isn''t good.</td>', 'Very nice (hot!) model.  Very questionable composition, there isn''t room for the title at the top.  The lighting on the left side of her body isn''t good.', '2003-06-11 14:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(322336, 24422, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image quality doesnt appear to be that good, quite possible because of the resolution of your camera - there is some fuzziness to the image. It looks like you may have taken the shot under a tree or some cover and I think that caused the darker image which in made it more difficult for your camera to focus well. The roof of the building in the background is a little distracting and would probably be better had there been more of it or cropped out completely. The pose he is in suggests reflection and some broodiness, and I think given better lightning this could have been a dramatic shot.</td>', 'The image quality doesnt appear to be that good, quite possible because of the resolution of your camera - there is some fuzziness to the image. It looks like you may have taken the shot under a tree or some cover and I think that caused the darker image which in made it more difficult for your camera to focus well. The roof of the building in the background is a little distracting and would probably be better had there been more of it or cropped out completely. The pose he is in suggests reflection and some broodiness, and I think given better lightning this could have been a dramatic shot.', '2003-06-11 14:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(322337, 24489, 1717, '<td valign="top">very cool photo...i like the high key lighting.  good job!</td>', 'very cool photo...i like the high key lighting.  good job!', '2003-06-11 14:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(322339, 24076, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is great!</td>', 'This is great!', '2003-06-11 14:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(322340, 24200, 6172, '<td valign="top">Photos is a bit overexposed.  There isn''t room at the top for the magazine title.  Otherwise the photo is very good.</td>', 'Photos is a bit overexposed.  There isn''t room at the top for the magazine title.  Otherwise the photo is very good.', '2003-06-11 14:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(322341, 24518, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is very out of focus. I don''t know if you intended it to be that way but it''s distracting to me.</td>', 'This is very out of focus. I don''t know if you intended it to be that way but it''s distracting to me.', '2003-06-11 14:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(322342, 24286, 6172, '<td valign="top">Too dark, hands are too blurry.</td>', 'Too dark, hands are too blurry.', '2003-06-11 14:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(322343, 24190, 9295, '<td valign="top">What a great photo!  Very interesting and I can easily see it as a covershot.</td>', 'What a great photo!  Very interesting and I can easily see it as a covershot.', '2003-06-11 14:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(322347, 24504, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is another one of my favorites. My goodness, look at that face. This is exactly the kind of photo you would see  on this magazine. It instantly gives you the warm fuzzies.  I wish you had a more vivid background though.  The tan of the crib and light wall keeps his head from standing out more.  But what a smile!!! You shot it at the perfect moment!</td>', 'This is another one of my favorites. My goodness, look at that face. This is exactly the kind of photo you would see  on this magazine. It instantly gives you the warm fuzzies.  I wish you had a more vivid background though.  The tan of the crib and light wall keeps his head from standing out more.  But what a smile!!! You shot it at the perfect moment!', '2003-06-11 14:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(322348, 24503, 5364, '<td valign="top">Strange looking bird, but a good picture none the less.</td>', 'Strange looking bird, but a good picture none the less.', '2003-06-11 14:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(322349, 24422, 9295, '<td valign="top">The subject is too dark and doesn''t seem to fit with your magazine...Cosmo? As in Cosmopolitan?  It doesn''t look like a cover shot that I would see on any magazine, but certainly not Cosmo.  Sorry. Just my opinion.</td>', 'The subject is too dark and doesn''t seem to fit with your magazine...Cosmo? As in Cosmopolitan?  It doesn''t look like a cover shot that I would see on any magazine, but certainly not Cosmo.  Sorry. Just my opinion.', '2003-06-11 14:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(322351, 24297, 9295, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I like the brightness of the sky in contrast with the color of the house. I think it would have worked better had you either centered the house or had it more to the right than the left. With the taller of the trees also being on the left, it makes that side of the page a little heavy compared to the right.  Otherwise, a nice photo.</td>', 'Very pretty. I like the brightness of the sky in contrast with the color of the house. I think it would have worked better had you either centered the house or had it more to the right than the left. With the taller of the trees also being on the left, it makes that side of the page a little heavy compared to the right.  Otherwise, a nice photo.', '2003-06-11 14:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(322353, 24315, 4493, '<td valign="top">From the DOF to the stopped action, to the intensity on the player''s faces, this is what this site is all about. You have created a pro shot that would do well on ANY sports magazine! 10 -danny</td>', 'From the DOF to the stopped action, to the intensity on the player''s faces, this is what this site is all about. You have created a pro shot that would do well on ANY sports magazine! 10 -danny', '2003-06-11 14:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(322354, 24372, 9295, '<td valign="top">I almost feel like I''ve actually seen this shot on NG before, it''s that believeable as a cover photo for that magazine.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I almost feel like I''ve actually seen this shot on NG before, it''s that believeable as a cover photo for that magazine.  Nicely done!', '2003-06-11 14:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(322357, 24415, 9295, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-06-11 15:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(322358, 24362, 7033, '<td valign="top">Definitely a beautiful shot... I especially like the sharp lighting on the greens with the soft, misty scenery in the distance.  While it''s not necessarily a factor in my evaluation, I''m afraid the portrait vs. landscape orientation issue may cost you points.</td>', 'Definitely a beautiful shot... I especially like the sharp lighting on the greens with the soft, misty scenery in the distance.  While it''s not necessarily a factor in my evaluation, I''m afraid the portrait vs. landscape orientation issue may cost you points.', '2003-06-11 15:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(322360, 24150, 4967, '<td valign="top">Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  Some great colors in here... but it looks tilted... also are those powerlines running through the photo?  That''s really distracting... I hope you didn''t look directly at the sun.</td>', 'Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  Some great colors in here... but it looks tilted... also are those powerlines running through the photo?  That''s really distracting... I hope you didn''t look directly at the sun.', '2003-06-11 15:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(322361, 24320, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is very dark.</td>', 'This is very dark.', '2003-06-11 15:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(322362, 24032, 4967, '<td valign="top">Imaginative and nicely done.  I really actually like this... it fits the theme... it works... nicely done.  Not sure I care for the border, but I''m not usually big on borders...</td>', 'Imaginative and nicely done.  I really actually like this... it fits the theme... it works... nicely done.  Not sure I care for the border, but I''m not usually big on borders...', '2003-06-11 15:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(322363, 24437, 7033, '<td valign="top">I could definitely see this on the cover...  A couple of small issues you could address and improve the shot would be the blown-out crests of the breaking waves and the dark shadow across your model''s face.  While the highlight issue is a bit more difficult to address, you could possibly use a bit of fill flash to fix the problem with the shadows.</td>', 'I could definitely see this on the cover...  A couple of small issues you could address and improve the shot would be the blown-out crests of the breaking waves and the dark shadow across your model''s face.  While the highlight issue is a bit more difficult to address, you could possibly use a bit of fill flash to fix the problem with the shadows.', '2003-06-11 15:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(322366, 24407, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool, almost doesn''t look like a photograph.  What are the red splotches here and there?  the black on the bottom right is kind of annoying... I think cropping that out would have made it more of a vertical photo and fit it better to the theme.  Not sure I care for the border, but I''m not usually big on borders.</td>', 'This is pretty cool, almost doesn''t look like a photograph.  What are the red splotches here and there?  the black on the bottom right is kind of annoying... I think cropping that out would have made it more of a vertical photo and fit it better to the theme.  Not sure I care for the border, but I''m not usually big on borders.', '2003-06-11 15:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(322367, 24457, 4967, '<td valign="top">Some of the colors here are extremely dull.  It looks to me like you cropped quite a bit because there is so much grain.  The bird just kind of melts right into the background... it would have been nice if he popped a little.  Not extremely interesting, but it fits the theme, and a good catch.</td>', 'Some of the colors here are extremely dull.  It looks to me like you cropped quite a bit because there is so much grain.  The bird just kind of melts right into the background... it would have been nice if he popped a little.  Not extremely interesting, but it fits the theme, and a good catch.', '2003-06-11 15:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(322368, 24116, 4967, '<td valign="top">The bright white behind the BUSHNELL on the telescope is very annoying, it totally draws my eye from the main point to it... I think I would have used a lighter colored background... because the wine color is almost similar to the telescope, and it makes the telescope blend in. Watch your reflections.</td>', 'The bright white behind the BUSHNELL on the telescope is very annoying, it totally draws my eye from the main point to it... I think I would have used a lighter colored background... because the wine color is almost similar to the telescope, and it makes the telescope blend in. Watch your reflections.', '2003-06-11 15:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(322369, 24140, 9295, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting on this photo. It really highlights your subject.  I can easily see it as a magazine cover since you have left plenty of room for title and article information. I didn''t notice the smoke coming off the cigar at first but it''s a cool little detail that adds interest.  A very nice shot. One of my favorites!</td>', 'I love the lighting on this photo. It really highlights your subject.  I can easily see it as a magazine cover since you have left plenty of room for title and article information. I didn''t notice the smoke coming off the cigar at first but it''s a cool little detail that adds interest.  A very nice shot. One of my favorites!', '2003-06-11 15:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(322371, 24463, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this... looks very professional.  Nicely done with the area at the top for text.  I could definitely see this as the front of a magazine.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this... looks very professional.  Nicely done with the area at the top for text.  I could definitely see this as the front of a magazine.  Good luck.', '2003-06-11 15:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(322372, 24506, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think you would have been better with a different background- something a bit lighter than black. Otherwise a well done picture.</td>', 'I think you would have been better with a different background- something a bit lighter than black. Otherwise a well done picture.', '2003-06-11 15:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(322373, 24457, 9295, '<td valign="top">I wish this were a little brighter.  IT seems a little dark for a magazine cover.</td>', 'I wish this were a little brighter.  IT seems a little dark for a magazine cover.', '2003-06-11 15:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(322374, 24293, 9295, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. It''s very nice.</td>', 'I really like this photo. It''s very nice.', '2003-06-11 15:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
