(322383, 24327, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been a better picture without the big red truck dominating tha background.</td>', 'I think it would have been a better picture without the big red truck dominating tha background.', '2003-06-11 15:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(322384, 24442, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great stop action shot... unfortunately the subject doesn''t quite look in focus... looks like your focus is on the background and not the guy... You could definitely put wording at the bottom of this, if this was in focus it would have been great.</td>', 'Great stop action shot... unfortunately the subject doesn''t quite look in focus... looks like your focus is on the background and not the guy... You could definitely put wording at the bottom of this, if this was in focus it would have been great.', '2003-06-11 15:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(322386, 24487, 8171, '<td valign="top">I like this and think it suits the mag, the only thing that bothers me is whether or not there would be room for the title.  Good work all the same though, and a 7 for me.</td>', 'I like this and think it suits the mag, the only thing that bothers me is whether or not there would be room for the title.  Good work all the same though, and a 7 for me.', '2003-06-11 15:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(322387, 24430, 4967, '<td valign="top">We''ve seen this girl before haven''t we?  Very nice portrait, well done.  I think it fills the frame almost too much, and I''m not sure where you would put any type.  This is kind of a problem for magazine.  Also the hands lose a little bit of definition especially the far one... it''s almost too bright.</td>', 'We''ve seen this girl before haven''t we?  Very nice portrait, well done.  I think it fills the frame almost too much, and I''m not sure where you would put any type.  This is kind of a problem for magazine.  Also the hands lose a little bit of definition especially the far one... it''s almost too bright.', '2003-06-11 15:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(322388, 24485, 8171, '<td valign="top">I like this - an appealing image and plenty of room for type - an 8 for me.</td>', 'I like this - an appealing image and plenty of room for type - an 8 for me.', '2003-06-11 15:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(322391, 24173, 8171, '<td valign="top">A good one this - good, simple tones that I think would be saleable. Good work.</td>', 'A good one this - good, simple tones that I think would be saleable. Good work.', '2003-06-11 15:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(322394, 24056, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful... very professional looking.  I like the way you have it on a black background.  Everything is perfectly in focus, Very well done.  I could definitely see this on the front of the magazine you chose after going and looking at the website you posted.  However, I think you should have thought more about putting the border as it doesn''t look to me like the magazine has a border on it... it goes all the way to the edges except for maybe just at the top.  Beautiful photo though!  I''m noting the border, but I''ve decided not to take away from your score because of it.  -10- I think you should think about submitting this to that magazine... :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'This is beautiful... very professional looking.  I like the way you have it on a black background.  Everything is perfectly in focus, Very well done.  I could definitely see this on the front of the magazine you chose after going and looking at the website you posted.  However, I think you should have thought more about putting the border as it doesn''t look to me like the magazine has a border on it... it goes all the way to the edges except for maybe just at the top.  Beautiful photo though!  I''m noting the border, but I''ve decided not to take away from your score because of it.  -10- I think you should think about submitting this to that magazine... :-)  Good luck.', '2003-06-11 15:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(322396, 24442, 8171, '<td valign="top">Like this and would of even more if there had been more room for the mag title.  Well done.</td>', 'Like this and would of even more if there had been more room for the mag title.  Well done.', '2003-06-11 15:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(322397, 24459, 4967, '<td valign="top">Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  I can''t really see this as the front of a magazine... I''m not sure what the thing is on the bottom of the photo... I''m guessing it''s a homeless person?  Also the way you took the photo is kind of akward... not sure if it is the best way for the situation.  Interesting statement though.</td>', 'Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  I can''t really see this as the front of a magazine... I''m not sure what the thing is on the bottom of the photo... I''m guessing it''s a homeless person?  Also the way you took the photo is kind of akward... not sure if it is the best way for the situation.  Interesting statement though.', '2003-06-11 15:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(322400, 24076, 4967, '<td valign="top">Have we seen this windmill before?  Or just one similar to it?  I like this, I could see it as a cover of a magazine.  The colors are somewhat dull but I think it fits this photo well.  Plenty of room for the type, I could see the Eco to the left of the windmill and the Living to the right... or something like that.  Not extremely interesting, but it fits the subject and works well.  Good luck.</td>', 'Have we seen this windmill before?  Or just one similar to it?  I like this, I could see it as a cover of a magazine.  The colors are somewhat dull but I think it fits this photo well.  Plenty of room for the type, I could see the Eco to the left of the windmill and the Living to the right... or something like that.  Not extremely interesting, but it fits the subject and works well.  Good luck.', '2003-06-11 15:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
