(322409, 24201, 1005, '<td valign="top">Geez, it took me a while to get the connection between retired people and that this ship is mothballed (retired, too).  Very good photo, too bad about the clouds, esp. the washed out section.  The ship is nice.  Good color.  The portrait issue might bump your score down (not here!).  I''ll go an 8.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Geez, it took me a while to get the connection between retired people and that this ship is mothballed (retired, too).  Very good photo, too bad about the clouds, esp. the washed out section.  The ship is nice.  Good color.  The portrait issue might bump your score down (not here!).  I''ll go an 8.  Rob the Swash', '2003-06-11 15:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
