(322481, 24325, 4967, '<td valign="top">Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  I think that the point was to make a photo that fit a magazine, not a magazine and subject that fit a photo, IMHO... this is cute... but I think without your "we let the cat out of the bag..." part, this would not have made much sense, and would have been just a pointless ruse to photograph yet another pet.  Sorry to be harsh, but if you had wanted to use your cat, I would have gone with some type of a cat magazine.  The harsh lighting and shadow on this is rather bothersome... and I don''t think this would work as a cover.</td>', 'Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  I think that the point was to make a photo that fit a magazine, not a magazine and subject that fit a photo, IMHO... this is cute... but I think without your "we let the cat out of the bag..." part, this would not have made much sense, and would have been just a pointless ruse to photograph yet another pet.  Sorry to be harsh, but if you had wanted to use your cat, I would have gone with some type of a cat magazine.  The harsh lighting and shadow on this is rather bothersome... and I don''t think this would work as a cover.', '2003-06-11 16:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
