(322550, 24123, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely coloring and lighting - it might even be better if perhaps you only had one of the figures - keeping with minimalism for this shot.  But technically very well done!</td>', 'Lovely coloring and lighting - it might even be better if perhaps you only had one of the figures - keeping with minimalism for this shot.  But technically very well done!', '2003-06-11 17:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
