(322567, 24428, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is much too tiny to see much detail.  I also can''t tell if it''s sharp or not, I''m sure it is, but I just can''t tell.  I''m not sure if The Face is a magazine, I can find Face magazine... but not The Face.  I''m not doubting it is, I just have no clue what the magazine is about so I can''t accurately judge if this photo would be good for the front of it or not.</td>', 'This is much too tiny to see much detail.  I also can''t tell if it''s sharp or not, I''m sure it is, but I just can''t tell.  I''m not sure if The Face is a magazine, I can find Face magazine... but not The Face.  I''m not doubting it is, I just have no clue what the magazine is about so I can''t accurately judge if this photo would be good for the front of it or not.', '2003-06-11 17:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(322569, 24035, 4967, '<td valign="top">Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  Interesting.. I guess it''s definitely the sky with some birds in it.  I would have upped my shutter speed a bit so that the right hand bird wouldn''t have had a blurry wing.  Also the random wing coming in at the top left is bothersome.</td>', 'Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  Interesting.. I guess it''s definitely the sky with some birds in it.  I would have upped my shutter speed a bit so that the right hand bird wouldn''t have had a blurry wing.  Also the random wing coming in at the top left is bothersome.', '2003-06-11 17:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
