(322571, 24528, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure this is not what the magazine is about.  I don''t think this fits... sorry bout that... In terms of a snapshot, hey it''s nice... I''m sure the couple wouldn''t mind having it on their wall...</td>', 'I''m pretty sure this is not what the magazine is about.  I don''t think this fits... sorry bout that... In terms of a snapshot, hey it''s nice... I''m sure the couple wouldn''t mind having it on their wall...', '2003-06-11 17:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
