(322578, 23951, 8140, '<td valign="top">face looks like out of focus. composition is ok, but also head is overexposed and also pants &amp; t-shirt, you should try to make some exposure compesation or to fix the exposure. = 4</td>', 'face looks like out of focus. composition is ok, but also head is overexposed and also pants & t-shirt, you should try to make some exposure compesation or to fix the exposure. = 4', '2003-06-11 17:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(322579, 24465, 9262, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot. I like the foreground framing of the sunset.</td>', 'Very pretty shot. I like the foreground framing of the sunset.', '2003-06-11 17:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(322581, 24139, 3669, '<td valign="top">This would be a great cover picture for the magazine.  Although your focus and DOF are great, I think the background is a little busy...but, of course, if it were a real magazine cover, by the time you add the title and side captions, it probably wouldn''t be much of a problem.  He''s a very cute dog.  10</td>', 'This would be a great cover picture for the magazine.  Although your focus and DOF are great, I think the background is a little busy...but, of course, if it were a real magazine cover, by the time you add the title and side captions, it probably wouldn''t be much of a problem.  He''s a very cute dog.  10', '2003-06-11 17:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(322583, 24507, 8140, '<td valign="top">excellent photo! = 8</td>', 'excellent photo! = 8', '2003-06-11 17:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(322586, 24532, 8140, '<td valign="top">nice idea &amp; nice composition and nice shot! well done! = 10</td>', 'nice idea & nice composition and nice shot! well done! = 10', '2003-06-11 17:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(322589, 24509, 8140, '<td valign="top">good work! I like it, esspecially idea with the water drops it gives more interest. = 8</td>', 'good work! I like it, esspecially idea with the water drops it gives more interest. = 8', '2003-06-11 17:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(322591, 24243, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice...I can actually imagine this being on your magazine cover.  I really like the colors and the choppy water.  Only drawback I see is that the background seems a little dull.  Perhaps a little tweak on the contrast would help?  8  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice...I can actually imagine this being on your magazine cover.  I really like the colors and the choppy water.  Only drawback I see is that the background seems a little dull.  Perhaps a little tweak on the contrast would help?  8  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-11 17:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
