(322750, 23998, 8530, '<td valign="top">Wow, wow, wow, NICE moon photo.<br/> <br/>What''s more, the fact that it''s that closeup seems to fit your intended magazine nicely; I''m not familiar with it but with a title like that it seems a good bet.<br/> <br/>B&amp;W is the right choice here, both because I''ve frequently seen B&amp;W moons on the cover of magazines and because it makes it so much easier to place copy on the front.<br/> <br/>My only potential complaint depends on the layout of the magazine; a closer crop or the use of full-bleed would obscure a section o fthe moon, which would suck.</td>', 'Wow, wow, wow, NICE moon photo. What''s more, the fact that it''s that closeup seems to fit your intended magazine nicely; I''m not familiar with it but with a title like that it seems a good bet. B&W is the right choice here, both because I''ve frequently seen B&W moons on the cover of magazines and because it makes it so much easier to place copy on the front. My only potential complaint depends on the layout of the magazine; a closer crop or the use of full-bleed would obscure a section o fthe moon, which would suck.', '2003-06-11 18:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
