(322756, 24440, 7291, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, however, I think it might have had a better magazine cover feel if the hiker was facing the scenery rather than looking at the camera.  Just my opinion.</td>', 'This is a nice picture, however, I think it might have had a better magazine cover feel if the hiker was facing the scenery rather than looking at the camera.  Just my opinion.', '2003-06-11 19:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(322757, 24427, 8530, '<td valign="top">In terms of topic to magazine: I don''t know your magazine well but I''d be inclined to think they''d want a less arty shot or at least an arty shot that had wine actually in it. <br/> <br/>In terms of shot: I''d love to have seen the shot focus on the shadow and refraction and include far less of the glass; against that background that''s just a cool effect. With the glass, it''s less effective. Lighting at the top is also very bright. <br/> <br/>In terms of layout &amp; design: You might have some trouble putting copy across portions of this but you probably could manage it. If this is a shot for a full-bleed cover the crop is good as is, too.</td>', 'In terms of topic to magazine: I don''t know your magazine well but I''d be inclined to think they''d want a less arty shot or at least an arty shot that had wine actually in it.  In terms of shot: I''d love to have seen the shot focus on the shadow and refraction and include far less of the glass; against that background that''s just a cool effect. With the glass, it''s less effective. Lighting at the top is also very bright.  In terms of layout & design: You might have some trouble putting copy across portions of this but you probably could manage it. If this is a shot for a full-bleed cover the crop is good as is, too.', '2003-06-11 19:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
