(322768, 24343, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm, assuming a special on bugs, okay, that makes sense with the title. I don''t know your magazine well enough to judge how likely this is, so I''ll leave it be.<br/> <br/>It''s an interesting close-up, though I''m not sure I would have chosen to crop so much of the wings out. The focus is fairly good, seems to blur a bit more at the bottom than I think ideal. The crop is very good to account for cover copy and logo, and the focal blur helps with that. Maybe just a -touch- on the bright side.</td>', 'Hmm, assuming a special on bugs, okay, that makes sense with the title. I don''t know your magazine well enough to judge how likely this is, so I''ll leave it be. It''s an interesting close-up, though I''m not sure I would have chosen to crop so much of the wings out. The focus is fairly good, seems to blur a bit more at the bottom than I think ideal. The crop is very good to account for cover copy and logo, and the focal blur helps with that. Maybe just a -touch- on the bright side.', '2003-06-11 19:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
