(322778, 24405, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm... well, I see "birder''s world" and for some reason I think of birdwatching -- no clue about the magazine itself. And I don''t think of roosters as terribly bird-watching material.<br/> <br/>Assuming a NON-full-bleed magazine, it''d be a good shot; focus clear on the bird, background not intrusive. In a full-bleed, you''d have some problems with the brightness of the colours vs copy text, but it might be manageable.</td>', 'Hmm... well, I see "birder''s world" and for some reason I think of birdwatching -- no clue about the magazine itself. And I don''t think of roosters as terribly bird-watching material. Assuming a NON-full-bleed magazine, it''d be a good shot; focus clear on the bird, background not intrusive. In a full-bleed, you''d have some problems with the brightness of the colours vs copy text, but it might be manageable.', '2003-06-11 19:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
