(322929, 24312, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate and good execution.</td>', 'Very appropriate and good execution.', '2003-06-11 22:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(322932, 24497, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll hear from some people who are just plainly prudish and will mark you down for even uttering the idea of Playboy... but I''m not one of those.  The problem is that this honestly isn''t even in the realm of quality that they would use.  I don''t mean to sound harsh... but the yellowish-reddish coloration is disturbing, and the angle is not at all flattering or erotic here.  Again, I don''t mean to sound rude... I just feel that I should justify shots that I score low.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll hear from some people who are just plainly prudish and will mark you down for even uttering the idea of Playboy... but I''m not one of those.  The problem is that this honestly isn''t even in the realm of quality that they would use.  I don''t mean to sound harsh... but the yellowish-reddish coloration is disturbing, and the angle is not at all flattering or erotic here.  Again, I don''t mean to sound rude... I just feel that I should justify shots that I score low.', '2003-06-11 22:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(322933, 24390, 7033, '<td valign="top">Whoa baby! You suck so bad that you are able to take photos like this! (Jealousy talking here) What a great opportunity -10</td>', 'Whoa baby! You suck so bad that you are able to take photos like this! (Jealousy talking here) What a great opportunity -10', '2003-06-11 22:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(322934, 23924, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and texture. I''m not sure I can see this composition on the cover of a magazine.  Generally, the mag wants to spotlight a certain type of car. Nice pic, though.</td>', 'Very nice color and texture. I''m not sure I can see this composition on the cover of a magazine.  Generally, the mag wants to spotlight a certain type of car. Nice pic, though.', '2003-06-11 22:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(322936, 23988, 3102, '<td valign="top">Well, I appreciate the attempt at humor here... but it''s just not a flattering shot.  The demon eyes are a bit creepy!</td>', 'Well, I appreciate the attempt at humor here... but it''s just not a flattering shot.  The demon eyes are a bit creepy!', '2003-06-11 22:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(322937, 24140, 1717, '<td valign="top">wow!  excellent photo!  the tones of the cigar and the wood compliment each other well and the whisp of smoke is a nice touch!  well done!</td>', 'wow!  excellent photo!  the tones of the cigar and the wood compliment each other well and the whisp of smoke is a nice touch!  well done!', '2003-06-11 22:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(322938, 24388, 7033, '<td valign="top">I haven''t read any articles about flowers in NG lately and I am a recent subscriber. This is a beautiful shot however but takes up the whole frame and I doubt would be chosen for a mag  cover. I love the color and texture in this photo.</td>', 'I haven''t read any articles about flowers in NG lately and I am a recent subscriber. This is a beautiful shot however but takes up the whole frame and I doubt would be chosen for a mag  cover. I love the color and texture in this photo.', '2003-06-11 22:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(322941, 24459, 3669, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but notice the pee trail some dog must have delivered on the door in this picture.  With a topic so degrading and hopeless of the homeless, I can''t help but laugh.  Okay, seriously, I can see this picture featured in your magazine.  Maybe not necessarily on the cover, but on the inside with an article about the state of homelessness from wherever this was taken.<br/></td>', 'I can''t help but notice the pee trail some dog must have delivered on the door in this picture.  With a topic so degrading and hopeless of the homeless, I can''t help but laugh.  Okay, seriously, I can see this picture featured in your magazine.  Maybe not necessarily on the cover, but on the inside with an article about the state of homelessness from wherever this was taken.', '2003-06-11 22:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(322947, 24317, 1717, '<td valign="top">whoa!  very cool shot!  i love the red and pink of the flower against the green background.  great DOF...i''m impressed!  good job!</td>', 'whoa!  very cool shot!  i love the red and pink of the flower against the green background.  great DOF...i''m impressed!  good job!', '2003-06-11 23:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(322954, 24459, 8970, '<td valign="top">The focus of this picture would work much better if the person on the floor was more of the subject.  I feel like the colored blanket is a distraction the way the picture was taken.</td>', 'The focus of this picture would work much better if the person on the floor was more of the subject.  I feel like the colored blanket is a distraction the way the picture was taken.', '2003-06-11 23:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(322957, 24426, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Very good balance/placement within the frame - the woman, the railing, the hilltops, cutting it neatly.</td>', 'Nice shot! Very good balance/placement within the frame - the woman, the railing, the hilltops, cutting it neatly.', '2003-06-11 23:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(322958, 24210, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. A little too much "blank" space at the right side, but what a lovely catch on the bird!</td>', 'Nice shot. A little too much "blank" space at the right side, but what a lovely catch on the bird!', '2003-06-11 23:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(322962, 24393, 3672, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo of a honda, the only thing I don''t like is the tires are cut off in the picture. I do like the background you choose and the clean lines you have depicted here! :) 8</td>', 'This is a really nice photo of a honda, the only thing I don''t like is the tires are cut off in the picture. I do like the background you choose and the clean lines you have depicted here! :) 8', '2003-06-11 23:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(322963, 24325, 8911, '<td valign="top">*grins* Nice joke. Cute cat, too, looking appropriately crazed for a sports fan. And on a more serious note - I like the way the ball was centered, the way it weights the picture.</td>', '*grins* Nice joke. Cute cat, too, looking appropriately crazed for a sports fan. And on a more serious note - I like the way the ball was centered, the way it weights the picture.', '2003-06-11 23:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(322964, 24327, 9098, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and equipment in this shot, very appropriate for your magazine.  I have to say though, that I was a bit distracted by the brownish leaves (dying tree perhaps) in the background above the shoulder.  Otherwise, nice shot.</td>', 'I like the colors and equipment in this shot, very appropriate for your magazine.  I have to say though, that I was a bit distracted by the brownish leaves (dying tree perhaps) in the background above the shoulder.  Otherwise, nice shot.', '2003-06-11 23:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(322965, 24454, 8911, '<td valign="top">NICE macro - the freezing of an instant, the tight focus on the foreground - keeps the background from taking over at all or being busy, and the detail here of both flower and bee is gorgeous.</td>', 'NICE macro - the freezing of an instant, the tight focus on the foreground - keeps the background from taking over at all or being busy, and the detail here of both flower and bee is gorgeous.', '2003-06-11 23:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(322966, 24316, 7570, '<td valign="top">GunDams! 7</td>', 'GunDams! 7', '2003-06-11 23:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(322967, 24213, 8130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  I would have liked it better cropped just above the tree in the foreground.  Good job, though!</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  I would have liked it better cropped just above the tree in the foreground.  Good job, though!', '2003-06-11 23:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(322968, 24400, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moment you captured....refreshing!  Good job!</td>', 'Beautiful moment you captured....refreshing!  Good job!', '2003-06-11 23:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(322969, 24341, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice framing of the shot overall. The way the light washes out the upper part of it was distracting for me - maybe if you''d angled the camera a bit lower, lost the tops of the trees, it might have countered some of that, but I''m not sure it wouldn''t have lowered the shot too much to work...was the light/look bad from the other side?</td>', 'Nice framing of the shot overall. The way the light washes out the upper part of it was distracting for me - maybe if you''d angled the camera a bit lower, lost the tops of the trees, it might have countered some of that, but I''m not sure it wouldn''t have lowered the shot too much to work...was the light/look bad from the other side?', '2003-06-11 23:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(322970, 24515, 9098, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, but perhaps the top could have been cropped a bit more. There is a lot of white space. The shells add a nice touch.</td>', 'Cool photo, but perhaps the top could have been cropped a bit more. There is a lot of white space. The shells add a nice touch.', '2003-06-11 23:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(322971, 24522, 8911, '<td valign="top">Perspective and your lens play tricks here - they both look (from one side) like they lean in, but they look parallel to each other, so it looks like the whole thing is angled - but which way it appears to be angled, depends on which side your eyes travel in from. Distracting and a little disturbing, in what is otherwise a lovely shot; the buildings are a really good choice of subject as far as their own appearance and contrast to each other.</td>', 'Perspective and your lens play tricks here - they both look (from one side) like they lean in, but they look parallel to each other, so it looks like the whole thing is angled - but which way it appears to be angled, depends on which side your eyes travel in from. Distracting and a little disturbing, in what is otherwise a lovely shot; the buildings are a really good choice of subject as far as their own appearance and contrast to each other.', '2003-06-11 23:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(322972, 24462, 9098, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W shot, I bet it is also amazing in color.</td>', 'Nice B&W shot, I bet it is also amazing in color.', '2003-06-11 23:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(322973, 24115, 7517, '<td valign="top">Good clean work. Exposure and layout look good.  I can see this on a cover.</td>', 'Good clean work. Exposure and layout look good.  I can see this on a cover.', '2003-06-11 23:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(322974, 24371, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I like the reflections and lighting here, and the fact that they''re both present, and don''t take over the main subject.</td>', 'Nice shot - I like the reflections and lighting here, and the fact that they''re both present, and don''t take over the main subject.', '2003-06-11 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(322975, 24293, 9098, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! If this were a cover, I would definitely pick up the magazine. Where was this taken?</td>', 'Beautiful! If this were a cover, I would definitely pick up the magazine. Where was this taken?', '2003-06-11 23:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(322976, 24338, 8911, '<td valign="top">I''m really impressed by the choice of this, although after "liquid" I admit I''ve seen enough liquids for a while. I''m not sure if they''d use this particular image or not because of how people would react, but it''s well-shot and having the real flag blurred in the background adds interest.</td>', 'I''m really impressed by the choice of this, although after "liquid" I admit I''ve seen enough liquids for a while. I''m not sure if they''d use this particular image or not because of how people would react, but it''s well-shot and having the real flag blurred in the background adds interest.', '2003-06-11 23:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(322977, 24405, 8911, '<td valign="top">I find it hard to imagine a chicken on a magazine about birding, but it''s a gorgeous shot - the framing, the background, the lighting are all just perfect. (If the rooster we had when I was a kid was looking like that, however, he''d have been pecking the camera and photographer very shortly after.... :)</td>', 'I find it hard to imagine a chicken on a magazine about birding, but it''s a gorgeous shot - the framing, the background, the lighting are all just perfect. (If the rooster we had when I was a kid was looking like that, however, he''d have been pecking the camera and photographer very shortly after.... :)', '2003-06-11 23:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(322978, 24456, 7570, '<td valign="top">i like the overall feel of this photo. The clouds and the horizon provides a lonely look to the main subject. The abandoned chimney gives an "easter island" look. 8</td>', 'i like the overall feel of this photo. The clouds and the horizon provides a lonely look to the main subject. The abandoned chimney gives an "easter island" look. 8', '2003-06-11 23:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(322980, 24235, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice, nice use of the vivid foreground trees to "frame" the mistier background. Nice division of the frame between the foreground, the misty area, the clouds, and the clear sky. This is the sort of picture that just makes you want to step into it.</td>', 'Nice, nice use of the vivid foreground trees to "frame" the mistier background. Nice division of the frame between the foreground, the misty area, the clouds, and the clear sky. This is the sort of picture that just makes you want to step into it.', '2003-06-11 23:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(322981, 24137, 1280, '<td valign="top">You captured "The Howl!"   The crop is not my ideal because the legs are cut off.  I think in light of that I would have cropped tighter to include the close up of head and shoulders, or include the entire wolf with the legs intact. <br/>The detail in the fur is very good and that pose is classic.  What a beautiful animal.</td>', 'You captured "The Howl!"   The crop is not my ideal because the legs are cut off.  I think in light of that I would have cropped tighter to include the close up of head and shoulders, or include the entire wolf with the legs intact. The detail in the fur is very good and that pose is classic.  What a beautiful animal.', '2003-06-11 23:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(322983, 24368, 1280, '<td valign="top">Lilacs!!!  I miss them here in Florida.  They don''t grow here.  What a sweet aroma and I can almost smell it.  You captured the color perfectly, and the comp works well with the diagonal line of the fence.<br/>Beautiful!</td>', 'Lilacs!!!  I miss them here in Florida.  They don''t grow here.  What a sweet aroma and I can almost smell it.  You captured the color perfectly, and the comp works well with the diagonal line of the fence.Beautiful!', '2003-06-11 23:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(322986, 24361, 7570, '<td valign="top">very nice subject. I would have sharpened this photo a little if i were you. An as a magazine cover, the left and right sides will be cropped off. 7</td>', 'very nice subject. I would have sharpened this photo a little if i were you. An as a magazine cover, the left and right sides will be cropped off. 7', '2003-06-11 23:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(322988, 24514, 9098, '<td valign="top">I think this is a cute photo, but it seems to be a bit out of focus.</td>', 'I think this is a cute photo, but it seems to be a bit out of focus.', '2003-06-11 23:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(322989, 24390, 9098, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking! I love the color in this.</td>', 'Breathtaking! I love the color in this.', '2003-06-11 23:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(322990, 24091, 1280, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m looking at but this is intriguing.  I hope you''ll discuss it.</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m looking at but this is intriguing.  I hope you''ll discuss it.', '2003-06-11 23:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(322991, 24282, 9098, '<td valign="top">This really evokes emotion.  Nice job!</td>', 'This really evokes emotion.  Nice job!', '2003-06-11 23:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(322992, 24470, 7570, '<td valign="top">what i like: the vividness of the colours and nice use of contrast.<br/>slow shutter speed making the water appear like milk. 9</td>', 'what i like: the vividness of the colours and nice use of contrast.slow shutter speed making the water appear like milk. 9', '2003-06-11 23:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(322994, 24174, 1280, '<td valign="top">What a cutie! Can you believe giraffes have the same amount of vertibrae as we humans!!!<br/>Focus could be a bit sharper.  I like how you caught the tongue out!  Great timing.</td>', 'What a cutie! Can you believe giraffes have the same amount of vertibrae as we humans!!!Focus could be a bit sharper.  I like how you caught the tongue out!  Great timing.', '2003-06-11 23:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(322995, 24207, 1280, '<td valign="top">Different.  Nice color and silhouette.  Good luck!</td>', 'Different.  Nice color and silhouette.  Good luck!', '2003-06-11 23:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(322996, 24438, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured with good color saturation.</td>', 'Beautifully captured with good color saturation.', '2003-06-11 23:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(322999, 24303, 8911, '<td valign="top">Fascinating subject - the background is somewhat distracting, though, especially the tree; a shallower focus might have drawn the eye more completely to the man in the foreground.</td>', 'Fascinating subject - the background is somewhat distracting, though, especially the tree; a shallower focus might have drawn the eye more completely to the man in the foreground.', '2003-06-12 00:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(323000, 24393, 7517, '<td valign="top">I think this shot looks great.  The colors really make this shot.  If the background was not the way it is, it would not work as well.</td>', 'I think this shot looks great.  The colors really make this shot.  If the background was not the way it is, it would not work as well.', '2003-06-12 00:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(323002, 24377, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - nice control of the lighting, to get that level of exposure and only as much glare as you did aroudn the lights. This is a very striking, and lovely, picture.</td>', 'Nice shot - nice control of the lighting, to get that level of exposure and only as much glare as you did aroudn the lights. This is a very striking, and lovely, picture.', '2003-06-12 00:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(323003, 24343, 6378, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s slightly out of focus. Other that that it''s a great pic.</td>', 'Looks like it''s slightly out of focus. Other that that it''s a great pic.', '2003-06-12 00:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(323005, 24218, 4536, '<td valign="top">Well done, good pose. A couple of things bother me though. her "crack" is peeking out at the top of her suit and the shadow cast on her boob by her other boob, a little fill light on your right would have helped fill this in. Otherwise an excellent shot.</td>', 'Well done, good pose. A couple of things bother me though. her "crack" is peeking out at the top of her suit and the shadow cast on her boob by her other boob, a little fill light on your right would have helped fill this in. Otherwise an excellent shot.', '2003-06-12 00:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(323007, 24513, 8911, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s a lovely little area, and I''d love to have a yard like that. But that aside, you photographed it beautifully - the grassy area at the bottom is enough to rest the eyes without overwhelming the rest of the picture, and the eye flows naturally down the waterfall and around the plantings at the edge of the grass.</td>', 'Now, that''s a lovely little area, and I''d love to have a yard like that. But that aside, you photographed it beautifully - the grassy area at the bottom is enough to rest the eyes without overwhelming the rest of the picture, and the eye flows naturally down the waterfall and around the plantings at the edge of the grass.', '2003-06-12 00:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(323010, 24429, 8911, '<td valign="top">The light on this is awfully bright/glare-y - I assume that''s deliberate, but it doesn''t seem to fit in, and I''m not sure what it''s supposed to tell me. With the high angle on (beaker?), it also is too tall an image, with the bottom part sort of dragging on and leaving it feeling imbalanced. Cropping it at the bottom edge of the glare (taking a distance off the bottom about equial to the distance between the right edge of the photo and the right edge of the beaker) seems to balance it out a bit more.</td>', 'The light on this is awfully bright/glare-y - I assume that''s deliberate, but it doesn''t seem to fit in, and I''m not sure what it''s supposed to tell me. With the high angle on (beaker?), it also is too tall an image, with the bottom part sort of dragging on and leaving it feeling imbalanced. Cropping it at the bottom edge of the glare (taking a distance off the bottom about equial to the distance between the right edge of the photo and the right edge of the beaker) seems to balance it out a bit more.', '2003-06-12 00:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(323011, 24533, 6325, '<td valign="top">I would expect moe dramatic lighting on the face.</td>', 'I would expect moe dramatic lighting on the face.', '2003-06-12 00:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(323012, 24446, 6477, '<td valign="top">The lighting is beautiful... I would like to know which Budha is this one...</td>', 'The lighting is beautiful... I would like to know which Budha is this one...', '2003-06-12 00:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(323013, 24218, 6630, '<td valign="top">Daring!</td>', 'Daring!', '2003-06-12 00:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(323014, 24452, 8911, '<td valign="top">The trees/lake are a bit dark and hard to make out - I wish more of them could be seen - but the sky is nicely dramatic. (The shadowing of the trees would work better if there were some sunset/sunrise colors, I think, as it''s more expected then. As it is, it looks like a bright day and yet the details are all hidden.)</td>', 'The trees/lake are a bit dark and hard to make out - I wish more of them could be seen - but the sky is nicely dramatic. (The shadowing of the trees would work better if there were some sunset/sunrise colors, I think, as it''s more expected then. As it is, it looks like a bright day and yet the details are all hidden.)', '2003-06-12 00:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(323015, 24293, 6630, '<td valign="top">beautiful, where is it?</td>', 'beautiful, where is it?', '2003-06-12 00:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(323016, 24037, 6325, '<td valign="top">Mr. Smith''s retirement home?</td>', 'Mr. Smith''s retirement home?', '2003-06-12 00:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(323018, 24320, 6938, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit dark (even for my monitor).  I am quite distracted by everything around the ''singing'' subject. Perhaps a closer shot, at a different angle to remove the background guitarist would have been better and more usable as a cover.</td>', 'Seems a bit dark (even for my monitor).  I am quite distracted by everything around the ''singing'' subject. Perhaps a closer shot, at a different angle to remove the background guitarist would have been better and more usable as a cover.', '2003-06-12 00:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(323020, 24003, 6938, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the edges, and the slight reflection.  Gives a good 3d feel.</td>', 'I like the softness of the edges, and the slight reflection.  Gives a good 3d feel.', '2003-06-12 00:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(323021, 24076, 7920, '<td valign="top">The only problem with this photo that I can see is the power lines in the bottom of the photo.  I''d have cropped those off.  Cool idea, though. 8</td>', 'The only problem with this photo that I can see is the power lines in the bottom of the photo.  I''d have cropped those off.  Cool idea, though. 8', '2003-06-12 00:29:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(323024, 24369, 6938, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a more symetrical view would be more useable for a ''cover''. It might have helped with the (very) slight but (a little) distracting flaring in the top left.</td>', 'Perhaps a more symetrical view would be more useable for a ''cover''. It might have helped with the (very) slight but (a little) distracting flaring in the top left.', '2003-06-12 00:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(323025, 24139, 6504, '<td valign="top">This is a truly amazing photograph!  It is so clear and the lighting is perfect, the composition very good, background very good.  And the chihuahua is an A+.<br/>Can you tell I like this a lot?  10</td>', 'This is a truly amazing photograph!  It is so clear and the lighting is perfect, the composition very good, background very good.  And the chihuahua is an A+.Can you tell I like this a lot?  10', '2003-06-12 00:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(323026, 24504, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  The lighting''s good, and the compostion, subject perfect.  It could be just a little more sharp.</td>', 'Very good photo.  The lighting''s good, and the compostion, subject perfect.  It could be just a little more sharp.', '2003-06-12 00:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(323027, 24139, 6938, '<td valign="top">Good photo (DOF, colours, brightness). Perhaps could have been horizontally balanced a bit more.  I''m can''t see it being used as a ''cover'' though.</td>', 'Good photo (DOF, colours, brightness). Perhaps could have been horizontally balanced a bit more.  I''m can''t see it being used as a ''cover'' though.', '2003-06-12 00:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(323028, 24255, 7920, '<td valign="top">This has the makings of a great shot, but you might have tried to get a different angle.  For instance, looking downward upon the cake would have provided a much better background than the wall and the folding chair.  =)  Good work, though!</td>', 'This has the makings of a great shot, but you might have tried to get a different angle.  For instance, looking downward upon the cake would have provided a much better background than the wall and the folding chair.  =)  Good work, though!', '2003-06-12 00:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(323029, 24510, 6504, '<td valign="top">This is a very good picture.  The color and the lighting is excellent.  The star fish ruins it for me.  It seems to be just put it in there for the heck of it.  I think this would be the winner if you left out the foreground (starfish) and the shish kebob in back and highlighted the top of the fruit with the black background.</td>', 'This is a very good picture.  The color and the lighting is excellent.  The star fish ruins it for me.  It seems to be just put it in there for the heck of it.  I think this would be the winner if you left out the foreground (starfish) and the shish kebob in back and highlighted the top of the fruit with the black background.', '2003-06-12 00:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(323030, 24371, 6504, '<td valign="top">A little too much blue for me.</td>', 'A little too much blue for me.', '2003-06-12 00:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(323031, 24427, 6938, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. Ttechnically you have done well.  But it feels very unbalanced to me.<br/>Perhaps a longer shot (more of a slice of a picnic scene) would have been more usefull as a ''cover''.</td>', 'I like the concept. Ttechnically you have done well.  But it feels very unbalanced to me.Perhaps a longer shot (more of a slice of a picnic scene) would have been more usefull as a ''cover''.', '2003-06-12 00:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
