(323135, 24456, 5822, '<td valign="top">The sky and lighting of this early/late day shot is evocative and even eerie, but the forground is too dark to complete my appreciation of this very interesting image. With such a prominent subject (the fireplace) I feel that it''s not about rural Austrailia, but rather about the lack of a  house attatched to that fireplace, and what that represents. IMHO, I think this shot would fit more a surrealistic challenge. 7 because I really do like this shot despite it''s technical flaw.</td>', 'The sky and lighting of this early/late day shot is evocative and even eerie, but the forground is too dark to complete my appreciation of this very interesting image. With such a prominent subject (the fireplace) I feel that it''s not about rural Austrailia, but rather about the lack of a  house attatched to that fireplace, and what that represents. IMHO, I think this shot would fit more a surrealistic challenge. 7 because I really do like this shot despite it''s technical flaw.', '2003-06-12 02:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(323136, 24372, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent! This captures the challenge perfectly to me, in a very classic and traditional way.  The only thing I think it lacks is a human presence.</td>', 'Excellent! This captures the challenge perfectly to me, in a very classic and traditional way.  The only thing I think it lacks is a human presence.', '2003-06-12 02:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(323137, 24075, 6359, '<td valign="top">I like the action shot but I would have liked it a little less blurry at least player in white towards the bottom. My preference.</td>', 'I like the action shot but I would have liked it a little less blurry at least player in white towards the bottom. My preference.', '2003-06-12 02:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
