(323143, 24406, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a really great action shot! I love the angle of the boater and his expression and how the image shows the difficulty with this sport and it''s dangers.  Despite it''s format, I can see this on the cover of a mag.  There are a just a few points I''d like to make that could be improved on. First, the letters on the paddle are distracting, and certainly after the challenge, this could be spot edited out. Secondly, I would have liked to have seen a bit more detail in the man''s face.  My first impression of your border was that I didn''t like it, but the more I look at it, the better it sits with me.  Overall, well done!</td>', 'This is a really great action shot! I love the angle of the boater and his expression and how the image shows the difficulty with this sport and it''s dangers.  Despite it''s format, I can see this on the cover of a mag.  There are a just a few points I''d like to make that could be improved on. First, the letters on the paddle are distracting, and certainly after the challenge, this could be spot edited out. Secondly, I would have liked to have seen a bit more detail in the man''s face.  My first impression of your border was that I didn''t like it, but the more I look at it, the better it sits with me.  Overall, well done!', '2003-06-12 02:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(323144, 24139, 4767, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it a bitch?  (being on a leash that heavy?)</td>', 'Isn''t it a bitch?  (being on a leash that heavy?)', '2003-06-12 02:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
