(323158, 24511, 5892, '<td valign="top">Nice natural light, and a good shot. The quality looks a little bit choppy in some places - maybe if you made the pic a little bit smaller, the resolution would be better. Good stuff.</td>', 'Nice natural light, and a good shot. The quality looks a little bit choppy in some places - maybe if you made the pic a little bit smaller, the resolution would be better. Good stuff.', '2003-06-12 04:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(323161, 24522, 2279, '<td valign="top">The buildings look a little crooked to me.</td>', 'The buildings look a little crooked to me.', '2003-06-12 04:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(323163, 24479, 5892, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think the shot is too busy. I would probably shoot only one bear, or use an interesting angle that creates a definite focus - right now my eyes are going all over the place. I like the little seat that they''re sitting in! And the quilt in the BG is a good touch.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think the shot is too busy. I would probably shoot only one bear, or use an interesting angle that creates a definite focus - right now my eyes are going all over the place. I like the little seat that they''re sitting in! And the quilt in the BG is a good touch.', '2003-06-12 04:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(323164, 24463, 5892, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, and the cropping you chose makes it interesting. My eyes are pulled right off the page, makeing me feel like there is something bigger than what you have captured in your frame. I really like it.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, and the cropping you chose makes it interesting. My eyes are pulled right off the page, makeing me feel like there is something bigger than what you have captured in your frame. I really like it.', '2003-06-12 04:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(323165, 24339, 5892, '<td valign="top">This picture has great charm. Definitly evokes a sense of small town life, summer, all sorts of feel good things. A nice outdoors shot that pleases the eye.</td>', 'This picture has great charm. Definitly evokes a sense of small town life, summer, all sorts of feel good things. A nice outdoors shot that pleases the eye.', '2003-06-12 04:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(323166, 24481, 5892, '<td valign="top">A good action/candid shot, but I wish that I could see more of the baby and less of the priest''s back.</td>', 'A good action/candid shot, but I wish that I could see more of the baby and less of the priest''s back.', '2003-06-12 04:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(323167, 24297, 2279, '<td valign="top">I wish this was taken a little bit too the left with more of the tree that you cut off. This is why I wish spot editing was allowed so you could remove the fire hydrant from the front. Nice colors and lighting though. 6.</td>', 'I wish this was taken a little bit too the left with more of the tree that you cut off. This is why I wish spot editing was allowed so you could remove the fire hydrant from the front. Nice colors and lighting though. 6.', '2003-06-12 04:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
