(323288, 24362, 7504, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit contrasty, to me, the colors are lovely, and it does make me want to golf there, if I golfed.</td>', 'Seems a bit contrasty, to me, the colors are lovely, and it does make me want to golf there, if I golfed.', '2003-06-12 10:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(323289, 23934, 9199, '<td valign="top">I like the photo. The bright area on the left is very distracting though.</td>', 'I like the photo. The bright area on the left is very distracting though.', '2003-06-12 10:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(323290, 23873, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like this, the interesting fence lining the path and the beautiful snow-capped mountains.  The shed seems a bit dark though.</td>', 'I like this, the interesting fence lining the path and the beautiful snow-capped mountains.  The shed seems a bit dark though.', '2003-06-12 10:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(323292, 24341, 7504, '<td valign="top">Wow, wouldn''t want that falling on my toe.  Great idea, the photo seems a bit washed out to me, but that''s just my taste.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow, wouldn''t want that falling on my toe.  Great idea, the photo seems a bit washed out to me, but that''s just my taste.  Good luck!', '2003-06-12 10:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(323294, 24288, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like this, very simple and clean.  Nice lighting and I think the border is very tasteful.  There''s not a lot of "wow" here to me, but the photo is technically good.</td>', 'I like this, very simple and clean.  Nice lighting and I think the border is very tasteful.  There''s not a lot of "wow" here to me, but the photo is technically good.', '2003-06-12 10:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(323295, 24338, 7504, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but I really can''t see this being on the cover of a news mag.  Very cool reflections and focus.</td>', 'Good photo, but I really can''t see this being on the cover of a news mag.  Very cool reflections and focus.', '2003-06-12 10:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(323296, 24236, 7504, '<td valign="top">This has a simple, comfortable feel to it, like something out of the past.  It seems like the project he''s working on should also be in the picture, unless it''s the table itself, which it doesn''t appear to be.  Great idea!</td>', 'This has a simple, comfortable feel to it, like something out of the past.  It seems like the project he''s working on should also be in the picture, unless it''s the table itself, which it doesn''t appear to be.  Great idea!', '2003-06-12 10:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(323297, 23930, 7504, '<td valign="top">I would like this better with a simple background, maybe black.  The chair and room in the background makes it look "snapshoty", also we''ve seen a lot of chess shots on this site.  I like the focus on the one peice and the gleam from the board.</td>', 'I would like this better with a simple background, maybe black.  The chair and room in the background makes it look "snapshoty", also we''ve seen a lot of chess shots on this site.  I like the focus on the one peice and the gleam from the board.', '2003-06-12 10:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(323298, 24269, 7504, '<td valign="top">#38 looks the most focused.  I like this shot for the different emotions on their faces and the different skin tones on their legs.  Great idea, but a little short on "wow".</td>', '#38 looks the most focused.  I like this shot for the different emotions on their faces and the different skin tones on their legs.  Great idea, but a little short on "wow".', '2003-06-12 10:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(323299, 24499, 9136, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous shot. 10.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous shot. 10.', '2003-06-12 10:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(323300, 24314, 7504, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be cool if it was somewhere other than a parking lot.  Parking lots aren''t too picteresque IMO.  Also, I''d like it better if the front of the truck wasn''t cut off.  Good luck!</td>', 'I think this shot would be cool if it was somewhere other than a parking lot.  Parking lots aren''t too picteresque IMO.  Also, I''d like it better if the front of the truck wasn''t cut off.  Good luck!', '2003-06-12 10:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(323301, 24080, 9136, '<td valign="top">Really nice... I gave it a 10.</td>', 'Really nice... I gave it a 10.', '2003-06-12 10:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(323302, 24515, 9136, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love the sandels and sea shells. 9.</td>', 'Great shot, I love the sandels and sea shells. 9.', '2003-06-12 10:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(323303, 24234, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is indeed a lovely rose, and you left room at the top of your photo for the magazine title.  I like the soft focus on this and it''s subtlety.  Good job.</td>', 'This is indeed a lovely rose, and you left room at the top of your photo for the magazine title.  I like the soft focus on this and it''s subtlety.  Good job.', '2003-06-12 10:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(323304, 23934, 7504, '<td valign="top">Lovely eyes.  I like the detail of the wood grain.  I wish we hadn''t seen one like this recently, it takes away from the impact of this one.  Good luck!</td>', 'Lovely eyes.  I like the detail of the wood grain.  I wish we hadn''t seen one like this recently, it takes away from the impact of this one.  Good luck!', '2003-06-12 10:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(323306, 24513, 9136, '<td valign="top">Really nice setting, it lead to a great shot. 9.</td>', 'Really nice setting, it lead to a great shot. 9.', '2003-06-12 10:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(323307, 24092, 7504, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!  I''m impressed you were able to get it pretty much in focus, and I''m sure it was 1 chance or nothing for this eh?  Great shot.</td>', 'Nice catch!  I''m impressed you were able to get it pretty much in focus, and I''m sure it was 1 chance or nothing for this eh?  Great shot.', '2003-06-12 10:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(323309, 24337, 7504, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this makes me want to go there.  I''m sure you''ve heard pleanty about the landscape orientation, and it seems that a portrait orientation wouldn''t have the same impact.  It''d make a great poster though!</td>', 'Yeah, this makes me want to go there.  I''m sure you''ve heard pleanty about the landscape orientation, and it seems that a portrait orientation wouldn''t have the same impact.  It''d make a great poster though!', '2003-06-12 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(323312, 24457, 7504, '<td valign="top">This shot is rather grainy, and the bird seems a bit out of focus.  I love the detail of the feathers and she has a bright eye.</td>', 'This shot is rather grainy, and the bird seems a bit out of focus.  I love the detail of the feathers and she has a bright eye.', '2003-06-12 10:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(323314, 24173, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I like the straight line of shadow.  The red seems somewhat grainy.</td>', 'This is nice.  I like the straight line of shadow.  The red seems somewhat grainy.', '2003-06-12 10:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(323315, 24424, 7504, '<td valign="top">Is there a magazine called, "Strawberry Smile"?  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.  Nice focus on the strawberry and good placement in the photo.</td>', 'Is there a magazine called, "Strawberry Smile"?  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.  Nice focus on the strawberry and good placement in the photo.', '2003-06-12 10:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(323316, 24458, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like the little spots of light on the water.  There''s a lot of action here, which I''m sure would do well as a cover.  I''m not sure if I like the tilted horizon though, I''m sure that was an artistic choice, and it does give this more movement.</td>', 'I like the little spots of light on the water.  There''s a lot of action here, which I''m sure would do well as a cover.  I''m not sure if I like the tilted horizon though, I''m sure that was an artistic choice, and it does give this more movement.', '2003-06-12 10:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(323317, 24456, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  Not sure what it is, but it looks old and lonely.  I like the moody lighting and the sky.  Great job.</td>', 'This is cool.  Not sure what it is, but it looks old and lonely.  I like the moody lighting and the sky.  Great job.', '2003-06-12 10:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(323318, 24446, 7504, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is very nice.  I like the shadows around the face, and red was a good choice for this.</td>', 'The lighting on this is very nice.  I like the shadows around the face, and red was a good choice for this.', '2003-06-12 10:37:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(323319, 24213, 7504, '<td valign="top">Yup, looks like a magazine cover to me.  Beautiful colors in this.</td>', 'Yup, looks like a magazine cover to me.  Beautiful colors in this.', '2003-06-12 10:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(323321, 24073, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is so clean and simple.  The water and rippled reflections are lovely.  Fits the challenge well, although I would have left a bit more at the top for the title.</td>', 'This is so clean and simple.  The water and rippled reflections are lovely.  Fits the challenge well, although I would have left a bit more at the top for the title.', '2003-06-12 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(323323, 24452, 7504, '<td valign="top">The sky is nice, the dark landscape doesn''t have a lot of impact.  The reflection is lovely.</td>', 'The sky is nice, the dark landscape doesn''t have a lot of impact.  The reflection is lovely.', '2003-06-12 10:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(323324, 24370, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  The candidness of it is brilliant.  Fits the challenge well.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  The candidness of it is brilliant.  Fits the challenge well.', '2003-06-12 10:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(323325, 24282, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool idea.  I wish the lighting were a bit different so we could see the details in the helmet a little more.  The flames are awesome.  I would change the orientation for a mag cover (I''m sure you''ve heard this already), but I''ll still give it a 7.</td>', 'This is a very cool idea.  I wish the lighting were a bit different so we could see the details in the helmet a little more.  The flames are awesome.  I would change the orientation for a mag cover (I''m sure you''ve heard this already), but I''ll still give it a 7.', '2003-06-12 10:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(323326, 24430, 7504, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are mezmorizing.  Good choice of colors, very sharp, great pic.</td>', 'Those eyes are mezmorizing.  Good choice of colors, very sharp, great pic.', '2003-06-12 10:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(323328, 24518, 7504, '<td valign="top">This could be so nice, but it''s out of focus which is the most important element to me.   Not sure how it fits the challenge.</td>', 'This could be so nice, but it''s out of focus which is the most important element to me.   Not sure how it fits the challenge.', '2003-06-12 10:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(323329, 24415, 8139, '<td valign="top">What Sharp &amp; Beautifull Macro shot. <br/>Perfectly composed, great colors and texture. I can see it on a cover.</td>', 'What Sharp & Beautifull Macro shot. Perfectly composed, great colors and texture. I can see it on a cover.', '2003-06-12 10:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(323330, 24075, 7504, '<td valign="top">Great catch.  Lots of motion and excitement here.  Could definitely see this on a cover.</td>', 'Great catch.  Lots of motion and excitement here.  Could definitely see this on a cover.', '2003-06-12 10:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(323331, 24500, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like the flower a lot, I wish it were placed lower in the photo to allow for room at the top for a title.  Great focus.</td>', 'I like the flower a lot, I wish it were placed lower in the photo to allow for room at the top for a title.  Great focus.', '2003-06-12 10:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(323332, 24289, 7504, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m with you.  The mag. cover is in the picture, but isn''t necessarily the picture itself?  Fun idea, would make a great self-portrait.</td>', 'OK, I''m with you.  The mag. cover is in the picture, but isn''t necessarily the picture itself?  Fun idea, would make a great self-portrait.', '2003-06-12 10:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(323333, 24092, 8139, '<td valign="top">Very nice bird shot. I have the same in my garden. I have the lenses, tripod and all the stuff to do something like that, exept probably the patience.<br/>Congrats.</td>', 'Very nice bird shot. I have the same in my garden. I have the lenses, tripod and all the stuff to do something like that, exept probably the patience.Congrats.', '2003-06-12 10:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(323334, 24327, 7504, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a mower.  The photo doesn''t have a lot of impact for me.  I like the contrasting red, green and yellows in the photo.</td>', 'Now that''s a mower.  The photo doesn''t have a lot of impact for me.  I like the contrasting red, green and yellows in the photo.', '2003-06-12 10:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(323335, 24171, 7504, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a bit more saturation here.  Nice composition.</td>', 'I would like to see a bit more saturation here.  Nice composition.', '2003-06-12 10:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(323336, 24293, 7504, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is really cool, and I''m impressed that the photo is so clear.  Great job.</td>', 'The lighting on this is really cool, and I''m impressed that the photo is so clear.  Great job.', '2003-06-12 10:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(323337, 24480, 8139, '<td valign="top">Probably one of the best covers for "national geo" in this challenge, in my opinion.<br/>What is in (or comes out) the eye of the black mask?<br/>Well Done</td>', 'Probably one of the best covers for "national geo" in this challenge, in my opinion.What is in (or comes out) the eye of the black mask?Well Done', '2003-06-12 10:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(323338, 24504, 7504, '<td valign="top">Oh so cute!  I''d like to see more room at the top.  I like the quiet colors in this and, of course, your model is adorable! 7</td>', 'Oh so cute!  I''d like to see more room at the top.  I like the quiet colors in this and, of course, your model is adorable! 7', '2003-06-12 10:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(323339, 24442, 8139, '<td valign="top">Impressive action shot.</td>', 'Impressive action shot.', '2003-06-12 10:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(323340, 24320, 7504, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit dark for me, and the photo seems grainy.  I can see this as a mag cover for sing out though!</td>', 'The lighting is a bit dark for me, and the photo seems grainy.  I can see this as a mag cover for sing out though!', '2003-06-12 10:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(323341, 24408, 7504, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this works for me.  Very clean and fits the challenge well.  Good job.</td>', 'Yeah, this works for me.  Very clean and fits the challenge well.  Good job.', '2003-06-12 10:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(323342, 24369, 7504, '<td valign="top">Too washed out for me, I like th angle here, but would like to see a different page orientation.  (How many times have you heard that?)  : )</td>', 'Too washed out for me, I like th angle here, but would like to see a different page orientation.  (How many times have you heard that?)  : )', '2003-06-12 10:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(323344, 24489, 7504, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge well.  You left room at the top (thanks).  The subject doesn''t interest me much, but I think it''s a good pic.  : )</td>', 'This fits the challenge well.  You left room at the top (thanks).  The subject doesn''t interest me much, but I think it''s a good pic.  : )', '2003-06-12 10:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(323345, 24116, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, ...nice telescope.<br/></td>', 'Nice macro, ...nice telescope.', '2003-06-12 10:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(323347, 24056, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Good saturation and the bg makes it pop. Texture is excellent.</td>', 'Very nice! Good saturation and the bg makes it pop. Texture is excellent.', '2003-06-12 11:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(323349, 24051, 7504, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t saw "carpentry" to me as much as it says "wood carving".  Don''t know if there''s a magazine for that though.  : )</td>', 'This doesn''t saw "carpentry" to me as much as it says "wood carving".  Don''t know if there''s a magazine for that though.  : )', '2003-06-12 11:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(323350, 24312, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, sharp on the subject, well blurred in the background.Good lighting too.<br/>Could be a cover.</td>', 'Nice action shot, sharp on the subject, well blurred in the background.Good lighting too.Could be a cover.', '2003-06-12 11:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(323351, 24244, 7504, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.  I would have cropped the bottom more and left more at the top.  Good job!</td>', 'Nice pic.  I would have cropped the bottom more and left more at the top.  Good job!', '2003-06-12 11:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(323352, 24450, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and great color.<br/>Difficult to get large DOF on such a angle shot.</td>', 'Nice composition and great color.Difficult to get large DOF on such a angle shot.', '2003-06-12 11:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(323353, 24313, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like the subject here, needs to be sharper focus though.</td>', 'I like the subject here, needs to be sharper focus though.', '2003-06-12 11:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(323354, 24354, 8139, '<td valign="top">Good subjet, well done. Maybe too "minimalistic" for a magazine cover, but i like it so.</td>', 'Good subjet, well done. Maybe too "minimalistic" for a magazine cover, but i like it so.', '2003-06-12 11:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(323357, 24076, 7504, '<td valign="top">I''d like this better without the powerlines in the background and with a little more saturation.</td>', 'I''d like this better without the powerlines in the background and with a little more saturation.', '2003-06-12 11:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(323358, 24487, 1280, '<td valign="top">Night Herons?  Or maybe Tri-colored?  Nice job!</td>', 'Night Herons?  Or maybe Tri-colored?  Nice job!', '2003-06-12 11:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(323359, 24190, 8139, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. It could be a cover !<br/>Very aestetic too. I like it very much.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. It could be a cover !Very aestetic too. I like it very much.', '2003-06-12 11:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(323360, 23950, 1280, '<td valign="top">I love Ranger Rick mag.  Seeee?  Not just for the kiddies!  :-)  Very nice capture of this (Horned?) Owl.</td>', 'I love Ranger Rick mag.  Seeee?  Not just for the kiddies!  :-)  Very nice capture of this (Horned?) Owl.', '2003-06-12 11:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(323369, 24339, 8367, '<td valign="top">I like your subject choice and compostion. The detail could be a bit sharper. A nice country capture.</td>', 'I like your subject choice and compostion. The detail could be a bit sharper. A nice country capture.', '2003-06-12 11:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(323371, 24407, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very unique and pleasing as well.</td>', 'Very unique and pleasing as well.', '2003-06-12 11:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(323375, 24327, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice-looking model but there are too many elements in the image.  Get rid of the truck which competes for attention.</td>', 'Nice-looking model but there are too many elements in the image.  Get rid of the truck which competes for attention.', '2003-06-12 11:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(323381, 24030, 1280, '<td valign="top">I must tell you, I love the expression on this beautiful kitty.</td>', 'I must tell you, I love the expression on this beautiful kitty.', '2003-06-12 11:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(323382, 24362, 5021, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I''d love to golf there.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I''d love to golf there.', '2003-06-12 11:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(323383, 24510, 5021, '<td valign="top">Wow, perfect image for that magazine.</td>', 'Wow, perfect image for that magazine.', '2003-06-12 11:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(323387, 24174, 5021, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the border kinda looks green as opposed to yellow.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the border kinda looks green as opposed to yellow.', '2003-06-12 11:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(323388, 23924, 5021, '<td valign="top">Are you a member of Worth1000?</td>', 'Are you a member of Worth1000?', '2003-06-12 11:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(323390, 24049, 1280, '<td valign="top">A beautiful Great Blue Heron.  Well done!</td>', 'A beautiful Great Blue Heron.  Well done!', '2003-06-12 11:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(323391, 24175, 1280, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwww So sweet.  You did a good job of capturing this image except around the face could be a little lighter.  Aside from the challenge you can use the dodge too. Pretty!</td>', 'Awwwwwww So sweet.  You did a good job of capturing this image except around the face could be a little lighter.  Aside from the challenge you can use the dodge too. Pretty!', '2003-06-12 11:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(323393, 24442, 1280, '<td valign="top">Whew!  Good stop action.  Good luck!</td>', 'Whew!  Good stop action.  Good luck!', '2003-06-12 11:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(323398, 24140, 4564, '<td valign="top">excellent shot. superb coors. excellent use of negative space. very well done. one of my two 10s this week.<br/></td>', 'excellent shot. superb coors. excellent use of negative space. very well done. one of my two 10s this week.', '2003-06-12 12:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(323401, 24415, 4564, '<td valign="top">very well done. I wonder how you were able to get this shot in front of a perfect white bgr. makes me think it was done in a studio...  Maybe the butterfly is part of your personal collection, and the setup is a montage in studio.  Makes me wonder... ;-)  very good. 10.</td>', 'very well done. I wonder how you were able to get this shot in front of a perfect white bgr. makes me think it was done in a studio...  Maybe the butterfly is part of your personal collection, and the setup is a montage in studio.  Makes me wonder... ;-)  very good. 10.', '2003-06-12 12:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(323402, 24003, 7966, '<td valign="top">this is not in focus</td>', 'this is not in focus', '2003-06-12 12:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(323403, 24518, 7966, '<td valign="top">this shot is blury</td>', 'this shot is blury', '2003-06-12 12:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(323404, 24092, 6420, '<td valign="top">beautiful catch of photographer</td>', 'beautiful catch of photographer', '2003-06-12 12:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(323406, 24468, 5391, '<td valign="top">Funny to include the camera!!  Made me smile!</td>', 'Funny to include the camera!!  Made me smile!', '2003-06-12 12:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(323408, 24533, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent pose, lovely model.  The lighting really makes her skin and hair look nice.  Perhaps just a touch more bounced light on the right side of the frame where her face is, and a stronger catchlight in the eyes to really make this cover-worthy (but then, I''m comparing you to Annie Liebowitz...  so don''t take that as particularly harsh criticism!)  Overall very good shot.  8</td>', 'Excellent pose, lovely model.  The lighting really makes her skin and hair look nice.  Perhaps just a touch more bounced light on the right side of the frame where her face is, and a stronger catchlight in the eyes to really make this cover-worthy (but then, I''m comparing you to Annie Liebowitz...  so don''t take that as particularly harsh criticism!)  Overall very good shot.  8', '2003-06-12 12:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(323413, 24229, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition - perhaps softer lighting to eliminate shadows would make it better, but overall very good!</td>', 'Excellent composition - perhaps softer lighting to eliminate shadows would make it better, but overall very good!', '2003-06-12 12:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(323422, 24430, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very good.  One of the best fashion shots of the challenge, I think.  Fantastic model who obviously knows what she''s doing.  Excellent choice in clothing, pose, background and make up (perhaps a bit more powder or something on the face to smoothing the complexion tones a bit?)  Love those little wisps of hair floating off to the sides, also.  9</td>', 'Very good.  One of the best fashion shots of the challenge, I think.  Fantastic model who obviously knows what she''s doing.  Excellent choice in clothing, pose, background and make up (perhaps a bit more powder or something on the face to smoothing the complexion tones a bit?)  Love those little wisps of hair floating off to the sides, also.  9', '2003-06-12 12:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(323423, 24338, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Of couse, it''s been done before, but that doesn''t mean that it can''t be done again.  I like the wavy look and the composition that anchors everything towards the right bottom corner.  Can''t find fault with this at all.  10</td>', 'Wow.  Of couse, it''s been done before, but that doesn''t mean that it can''t be done again.  I like the wavy look and the composition that anchors everything towards the right bottom corner.  Can''t find fault with this at all.  10', '2003-06-12 12:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(323424, 24173, 5391, '<td valign="top">Extremely cool shot.  I think that the simplicity would add to it''s usefulness as a magazine cover.  10</td>', 'Extremely cool shot.  I think that the simplicity would add to it''s usefulness as a magazine cover.  10', '2003-06-12 12:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
