(323507, 24437, 1204, '<td valign="top">Well... the photo isn''t so special but what a subject!  Where do you find a model like this?  To make the photo better, a large diffuser would have elminated the overexposure on her right shoulder and a powerful fill-in flash or a reflector would have improved the overall lighting.  On the other hand - who cares about technicalities with a model like this?  Sure this is original?</td>', 'Well... the photo isn''t so special but what a subject!  Where do you find a model like this?  To make the photo better, a large diffuser would have elminated the overexposure on her right shoulder and a powerful fill-in flash or a reflector would have improved the overall lighting.  On the other hand - who cares about technicalities with a model like this?  Sure this is original?', '2003-06-12 14:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(323508, 24504, 8758, '<td valign="top">There must be a really proud parent out there. Nice composition....colours just right for the subject...focus could be sharper.</td>', 'There must be a really proud parent out there. Nice composition....colours just right for the subject...focus could be sharper.', '2003-06-12 14:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
