(323541, 24421, 8488, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but National Geographic''s photos are of such a recognizable style and always crisp as a fresh linen sheet; the blur, pixelation, and weird color balance here tell me that this particular shot has no hope. 4.</td>', 'Good concept, but National Geographic''s photos are of such a recognizable style and always crisp as a fresh linen sheet; the blur, pixelation, and weird color balance here tell me that this particular shot has no hope. 4.', '2003-06-12 15:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
