(323598, 24195, 3697, '<td valign="top">I love this style of composition and have attempted it many times myself :)  Very nice color and the archer is posed very nicely. The only nitpick I would have (and it''s a small pick) is the fact that it may be cropped from the top/right a little too much. I would prefer to see the whole black thing instead of having it cut off. Gee, can you tell I''m not an archer? Hehe, black thing...</td>', 'I love this style of composition and have attempted it many times myself :)  Very nice color and the archer is posed very nicely. The only nitpick I would have (and it''s a small pick) is the fact that it may be cropped from the top/right a little too much. I would prefer to see the whole black thing instead of having it cut off. Gee, can you tell I''m not an archer? Hehe, black thing...', '2003-06-12 17:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(323600, 24173, 3697, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image. I like the red/black split by the recorder and I also like the fact that the recorder is lit brighter on the red side than on the black. Good work.</td>', 'Very interesting image. I like the red/black split by the recorder and I also like the fact that the recorder is lit brighter on the red side than on the black. Good work.', '2003-06-12 17:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(323601, 24501, 3697, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and black and white was a good choice. I think the picture overall would benefit from maybe a little brighter lighting and a little more contrast. Still, a nice picture as is.</td>', 'I like the idea, and black and white was a good choice. I think the picture overall would benefit from maybe a little brighter lighting and a little more contrast. Still, a nice picture as is.', '2003-06-12 17:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(323603, 24513, 3697, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous yard. :) Composition is perfect and the bright, vibrant colors just jump right off my screen. About the only thing that could be improved is the sharpness. But, it is still a very pretty picture as is, good work.</td>', 'What a gorgeous yard. :) Composition is perfect and the bright, vibrant colors just jump right off my screen. About the only thing that could be improved is the sharpness. But, it is still a very pretty picture as is, good work.', '2003-06-12 17:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
