(323609, 24461, 3697, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I think it would look even better without the telephone lines as part of the background. But, I know it can sometimes be hard to find a good shot without pesky lines getting in the way. :)</td>', 'Good idea, but I think it would look even better without the telephone lines as part of the background. But, I know it can sometimes be hard to find a good shot without pesky lines getting in the way. :)', '2003-06-12 17:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
