(324677, 24419, 3080, '<td valign="top">This truck could definately work in a mini truckin magazine, but the surroundings are definately not right for the front cover of the magazine.  Besides, where''s the chick in the swimsuit? lol<br/>The powerlines, lines in the parkinglot, other red car and uncontroled glare on the window just don''t make it to the front page.  focus is also a little soft.<br/></td>', 'This truck could definately work in a mini truckin magazine, but the surroundings are definately not right for the front cover of the magazine.  Besides, where''s the chick in the swimsuit? lolThe powerlines, lines in the parkinglot, other red car and uncontroled glare on the window just don''t make it to the front page.  focus is also a little soft.', '2003-06-13 18:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(324679, 24042, 3080, '<td valign="top">dramatic angle works for this shot, but I''m afraid that the lack of detail in the dog is unappealing.  The lower left is really too bright.  If you were trying for a silhouette on the dog, there is too much detail for it to work.  however, not enough detail to work as a regular shot either.  focus also looks a bit soft, which could be because of the harsh lighting.<br/></td>', 'dramatic angle works for this shot, but I''m afraid that the lack of detail in the dog is unappealing.  The lower left is really too bright.  If you were trying for a silhouette on the dog, there is too much detail for it to work.  however, not enough detail to work as a regular shot either.  focus also looks a bit soft, which could be because of the harsh lighting.', '2003-06-13 18:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
