(324756, 24429, 3540, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of an old cover of a magazine called Omni. They used to have some photos that were similar.  Nice work.</td>', 'This reminds me of an old cover of a magazine called Omni. They used to have some photos that were similar.  Nice work.', '2003-06-13 21:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(324757, 24191, 6565, '<td valign="top">Simple, but I can definitely picture it as a cover for some reason.  I like the, well, simplicity of it!</td>', 'Simple, but I can definitely picture it as a cover for some reason.  I like the, well, simplicity of it!', '2003-06-13 21:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(324758, 24480, 3540, '<td valign="top">The border is a little off in terms of color.  The picture is right on.  great work</td>', 'The border is a little off in terms of color.  The picture is right on.  great work', '2003-06-13 21:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(324760, 24076, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  Like the gradient looking sky.</td>', 'Nice work.  Like the gradient looking sky.', '2003-06-13 21:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(324761, 24080, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think this one needs to focus on one of these great pieces of architecture.  both of them is a little cluttered and tough for the viewer to choose what to look at.</td>', 'I think this one needs to focus on one of these great pieces of architecture.  both of them is a little cluttered and tough for the viewer to choose what to look at.', '2003-06-13 21:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(324762, 23934, 3540, '<td valign="top">Just a smidge off on the focus.  Great concept and a pretty well taken photo.  Good work</td>', 'Just a smidge off on the focus.  Great concept and a pretty well taken photo.  Good work', '2003-06-13 21:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(324764, 23969, 3540, '<td valign="top">I would''ve gone for a lower perspective.  Something more unique than just standing next to the rack taking the picture.  Good subject, making it a good photo is the goal.</td>', 'I would''ve gone for a lower perspective.  Something more unique than just standing next to the rack taking the picture.  Good subject, making it a good photo is the goal.', '2003-06-13 21:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(324765, 24354, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I think you could''ve really got a little more creative and got some more color involved.  The concept is very very good.  It''s not a bad photo, but it needs a little more bite</td>', 'Great idea.  I think you could''ve really got a little more creative and got some more color involved.  The concept is very very good.  It''s not a bad photo, but it needs a little more bite', '2003-06-13 21:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(324767, 24464, 3540, '<td valign="top">There needs to be some definition where the hiker ends and the mountain begins, or vice versa.  Good idea but I think the execution fell just a little short.</td>', 'There needs to be some definition where the hiker ends and the mountain begins, or vice versa.  Good idea but I think the execution fell just a little short.', '2003-06-13 21:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(324768, 24423, 7556, '<td valign="top">Great macro, detail &amp; sharpness are nice...<br/>JB</td>', 'Great macro, detail & sharpness are nice...JB', '2003-06-13 21:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(324773, 24379, 9241, '<td valign="top">A definate National Geo cover! Maybe a kids edition. Maybe a little tight cropping , they got that border.  Nice tones and plenty of detail. If the nose was in focus too nearly a 10. I gave it 8. Very nice.</td>', 'A definate National Geo cover! Maybe a kids edition. Maybe a little tight cropping , they got that border.  Nice tones and plenty of detail. If the nose was in focus too nearly a 10. I gave it 8. Very nice.', '2003-06-13 22:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(324775, 24213, 9241, '<td valign="top">Tempts me to get my skis out of the garage. Jealous that you can still see snow in June. Great shot. Definately on target for a mag cover. Maybe composed with a little more sky to keep the houses in the lower third ( Leaves more title space on top too)</td>', 'Tempts me to get my skis out of the garage. Jealous that you can still see snow in June. Great shot. Definately on target for a mag cover. Maybe composed with a little more sky to keep the houses in the lower third ( Leaves more title space on top too)', '2003-06-13 22:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(324776, 24210, 9241, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. He was lookin'' right at you. Works for me as a Mag cover plenty of room for title and contents.</td>', 'Nice shot. He was lookin'' right at you. Works for me as a Mag cover plenty of room for title and contents.', '2003-06-13 22:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(324779, 24532, 9241, '<td valign="top">Nicely formated. As a chef I am familiar with the magazine and is definately thier style. If you tell me you made the chocolate yourself and give me the recipe I might raise your score to 10 ;)</td>', 'Nicely formated. As a chef I am familiar with the magazine and is definately thier style. If you tell me you made the chocolate yourself and give me the recipe I might raise your score to 10 ;)', '2003-06-13 22:23:19.000000', NULL, 1);
