(324810, 23988, 7291, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!  Good to see some humor here.  There have been some pretty nasty discussions about this challenge and this is a nice change.</td>', 'LOL!!!  Good to see some humor here.  There have been some pretty nasty discussions about this challenge and this is a nice change.', '2003-06-14 00:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(324811, 24405, 7291, '<td valign="top">Outstanding color!!!  I love the mix of light and shadow used here and this could definitely be used for a magazine cover.  10</td>', 'Outstanding color!!!  I love the mix of light and shadow used here and this could definitely be used for a magazine cover.  10', '2003-06-14 00:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(324812, 24290, 7291, '<td valign="top">That''s a heck of an interesting Heat Synch (?)  Good color and angle and would work very well on the covor of PC World.  Good Job.</td>', 'That''s a heck of an interesting Heat Synch (?)  Good color and angle and would work very well on the covor of PC World.  Good Job.', '2003-06-14 00:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(324817, 24497, 7291, '<td valign="top">Sexy.  But the yellowish tone of the lighting doesn''t suit it very well.  The angle is also too unusual to make it work, although I can understand if you were trying for the effect without revealing TOO much. ;)</td>', 'Sexy.  But the yellowish tone of the lighting doesn''t suit it very well.  The angle is also too unusual to make it work, although I can understand if you were trying for the effect without revealing TOO much. ;)', '2003-06-14 00:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(324818, 24056, 7291, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot.  The color, focus, contrast and the slight splash of yellow is a nice tough. I normally don''t like flower macros but this is too good to not give a 10.</td>', 'Incredible shot.  The color, focus, contrast and the slight splash of yellow is a nice tough. I normally don''t like flower macros but this is too good to not give a 10.', '2003-06-14 00:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(324819, 24479, 7291, '<td valign="top">A softer or not so busy background should draw more attention to the bears.  As is it, they kind of get lost on all the shapes and color.</td>', 'A softer or not so busy background should draw more attention to the bears.  As is it, they kind of get lost on all the shapes and color.', '2003-06-14 00:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(324821, 24315, 7291, '<td valign="top">Cool, I am watching game 5 as I write this.  Excellent shot.  Although this looks more like a shot from inside the magazine, it still is a perfect catch.</td>', 'Cool, I am watching game 5 as I write this.  Excellent shot.  Although this looks more like a shot from inside the magazine, it still is a perfect catch.', '2003-06-14 00:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(324822, 24390, 7291, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!  Where do you find something like that?  Very nice.</td>', 'WOW!!!  Where do you find something like that?  Very nice.', '2003-06-14 00:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(324823, 23968, 7778, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing! Hilarious!<br/>Good control and composition. <br/>Even the whiskers are visible! <br/>Congratulations to a great shot!</td>', 'Perfect timing! Hilarious!Good control and composition. Even the whiskers are visible! Congratulations to a great shot!', '2003-06-14 00:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(324824, 24073, 7291, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the water are so sharp and crisp that this almost looks fake.  VERY nice shot.  The boat on the lower right ruins it just a little bit but not enough to bring the score down.</td>', 'The reflections in the water are so sharp and crisp that this almost looks fake.  VERY nice shot.  The boat on the lower right ruins it just a little bit but not enough to bring the score down.', '2003-06-14 00:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(324825, 23990, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great composition, gorgeous model and would definitely work well as a cover.  My only gripe is that the soft natural lighting coming from the sun might have worked well on it''s own.  The fill flash looks really harsh.  You can see a bright reflection on her lips and dark shadow nder her chin - 9.</td>', 'Great composition, gorgeous model and would definitely work well as a cover.  My only gripe is that the soft natural lighting coming from the sun might have worked well on it''s own.  The fill flash looks really harsh.  You can see a bright reflection on her lips and dark shadow nder her chin - 9.', '2003-06-14 00:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(324827, 23998, 7291, '<td valign="top">Now.....THAT''S impressive!!!  No fair, you must have used a telescope. - This has got to be in the top 3 at least.  -  10</td>', 'Now.....THAT''S impressive!!!  No fair, you must have used a telescope. - This has got to be in the top 3 at least.  -  10', '2003-06-14 00:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(324828, 24442, 7291, '<td valign="top">Excellent set up. I can read the title on the bottom of the magazine already. - Perfect 10.</td>', 'Excellent set up. I can read the title on the bottom of the magazine already. - Perfect 10.', '2003-06-14 00:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(324832, 24297, 7291, '<td valign="top">I was about to give this an average score but I took the time to look as back issues from the magazine and realized that this could very well be next months issue.  Good job.</td>', 'I was about to give this an average score but I took the time to look as back issues from the magazine and realized that this could very well be next months issue.  Good job.', '2003-06-14 00:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(324833, 24218, 9340, '<td valign="top">Great color contrast, ok, great model as well.  Amazingly I''m drawn to her hair, I know.... I don''t believe it either, but the coloring in her hair really stands out.</td>', 'Great color contrast, ok, great model as well.  Amazingly I''m drawn to her hair, I know.... I don''t believe it either, but the coloring in her hair really stands out.', '2003-06-14 00:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(324836, 24140, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great example of a picture that would make a great magazine cover just as is.  Great lighting, composition, and enough room for text.  The shadow on the lower right bothers me just a bit but still an excellent photo.</td>', 'Great example of a picture that would make a great magazine cover just as is.  Great lighting, composition, and enough room for text.  The shadow on the lower right bothers me just a bit but still an excellent photo.', '2003-06-14 00:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(324837, 24401, 7291, '<td valign="top">I checked out some picture from this magaine online and came to the conclusion that, although it looks nice, a larger depth of field may have really helped.  Just my opinion.</td>', 'I checked out some picture from this magaine online and came to the conclusion that, although it looks nice, a larger depth of field may have really helped.  Just my opinion.', '2003-06-14 01:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(324838, 24282, 7291, '<td valign="top">Some you guys that post here need to just leave us newbies alone.  LOL!!!  This is an AMAZING picture!!!  Certainly the work of a pro.  I know some people have complained about the orientation of the pictures but I would publish a special edition in Landscape just to be able to us this picture on the cover.</td>', 'Some you guys that post here need to just leave us newbies alone.  LOL!!!  This is an AMAZING picture!!!  Certainly the work of a pro.  I know some people have complained about the orientation of the pictures but I would publish a special edition in Landscape just to be able to us this picture on the cover.', '2003-06-14 01:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(324839, 24092, 7291, '<td valign="top">Wow, great capture.  It''s not tack-sharop but under the circumstances I can understand.</td>', 'Wow, great capture.  It''s not tack-sharop but under the circumstances I can understand.', '2003-06-14 01:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(324841, 24101, 7291, '<td valign="top">Impressive.  This looks just like a picture from an in-depth Car &amp; Driver review or comparrison test.  The only thing that bothers me just a little bit, is the wind/bug deflector on the hood.  It just add an after-market feel that takes away from it.  I still think this is wonderful though. - 10</td>', 'Impressive.  This looks just like a picture from an in-depth Car & Driver review or comparrison test.  The only thing that bothers me just a little bit, is the wind/bug deflector on the hood.  It just add an after-market feel that takes away from it.  I still think this is wonderful though. - 10', '2003-06-14 01:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(324842, 24317, 7291, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!  Amazing.  What else can you say.......Amazing.</td>', 'WOW!!!  Amazing.  What else can you say.......Amazing.', '2003-06-14 01:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
