(324854, 24049, 4514, '<td valign="top">For some reason I feel that there is not enough light for my mood.  <br/>I would assume you live in Florida or some place that has this type of Wildlife.  I think more of a reflector or a fill would be warrented here.  I have similar shots and I do not like them.</td>', 'For some reason I feel that there is not enough light for my mood.  I would assume you live in Florida or some place that has this type of Wildlife.  I think more of a reflector or a fill would be warrented here.  I have similar shots and I do not like them.', '2003-06-14 02:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(324855, 24417, 4514, '<td valign="top">Title sounds more like an advertisement. Your lines are decent.</td>', 'Title sounds more like an advertisement. Your lines are decent.', '2003-06-14 02:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(324857, 24529, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very Sharp.  Not a Bad shot at all.  <br/></td>', 'Very Sharp.  Not a Bad shot at all.  ', '2003-06-14 02:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(324858, 24073, 4514, '<td valign="top">Color is crisp and you seem to be ok with composition.  I do however think that the Title, subject matter, and angle of shot are just not where they could be.  Seems to be a static of some sort that I can not pin down.  Your Depth is amazing though.  <br/></td>', 'Color is crisp and you seem to be ok with composition.  I do however think that the Title, subject matter, and angle of shot are just not where they could be.  Seems to be a static of some sort that I can not pin down.  Your Depth is amazing though.  ', '2003-06-14 02:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(324859, 24379, 4514, '<td valign="top">Oh this is just too Cute.</td>', 'Oh this is just too Cute.', '2003-06-14 02:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(324860, 24236, 4514, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea.  I think the light is a bit too harsh.  Try a diffuser then get the light up really close. The closer the light the softer the light will be.  I know it does not make sense, but that is what actually happens. <br/></td>', 'Nice Idea.  I think the light is a bit too harsh.  Try a diffuser then get the light up really close. The closer the light the softer the light will be.  I know it does not make sense, but that is what actually happens. ', '2003-06-14 02:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(324861, 24319, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot my friend.  This cn clearly make a Mag.  <br/></td>', 'This is a wonderful shot my friend.  This cn clearly make a Mag.  ', '2003-06-14 02:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(324862, 24271, 4514, '<td valign="top">Ok. I do not want to sound overly critical, and I know how hard this shot had to be.  There was no way to shot it over because you had to be at the right place at the right time.  You were there but the Soft focus from the Tail to hard focus on the head is a bit of a downer.  I like what you attempted but I have to shave a point off for that.   Sorry, but Good job.;</td>', 'Ok. I do not want to sound overly critical, and I know how hard this shot had to be.  There was no way to shot it over because you had to be at the right place at the right time.  You were there but the Soft focus from the Tail to hard focus on the head is a bit of a downer.  I like what you attempted but I have to shave a point off for that.   Sorry, but Good job.;', '2003-06-14 02:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(324863, 24403, 4514, '<td valign="top">I have a shot just like this.  Not as many people.  I know how difficult this shot is to make decent as far as post exposure is concerned. <br/></td>', 'I have a shot just like this.  Not as many people.  I know how difficult this shot is to make decent as far as post exposure is concerned. ', '2003-06-14 02:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
