(324888, 24175, 1829, '<td valign="top">Just AWESOME.  Colours, subject and dof are just brilliant.  Very well done.  GL in this weeks challenge.10</td>', 'Just AWESOME.  Colours, subject and dof are just brilliant.  Very well done.  GL in this weeks challenge.10', '2003-06-14 05:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(324889, 24512, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured image. Composition and color very good. Perfect DOF for your subject, people often try doing too much with depth of field. Nice job.<br/> <br/>No surprise; that is not a killer bee. Killer bees look like honey bees, but are much darker. I know, I''ve been attacked by them before.</td>', 'Beautifully captured image. Composition and color very good. Perfect DOF for your subject, people often try doing too much with depth of field. Nice job. No surprise; that is not a killer bee. Killer bees look like honey bees, but are much darker. I know, I''ve been attacked by them before.', '2003-06-14 05:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(324891, 24390, 5792, '<td valign="top">I really like the different shades od blue and aqua in this image. Well composed</td>', 'I really like the different shades od blue and aqua in this image. Well composed', '2003-06-14 05:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(324893, 24405, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent colours, dof is brillian!!  I love the choice of subject and it would certainly be a wonderful cover of a mag.  I also love the shadow effect on the bird.  Nicely composed as well.  GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Excellent colours, dof is brillian!!  I love the choice of subject and it would certainly be a wonderful cover of a mag.  I also love the shadow effect on the bird.  Nicely composed as well.  GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-06-14 05:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(324894, 24424, 5792, '<td valign="top">Making the strawberry in razor sharp focus with everything else in soft focus makes this a great image.</td>', 'Making the strawberry in razor sharp focus with everything else in soft focus makes this a great image.', '2003-06-14 05:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(324896, 24315, 3579, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Lots of room for type. 9</td>', 'Great shot! Lots of room for type. 9', '2003-06-14 05:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(324897, 24452, 7369, '<td valign="top">The sky with the clouds is very nice it gives me a beginning/ end of the day feeling. However while the dark ''coastline'' gives good contrast with the sky I think it is too dark (too underexposed). Perhaps a tip for you: when I try to capture (difficult) scenes like this I first focus my camera on the top of the trees/ beginning of the sky. After that I move my camera more upwards and capture the scene as I want. With Photoshop I then correct the colors to get a well exposed image.</td>', 'The sky with the clouds is very nice it gives me a beginning/ end of the day feeling. However while the dark ''coastline'' gives good contrast with the sky I think it is too dark (too underexposed). Perhaps a tip for you: when I try to capture (difficult) scenes like this I first focus my camera on the top of the trees/ beginning of the sky. After that I move my camera more upwards and capture the scene as I want. With Photoshop I then correct the colors to get a well exposed image.', '2003-06-14 05:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(324899, 24430, 7369, '<td valign="top">You have chosen a nice model for the picture. The red clothes combined with the red lipstick and work very well. There are some things which could be improved IMHO: the zipper is distracting and makes the picture quite ordinary. Also the skin tone is a little too white: ''warmer light'' would improve this greatly.</td>', 'You have chosen a nice model for the picture. The red clothes combined with the red lipstick and work very well. There are some things which could be improved IMHO: the zipper is distracting and makes the picture quite ordinary. Also the skin tone is a little too white: ''warmer light'' would improve this greatly.', '2003-06-14 06:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(324900, 24080, 7369, '<td valign="top">A nice picture although there is a loss of focus from the middle to the end.</td>', 'A nice picture although there is a loss of focus from the middle to the end.', '2003-06-14 06:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(324902, 24208, 7369, '<td valign="top">The DOF is too shallow in this picture. Because you used such a simple background I would like to see the whole subject in focus.</td>', 'The DOF is too shallow in this picture. Because you used such a simple background I would like to see the whole subject in focus.', '2003-06-14 06:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(324903, 24297, 2011, '<td valign="top">Small world.  My sister just emailed me to tell me she walks past this house nearly everyday.  Do you live in New Ulm?  Martin Luther student?   Anyway 8 on the picture.  I think a tighter crop would help, but thats just me!</td>', 'Small world.  My sister just emailed me to tell me she walks past this house nearly everyday.  Do you live in New Ulm?  Martin Luther student?   Anyway 8 on the picture.  I think a tighter crop would help, but thats just me!', '2003-06-14 06:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(324904, 24338, 3746, '<td valign="top">Gotta love plagarism. You could of at least tried to make this picture slightly different to "Liberty and Justice", unfortunately for yourself I regard originality and some self-creativity quite highly when voting photos. This is almost an EXACT rip-off of possibly the most popular photo on DPChallenge.com<br/>SHAME ON YOU.</td>', 'Gotta love plagarism. You could of at least tried to make this picture slightly different to "Liberty and Justice", unfortunately for yourself I regard originality and some self-creativity quite highly when voting photos. This is almost an EXACT rip-off of possibly the most popular photo on DPChallenge.comSHAME ON YOU.', '2003-06-14 06:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(324907, 24485, 7369, '<td valign="top">Considering the POV I don''t think this picture is very appealing.</td>', 'Considering the POV I don''t think this picture is very appealing.', '2003-06-14 06:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(324909, 24049, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo... but I''m afraid that text might go directly over this guys little head for a magazine cover.  So in that respect I don''t think you met the challenge.  Also putting the border on it looks more like a framed photo than a magazine cover.  The photo however is wonderful so your definitely getting points for that.  Great catch here, and it doesn''t look like you had to crop in too much either!  Wonderful job photography wise.</td>', 'Beautiful photo... but I''m afraid that text might go directly over this guys little head for a magazine cover.  So in that respect I don''t think you met the challenge.  Also putting the border on it looks more like a framed photo than a magazine cover.  The photo however is wonderful so your definitely getting points for that.  Great catch here, and it doesn''t look like you had to crop in too much either!  Wonderful job photography wise.', '2003-06-14 06:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(324910, 24461, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a fairly boring photo, but in some respects I guess I could see it as the front cover of a magazine titled what you have it as.  it''s a shame those powerlines are running through it, but that can''t be helped in many parts of the world.  The clouds are very nice, and I''m wondering if they would get lost in type?  The photo looks slightly tilted.. but maybe thats just me.</td>', 'This is a fairly boring photo, but in some respects I guess I could see it as the front cover of a magazine titled what you have it as.  it''s a shame those powerlines are running through it, but that can''t be helped in many parts of the world.  The clouds are very nice, and I''m wondering if they would get lost in type?  The photo looks slightly tilted.. but maybe thats just me.', '2003-06-14 06:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(324911, 24413, 4967, '<td valign="top">Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  Some very uneven lighting here... some of the rose looks too bright and some of it looks too dark.  Maybe that was what you were going for?  The shadows and part of the background are somewhat distracting, but not too bad.  I''m thinking type for the magazine might go directly over the top of some of the main part of the flower.Nice job with your focus though and getting most of the flower in focus, sometimes with macro thats hard to do.</td>', 'Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  Some very uneven lighting here... some of the rose looks too bright and some of it looks too dark.  Maybe that was what you were going for?  The shadows and part of the background are somewhat distracting, but not too bad.  I''m thinking type for the magazine might go directly over the top of some of the main part of the flower.Nice job with your focus though and getting most of the flower in focus, sometimes with macro thats hard to do.', '2003-06-14 06:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(324912, 24486, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice flare - simple shot, good for a cover. 8</td>', 'Nice flare - simple shot, good for a cover. 8', '2003-06-14 06:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(324913, 24217, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great mid air catch!  I would have liked to have seen the shutter speed just a little bit faster to keep the kids hand in focus.  I like the way the people are all sitting there watching him... might have been cool to have the two at the end watching and the two with the skateboards both doing some sort of trick.  It looks like there is tons of space at the bottom but not a lot at the top, I think I would have liked a little more room at the top for type.  I also think zooming in on the kid, and getting him more in the picture and less cement might have been more dramatic.</td>', 'Great mid air catch!  I would have liked to have seen the shutter speed just a little bit faster to keep the kids hand in focus.  I like the way the people are all sitting there watching him... might have been cool to have the two at the end watching and the two with the skateboards both doing some sort of trick.  It looks like there is tons of space at the bottom but not a lot at the top, I think I would have liked a little more room at the top for type.  I also think zooming in on the kid, and getting him more in the picture and less cement might have been more dramatic.', '2003-06-14 06:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(324914, 24427, 7369, '<td valign="top">What an artistic picture! The cloth reminds me of a bottle of red wine. Good use of colors.</td>', 'What an artistic picture! The cloth reminds me of a bottle of red wine. Good use of colors.', '2003-06-14 06:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(324915, 24092, 7369, '<td valign="top">Another excellent picture. Good work!</td>', 'Another excellent picture. Good work!', '2003-06-14 06:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(324916, 24218, 7369, '<td valign="top">A nice model with a good expression considering the magazine(s). The contrast between the background and foreground works quite well.</td>', 'A nice model with a good expression considering the magazine(s). The contrast between the background and foreground works quite well.', '2003-06-14 07:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(324918, 24292, 7369, '<td valign="top">I want to see more of the boat! The reflections are distracting.</td>', 'I want to see more of the boat! The reflections are distracting.', '2003-06-14 07:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(324919, 23971, 7369, '<td valign="top">You choice of colors is quite nice. The DOF however is far too shallow; I want to see far more of the mainboard in focus.</td>', 'You choice of colors is quite nice. The DOF however is far too shallow; I want to see far more of the mainboard in focus.', '2003-06-14 07:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
