(324938, 24497, 3579, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the angle would make this picture a candidate for a Playboy cover. The suggestiveness is a little too subtle - I''d wager something more direct would have worked better. People that buy Playboy don''t want to think too hard (except those that buy it for the articles :))</td>', 'I don''t think the angle would make this picture a candidate for a Playboy cover. The suggestiveness is a little too subtle - I''d wager something more direct would have worked better. People that buy Playboy don''t want to think too hard (except those that buy it for the articles :))', '2003-06-14 07:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
