(324983, 24139, 3579, '<td valign="top">Cute dog :) Nice crop and DOF. Not wild about the leash being visible. If you could have got it to keep that pose while being off the leash, that''d have been great :) 9</td>', 'Cute dog :) Nice crop and DOF. Not wild about the leash being visible. If you could have got it to keep that pose while being off the leash, that''d have been great :) 9', '2003-06-14 08:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
