(324985, 24515, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. There''s a LOT of free space for type though. Perhaps the background could have been a bit more graduated, rather than blown out all the way down.</td>', 'Nice composition. There''s a LOT of free space for type though. Perhaps the background could have been a bit more graduated, rather than blown out all the way down.', '2003-06-14 08:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
