(324997, 24282, 9343, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Hope it didn''t take too many shots to get the one you wanted or you may have had to call it "Inferno Magazine" :)</td>', 'Great shot. Hope it didn''t take too many shots to get the one you wanted or you may have had to call it "Inferno Magazine" :)', '2003-06-14 08:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(324998, 24406, 1829, '<td valign="top">A truely awesome capture.  Very well done.  Clarity, colour and subject is brilliant.  Well done and GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'A truely awesome capture.  Very well done.  Clarity, colour and subject is brilliant.  Well done and GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-06-14 08:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(324999, 24393, 1829, '<td valign="top">Remarkable image.  Wonderful lighting technique used and choice of subject.  The colour is just perfect too.  Nicely composed.  GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Remarkable image.  Wonderful lighting technique used and choice of subject.  The colour is just perfect too.  Nicely composed.  GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-06-14 08:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(325000, 24190, 3579, '<td valign="top">And I thought my magazine was a popular choice at the newstands :) I could definitely see this on the cover. great reflections.</td>', 'And I thought my magazine was a popular choice at the newstands :) I could definitely see this on the cover. great reflections.', '2003-06-14 08:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(325001, 24456, 3579, '<td valign="top">I think this would look MUCH better as a B&amp;W or duotone shot.</td>', 'I think this would look MUCH better as a B&W or duotone shot.', '2003-06-14 08:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(325002, 24464, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. excellent cover choice. 10.</td>', 'Nice shot. excellent cover choice. 10.', '2003-06-14 08:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(325003, 24327, 3579, '<td valign="top">The truck in the back detracts from the shot. Perhaps a different perspective could have shown all lawn, to give a better delineation of equipment.</td>', 'The truck in the back detracts from the shot. Perhaps a different perspective could have shown all lawn, to give a better delineation of equipment.', '2003-06-14 08:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(325004, 24427, 3579, '<td valign="top">Where''s the food and wine :)</td>', 'Where''s the food and wine :)', '2003-06-14 08:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(325005, 23968, 1829, '<td valign="top">LOL, what a fantastic capture.  To be honest, I''ve never seen a pic quite like this before.  I LOVE IT!!!  You did well on this one!!  GL in this weeks challenge. 10:)</td>', 'LOL, what a fantastic capture.  To be honest, I''ve never seen a pic quite like this before.  I LOVE IT!!!  You did well on this one!!  GL in this weeks challenge. 10:)', '2003-06-14 08:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(325006, 24489, 3579, '<td valign="top">I think you''d find that there''d be too many legal wrangles getting the nike swoosh on the front cover for them to use this shot. The concept/story link is a good idea though. 7.</td>', 'I think you''d find that there''d be too many legal wrangles getting the nike swoosh on the front cover for them to use this shot. The concept/story link is a good idea though. 7.', '2003-06-14 08:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(325007, 24117, 3579, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t there be a bird in the shot for a magazine like that?</td>', 'Shouldn''t there be a bird in the shot for a magazine like that?', '2003-06-14 08:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(325008, 24056, 1829, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image which is pleasing to the eye.  Colours and clarity are brilliant,  very well composed.  GL in this weeks challenge.  10:)</td>', 'A beautiful image which is pleasing to the eye.  Colours and clarity are brilliant,  very well composed.  GL in this weeks challenge.  10:)', '2003-06-14 08:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(325010, 24218, 3579, '<td valign="top">I could see that on a cover. Great lighting, pose and model. Very professional. 10.</td>', 'I could see that on a cover. Great lighting, pose and model. Very professional. 10.', '2003-06-14 08:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(325011, 23969, 7369, '<td valign="top">Hey de Oudemanhuispoort :). Nice to see the UvA once again.</td>', 'Hey de Oudemanhuispoort :). Nice to see the UvA once again.', '2003-06-14 08:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(325016, 24207, 7369, '<td valign="top">Nice image! The rhythmic background combined with the silhouette of the bird is very great. Not only that but you use it as a clever way to fit the magazine''s title. This photo is one of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Nice image! The rhythmic background combined with the silhouette of the bird is very great. Not only that but you use it as a clever way to fit the magazine''s title. This photo is one of my favorites this week.', '2003-06-14 08:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(325020, 24393, 3084, '<td valign="top">Love the red.  9 Morgan</td>', 'Love the red.  9 Morgan', '2003-06-14 08:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(325022, 24150, 3084, '<td valign="top">Love the red in this image.  Not perfect, but very good. 9 Morgan</td>', 'Love the red in this image.  Not perfect, but very good. 9 Morgan', '2003-06-14 08:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
