(325048, 24416, 7369, '<td valign="top">Your POV gives the photo a lot of appeal and at the same time fits it quite well to the chosen magazine. I really get the feeling of a Home Gardener.</td>', 'Your POV gives the photo a lot of appeal and at the same time fits it quite well to the chosen magazine. I really get the feeling of a Home Gardener.', '2003-06-14 08:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(325049, 24402, 7369, '<td valign="top">You did get up early didn''t you? The possible inconvenience of getting up early is rewarded with a stunning picture. Well done!</td>', 'You did get up early didn''t you? The possible inconvenience of getting up early is rewarded with a stunning picture. Well done!', '2003-06-14 09:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(325050, 24188, 7369, '<td valign="top">The position of the light is very good, just like the POV. I would have chosen a different background though; possible a featureless one to give the photo an even more artistic feeling. Still you did do a very good job.</td>', 'The position of the light is very good, just like the POV. I would have chosen a different background though; possible a featureless one to give the photo an even more artistic feeling. Still you did do a very good job.', '2003-06-14 09:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(325052, 24030, 7369, '<td valign="top">Nice expression on the cat!</td>', 'Nice expression on the cat!', '2003-06-14 09:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(325054, 24200, 3579, '<td valign="top">Looks like a National Geographic picture to me. 9.</td>', 'Looks like a National Geographic picture to me. 9.', '2003-06-14 09:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(325064, 24258, 9241, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good composition useing the rule of thirds. Plenty of room forTitle and articles, and a definate "country living" feeling</td>', 'Very nice, good composition useing the rule of thirds. Plenty of room forTitle and articles, and a definate "country living" feeling', '2003-06-14 10:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(325068, 24500, 9241, '<td valign="top">I think I would prefer the bloom in the bottom 1/3, leaving more space for the title. Great color.</td>', 'I think I would prefer the bloom in the bottom 1/3, leaving more space for the title. Great color.', '2003-06-14 10:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(325071, 24457, 9241, '<td valign="top">Kind of dark and very grainy</td>', 'Kind of dark and very grainy', '2003-06-14 10:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(325072, 24137, 9241, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I''m not big on borders but this really makes it cry National Geo.</td>', 'Very nice. I''m not big on borders but this really makes it cry National Geo.', '2003-06-14 10:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(325075, 23983, 9241, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2003-06-14 10:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(325076, 24282, 9241, '<td valign="top">Great pic. Just cant see the horizontal format in this challenge. Would have rated higher in any other challenge.</td>', 'Great pic. Just cant see the horizontal format in this challenge. Would have rated higher in any other challenge.', '2003-06-14 10:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(325078, 24514, 9241, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but out of focus. I dont care for the horizontal format in this challenge</td>', 'Nice subject, but out of focus. I dont care for the horizontal format in this challenge', '2003-06-14 10:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(325082, 24519, 4380, '<td valign="top">nice image, i like the abstract pattern, i really like also the composition. good work</td>', 'nice image, i like the abstract pattern, i really like also the composition. good work', '2003-06-14 11:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(325083, 24338, 4380, '<td valign="top">the concept and idea is not original but you still captured the image very good. still got a high score.</td>', 'the concept and idea is not original but you still captured the image very good. still got a high score.', '2003-06-14 11:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(325093, 24442, 7836, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! If you would take the obstacle away you would have a funny picture.</td>', 'Nice photo! If you would take the obstacle away you would have a funny picture.', '2003-06-14 12:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(325096, 24190, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great compostion, color, framing and content. The challenge is to creat an image worthy of your magazine, you acomplished that very well.</td>', 'Great compostion, color, framing and content. The challenge is to creat an image worthy of your magazine, you acomplished that very well.', '2003-06-14 12:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(325098, 24055, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice image... worthy of  the cover.</td>', 'Nice image... worthy of  the cover.', '2003-06-14 12:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(325101, 24465, 8911, '<td valign="top">I''m impressed. The silhouetted grass in the foreground takes what could have been a very ordinary sunset (sunrise?) shot, and makes it very dramatic.</td>', 'I''m impressed. The silhouetted grass in the foreground takes what could have been a very ordinary sunset (sunrise?) shot, and makes it very dramatic.', '2003-06-14 12:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(325105, 24370, 5792, '<td valign="top">Niocely composed image. Good angle. Showing artists at work would make a nice cover for your magazine. <br/> <br/>Meeting this challenge means that you image would match the quality and feel of the real magazine''s cover. Yours does. I''m sure they would be proud to have this image on their cover.</td>', 'Niocely composed image. Good angle. Showing artists at work would make a nice cover for your magazine.  Meeting this challenge means that you image would match the quality and feel of the real magazine''s cover. Yours does. I''m sure they would be proud to have this image on their cover.', '2003-06-14 12:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(325107, 24532, 5792, '<td valign="top">Oh, yes... this cover would grab any chocolate lover''s attention. Excellant composition and high technical quality.The green leaves gives it just the right amount of color.</td>', 'Oh, yes... this cover would grab any chocolate lover''s attention. Excellant composition and high technical quality.The green leaves gives it just the right amount of color.', '2003-06-14 12:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(325108, 24048, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting surrealistic quality</td>', 'Interesting surrealistic quality', '2003-06-14 12:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(325109, 24418, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well composed image. Easily a cover for you magazine</td>', 'Well composed image. Easily a cover for you magazine', '2003-06-14 12:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(325110, 24479, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d like to try lighting this so the light is mostly on the bears, with the quilt in a darker background. Right now the quilt is so bright it somewhat overwhelms the subject.</td>', 'I''d like to try lighting this so the light is mostly on the bears, with the quilt in a darker background. Right now the quilt is so bright it somewhat overwhelms the subject.', '2003-06-14 12:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(325111, 24504, 5792, '<td valign="top">Easily a cover for you magazine. The expression you captured would draw BabyTalk readers in droves.</td>', 'Easily a cover for you magazine. The expression you captured would draw BabyTalk readers in droves.', '2003-06-14 12:54:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(325113, 24145, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d like to try draping some sheer fabric over the back of the opening there so soften/darken the backlighting a little.</td>', 'I''d like to try draping some sheer fabric over the back of the opening there so soften/darken the backlighting a little.', '2003-06-14 12:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(325115, 24150, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice color in this image. To bad the power lines are there. They are always in my way to.</td>', 'Nice color in this image. To bad the power lines are there. They are always in my way to.', '2003-06-14 12:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(325116, 23990, 5792, '<td valign="top">Perfect cover shot for your magazine.<br/> <br/>Beautiful compsition, sharpness and the background does not distract from your subject. Your subject has the right amount of "allure" to draw reader''s to open and read the magazine. Easily as good or better than ELLE''s own covers.</td>', 'Perfect cover shot for your magazine. Beautiful compsition, sharpness and the background does not distract from your subject. Your subject has the right amount of "allure" to draw reader''s to open and read the magazine. Easily as good or better than ELLE''s own covers.', '2003-06-14 13:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(325120, 24173, 5792, '<td valign="top">I really like the left side shadow contrast with the red on the right. Looks slightly over edited, but a very nice cover image</td>', 'I really like the left side shadow contrast with the red on the right. Looks slightly over edited, but a very nice cover image', '2003-06-14 13:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(325121, 24379, 8911, '<td valign="top">That''s a horribly cute shot, though I''m not sure it might not do better on "Cat Fancier" or the like....</td>', 'That''s a horribly cute shot, though I''m not sure it might not do better on "Cat Fancier" or the like....', '2003-06-14 13:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(325122, 24234, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and softer overall focus works with this flower.</td>', 'Nice composition and softer overall focus works with this flower.', '2003-06-14 13:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(325123, 24420, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones in this shot.  Perfect black and white.  I really like the light colored flowers on the darkish background.  The baby is positioned very nicely as well.  My eyes want to see her face though.  Even without the face, this is a wonderful shot, great focus and clarity and the lighting looks to have been perfect as well.  Great shot.</td>', 'Very nice tones in this shot.  Perfect black and white.  I really like the light colored flowers on the darkish background.  The baby is positioned very nicely as well.  My eyes want to see her face though.  Even without the face, this is a wonderful shot, great focus and clarity and the lighting looks to have been perfect as well.  Great shot.', '2003-06-14 13:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(325124, 24501, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonals in this shot.  Focus and clarity are really doo as well.  Nice crisp numbers on the ruler.  Lighting is ok.  No bad glares, but I wish that the shadow on the diagonal object in the upper right were a bit more subtle.  Overall nice shot though.</td>', 'I like the diagonals in this shot.  Focus and clarity are really doo as well.  Nice crisp numbers on the ruler.  Lighting is ok.  No bad glares, but I wish that the shadow on the diagonal object in the upper right were a bit more subtle.  Overall nice shot though.', '2003-06-14 13:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(325126, 23930, 3080, '<td valign="top">This board is hard to photograph.  Trust me, I know.  I do think though that the background is a bit distracting, and probably anyone who would be reading a chess magazine, would be confused as to why this king was just sitting in the middle of nowhere and no other pieces around.<br/>Something I find quite distracting is the orangish light in the background toward the upper left.<br/>Good focus on the king.  Those frosted pieces are WAY difficult to get to look right, so going with the clear piece was a good choice.</td>', 'This board is hard to photograph.  Trust me, I know.  I do think though that the background is a bit distracting, and probably anyone who would be reading a chess magazine, would be confused as to why this king was just sitting in the middle of nowhere and no other pieces around.Something I find quite distracting is the orangish light in the background toward the upper left.Good focus on the king.  Those frosted pieces are WAY difficult to get to look right, so going with the clear piece was a good choice.', '2003-06-14 13:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(325127, 23950, 3080, '<td valign="top">This would be good on one of those ZooBooks for kids too.  Your focus and clarity on the owl are nice, and the background works for the most part.  I find the purple glow around the right edge of the branch to be very distracting.  Very pretty animal.</td>', 'This would be good on one of those ZooBooks for kids too.  Your focus and clarity on the owl are nice, and the background works for the most part.  I find the purple glow around the right edge of the branch to be very distracting.  Very pretty animal.', '2003-06-14 13:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(325128, 24437, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good composition and pose. <br/> <br/>Hope that is your lady and she had a blast posing for the Sports Illustrated Edition. She definitely has "the look".  I would have waded further out into the water to get more light on your subject''s face and put a bit more space over her head.</td>', 'Good composition and pose.  Hope that is your lady and she had a blast posing for the Sports Illustrated Edition. She definitely has "the look".  I would have waded further out into the water to get more light on your subject''s face and put a bit more space over her head.', '2003-06-14 13:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(325129, 24442, 3080, '<td valign="top">Rotate this about a degree to the right, there is a slight left tilt to the shot.  Both in the green horizon line, and the hurdles.  I wish that the focus could have been a little crisper on the runner.  More stop motion would look great in my opinion.  Looks liek this could be a Nike Ad.</td>', 'Rotate this about a degree to the right, there is a slight left tilt to the shot.  Both in the green horizon line, and the hurdles.  I wish that the focus could have been a little crisper on the runner.  More stop motion would look great in my opinion.  Looks liek this could be a Nike Ad.', '2003-06-14 13:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(325130, 24405, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition. I really like this image, particularly how the main subject starts at the lower roght, but the eye is almost perfectly placed in the upper right intersection point according to the rule of thirds. Well done.</td>', 'Great color and composition. I really like this image, particularly how the main subject starts at the lower roght, but the eye is almost perfectly placed in the upper right intersection point according to the rule of thirds. Well done.', '2003-06-14 13:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(325131, 24426, 3080, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, with the overcast sky and dull colors, I don''t think this would be appealing enough for the front cover of travel and leisure.  I wold also prefer this cropped 1/2 way down the mountain.  Bring out eyes down into the shot.  Maybe you could boost the colors with some saturation and brightness/contrast levels.</td>', 'Unfortunately, with the overcast sky and dull colors, I don''t think this would be appealing enough for the front cover of travel and leisure.  I wold also prefer this cropped 1/2 way down the mountain.  Bring out eyes down into the shot.  Maybe you could boost the colors with some saturation and brightness/contrast levels.', '2003-06-14 13:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(325132, 24071, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally welll composed shot wit the yellow rose surrounded by pink daisys. Would work well as a cover for you magazine.</td>', 'Exceptionally welll composed shot wit the yellow rose surrounded by pink daisys. Would work well as a cover for you magazine.', '2003-06-14 13:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(325133, 24465, 3080, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, good angle and nice colors.  I''m just not finding myself engrossed in this shot.  Would probably work on a magazine cover, but I don''t think it would convince me to buy it.  The few little out of focus weeds are a bit of a distraction for me.</td>', 'Pretty shot, good angle and nice colors.  I''m just not finding myself engrossed in this shot.  Would probably work on a magazine cover, but I don''t think it would convince me to buy it.  The few little out of focus weeds are a bit of a distraction for me.', '2003-06-14 13:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(325134, 24393, 5792, '<td valign="top">Just the right shade of background read lighting for your bike.</td>', 'Just the right shade of background read lighting for your bike.', '2003-06-14 13:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(325136, 24315, 5792, '<td valign="top">Easily could be the current cover for Sport''s Illustrated. Beatifully captured image and very timely. Great stop action shot.</td>', 'Easily could be the current cover for Sport''s Illustrated. Beatifully captured image and very timely. Great stop action shot.', '2003-06-14 13:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(325139, 24524, 3080, '<td valign="top">The ''mavica gang'' shoot with a 73, I thought.  If this is a shot making fun of them, or cutting them down in anyway, I think it''s rude.  If this is  actually taken by one of the students, then why aren''t you shooting with the 83?<br/>Anyway, the shadow created by the camera is a bit distracting, but focus and clarity on the front camera is really good.  Nice detail shown.  I''m not sure if I like the crop much, seems a bit too close for me.</td>', 'The ''mavica gang'' shoot with a 73, I thought.  If this is a shot making fun of them, or cutting them down in anyway, I think it''s rude.  If this is  actually taken by one of the students, then why aren''t you shooting with the 83?Anyway, the shadow created by the camera is a bit distracting, but focus and clarity on the front camera is really good.  Nice detail shown.  I''m not sure if I like the crop much, seems a bit too close for me.', '2003-06-14 13:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(325142, 24514, 8911, '<td valign="top">The depth of focus here is a little too shallow, with the sheep in focus but the girl not quite - especially as my eye goes first to the girl (since the lighting is more dramatic on her than on the sheep''s black face), it makes the picture look a bit awkward.</td>', 'The depth of focus here is a little too shallow, with the sheep in focus but the girl not quite - especially as my eye goes first to the girl (since the lighting is more dramatic on her than on the sheep''s black face), it makes the picture look a bit awkward.', '2003-06-14 13:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(325143, 24290, 8911, '<td valign="top">A nice choice of magazine and subject for this challenge, and very dramatic/pretty. I don''t get inside my computer often and must ask what on earth that is, however....</td>', 'A nice choice of magazine and subject for this challenge, and very dramatic/pretty. I don''t get inside my computer often and must ask what on earth that is, however....', '2003-06-14 13:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(325144, 24056, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nicely dramatic - good, vivid colors, and the use of the black background brings it out nicely. I like that it''s off-center and cut off to the left, and I have no idea exactly why that works so well, but it does.</td>', 'Nicely dramatic - good, vivid colors, and the use of the black background brings it out nicely. I like that it''s off-center and cut off to the left, and I have no idea exactly why that works so well, but it does.', '2003-06-14 13:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(325145, 24338, 5792, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image and executed well. It is a good shot, but you are gonna get trashed by some people for the flag theme and "copying" setzler''s classic shot.</td>', 'A beautiful image and executed well. It is a good shot, but you are gonna get trashed by some people for the flag theme and "copying" setzler''s classic shot.', '2003-06-14 13:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(325147, 24003, 8911, '<td valign="top">I''ve never heard of this magazine in my life (and a quick internet search didn''t turn up a magazine with that title). I''m not sure what this is (besides, presumably, made of rubber?). It could use either better focus or better lighting, though - I''m not sure which, but the whole picture looks blurry to me, too soft.</td>', 'I''ve never heard of this magazine in my life (and a quick internet search didn''t turn up a magazine with that title). I''m not sure what this is (besides, presumably, made of rubber?). It could use either better focus or better lighting, though - I''m not sure which, but the whole picture looks blurry to me, too soft.', '2003-06-14 13:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(325148, 24518, 8911, '<td valign="top">The silhouettes would be a nice effect - you have it set up to be very powerful, as far as how you framed the image, but everything''s blurred. Was this a slow exposure? The smudging of edges is something I see on my slow exposures when I move a bit. It really detracts from the image, making it strain the eye a bit to look at it, unfortunately.</td>', 'The silhouettes would be a nice effect - you have it set up to be very powerful, as far as how you framed the image, but everything''s blurred. Was this a slow exposure? The smudging of edges is something I see on my slow exposures when I move a bit. It really detracts from the image, making it strain the eye a bit to look at it, unfortunately.', '2003-06-14 13:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(325149, 23983, 8911, '<td valign="top">Was this meant to have the title of a book-review magazine? Since it seems to be a photo of a book, and I don''t see a corresponding magazine. It would work okay for that, if it weren''t also awfully blurry - it looks like your camera focussed on the bits of furniture (or whatever they are) in the upper left, instead of your subject.</td>', 'Was this meant to have the title of a book-review magazine? Since it seems to be a photo of a book, and I don''t see a corresponding magazine. It would work okay for that, if it weren''t also awfully blurry - it looks like your camera focussed on the bits of furniture (or whatever they are) in the upper left, instead of your subject.', '2003-06-14 13:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(325150, 24423, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice close up shot, but you are glorifying the weed.  making it look like a pretty thing to have around, however,  ''the gardener'' would cringe at the sight of dandelions.  Oh well.  Still a very nice close up shot, great detail, and lighting is nice as well.</td>', 'Nice close up shot, but you are glorifying the weed.  making it look like a pretty thing to have around, however,  ''the gardener'' would cringe at the sight of dandelions.  Oh well.  Still a very nice close up shot, great detail, and lighting is nice as well.', '2003-06-14 13:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(325151, 24255, 8911, '<td valign="top">The foreground on this one is very pretty; I would like the shot better if the backdrop were better controlled, and the photo was even. With the focus on the cake, it would help if it were horizontal in the photo (or further off the horizontal, if the sloping is deliberate) - as it is, it''s clear that it angles (since it''s so close to the top of the picture) but looks accidental. The folding chair or stepladder (can''t tell which) in the background really stands out as well. The same shot might have worked better if you''d brought a chair or two (or something) close in behind the cake, and draped them with a length of fabric in a suitable color (maybe dark brown or black, here) to prevent the background from intruding on the effect.</td>', 'The foreground on this one is very pretty; I would like the shot better if the backdrop were better controlled, and the photo was even. With the focus on the cake, it would help if it were horizontal in the photo (or further off the horizontal, if the sloping is deliberate) - as it is, it''s clear that it angles (since it''s so close to the top of the picture) but looks accidental. The folding chair or stepladder (can''t tell which) in the background really stands out as well. The same shot might have worked better if you''d brought a chair or two (or something) close in behind the cake, and draped them with a length of fabric in a suitable color (maybe dark brown or black, here) to prevent the background from intruding on the effect.', '2003-06-14 13:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(325153, 23969, 3080, '<td valign="top">very cluttered.  I think had you focussed in on one or 2 bikes, this might have had more appeal on the front of a magazine.  I think your focus and clarity are ok, but too busy to really see much detail.  lighting seems a bit dark, and the colors don''t stand out well in this shot.  definately bikes though.</td>', 'very cluttered.  I think had you focussed in on one or 2 bikes, this might have had more appeal on the front of a magazine.  I think your focus and clarity are ok, but too busy to really see much detail.  lighting seems a bit dark, and the colors don''t stand out well in this shot.  definately bikes though.', '2003-06-14 13:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(325154, 24177, 8911, '<td valign="top">This looks like a photo of a magazine, rather than for a magazine. It''s well layed-out for what it is, but it doesn''t seem to meet the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a photo of a magazine, rather than for a magazine. It''s well layed-out for what it is, but it doesn''t seem to meet the challenge.', '2003-06-14 13:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(325155, 24369, 3080, '<td valign="top">The colors of this are muted, and the sky is quite unattractive.  I''m also a little confused by the things coming in from the bottom of the photo.  they bother me.  I would also have liked to see the entire diamond in the shot.  left crop is a little odd.</td>', 'The colors of this are muted, and the sky is quite unattractive.  I''m also a little confused by the things coming in from the bottom of the photo.  they bother me.  I would also have liked to see the entire diamond in the shot.  left crop is a little odd.', '2003-06-14 13:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(325156, 24215, 8911, '<td valign="top">Does that magazine exist? Very interesting visual effect, though; it seems a pity the top of the statue (?) is cut off.</td>', 'Does that magazine exist? Very interesting visual effect, though; it seems a pity the top of the statue (?) is cut off.', '2003-06-14 13:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(325157, 24282, 3080, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot. wonderful focus and clarity.  this shot is really good, but looks like the flag is on fire in the bottom right corner.  Not really sure what is going on.  why the flag in the middle of the fire?  Still a really great shot.  the fire looks good, and the detail in this really makes it for me.</td>', 'wonderful shot. wonderful focus and clarity.  this shot is really good, but looks like the flag is on fire in the bottom right corner.  Not really sure what is going on.  why the flag in the middle of the fire?  Still a really great shot.  the fire looks good, and the detail in this really makes it for me.', '2003-06-14 13:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(325159, 24310, 8911, '<td valign="top">A nice black and white - the building in the background is distracting, especially at the left side, but I don\''t see how you could have blurred it out without also losing the crispness on the car itself, which would have been a poor trade-off. This might be hard to fit on a cover, unless they frame it above and below with dead space or use it as a smaller accent picture.</td>', 'A nice black and white - the building in the background is distracting, especially at the left side, but I don\''t see how you could have blurred it out without also losing the crispness on the car itself, which would have been a poor trade-off. This might be hard to fit on a cover, unless they frame it above and below with dead space or use it as a smaller accent picture.', '2003-06-14 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(325160, 24422, 8911, '<td valign="top">I don''t find the pose especially believable, but my bigger concern with this photo is that you''ve let the background take over. Even though your subject fills most of the frame, the background''s not significantly more blurred - and weeds, a plastic trash can, the edge of a picnic table, the building''s roof slanting down into the picture - it''s all very distracting/cluttery. A different place and background might have strengthened this image a lot (either blurring the background out, finding something restful, or using a background of more intrinsic interest/excitement so that it was part of, rather than an intrusion on, the feel of the image).</td>', 'I don''t find the pose especially believable, but my bigger concern with this photo is that you''ve let the background take over. Even though your subject fills most of the frame, the background''s not significantly more blurred - and weeds, a plastic trash can, the edge of a picnic table, the building''s roof slanting down into the picture - it''s all very distracting/cluttery. A different place and background might have strengthened this image a lot (either blurring the background out, finding something restful, or using a background of more intrinsic interest/excitement so that it was part of, rather than an intrusion on, the feel of the image).', '2003-06-14 13:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(325162, 24048, 8911, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is so harsh - the glare on the left side is distracting, as is the fogging from it, and it looks like you used a plastic doll from both the pose/angle of the head and the lighting (though I find it harder to believe a doll could achieve that angle of the wrist). I''m not sure what the background was, but it looks like it was at an angle - streaks/striations are visible on it.</td>', 'The lighting on this is so harsh - the glare on the left side is distracting, as is the fogging from it, and it looks like you used a plastic doll from both the pose/angle of the head and the lighting (though I find it harder to believe a doll could achieve that angle of the wrist). I''m not sure what the background was, but it looks like it was at an angle - streaks/striations are visible on it.', '2003-06-14 14:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(325163, 24468, 8911, '<td valign="top">A cute and funny concept, and well-shot, but I just don''t see it on a magazine cover - it''s got room for text, but I''m hard-pressed to accept that an addiction-themed magazine would actually place a camera on their cover at all.</td>', 'A cute and funny concept, and well-shot, but I just don''t see it on a magazine cover - it''s got room for text, but I''m hard-pressed to accept that an addiction-themed magazine would actually place a camera on their cover at all.', '2003-06-14 14:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(325164, 24166, 8911, '<td valign="top">A lovely spider - a nature-themed magazine might have been more appropriate, though, especially considering the backdrop.</td>', 'A lovely spider - a nature-themed magazine might have been more appropriate, though, especially considering the backdrop.', '2003-06-14 14:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(325168, 24269, 8911, '<td valign="top">I find this hard to believe for a magazine cover - in part because a shot that didn''t have number 12 on the right, grimacing as if in pain, might be a bit more attractive. Perhaps a crop that stopped at the woman next ot her might have worked better for this.</td>', 'I find this hard to believe for a magazine cover - in part because a shot that didn''t have number 12 on the right, grimacing as if in pain, might be a bit more attractive. Perhaps a crop that stopped at the woman next ot her might have worked better for this.', '2003-06-14 14:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(325169, 24112, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, overall, but I have trouble envisioning where magazine text would go other than in a neutral frame, if one were placed around it. The contrast between the smooth/sleek bike and the patterns and crowded feel of the patches to the right is really nice and works well, though.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, overall, but I have trouble envisioning where magazine text would go other than in a neutral frame, if one were placed around it. The contrast between the smooth/sleek bike and the patterns and crowded feel of the patches to the right is really nice and works well, though.', '2003-06-14 14:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(325170, 23998, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice, nice dramatic photograph. I like the way most of the photo is black, and yet there''s this awareness of weight to the upper left corner, the awareness that the moon is there, just hidden.  The detail on this, and the framing of it, are both excellent.</td>', 'Nice, nice dramatic photograph. I like the way most of the photo is black, and yet there''s this awareness of weight to the upper left corner, the awareness that the moon is there, just hidden.  The detail on this, and the framing of it, are both excellent.', '2003-06-14 14:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(325171, 24529, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a nice macro shot - the detail of the flower''s center, to the point of seeing the grit, and the flush of (wax? oil? liquid?) on the petals, is really nice. It''s easy to see how text could be placed over the petals without damaging the image as well, when it was placed on the cover.</td>', 'This is a nice macro shot - the detail of the flower''s center, to the point of seeing the grit, and the flush of (wax? oil? liquid?) on the petals, is really nice. It''s easy to see how text could be placed over the petals without damaging the image as well, when it was placed on the cover.', '2003-06-14 14:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(325172, 24464, 8911, '<td valign="top">The blue-green lighting is gorgeous, as is the silhouette effect. The placement - letting the hill/mound dominate the lower part, the subject jutting up into the light - is really nice.</td>', 'The blue-green lighting is gorgeous, as is the silhouette effect. The placement - letting the hill/mound dominate the lower part, the subject jutting up into the light - is really nice.', '2003-06-14 14:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(325173, 24512, 8911, '<td valign="top">Very pretty - though it looks a bit like the bee is hanging in midair with its wings unspread (and therefore not flying), at this detail level.</td>', 'Very pretty - though it looks a bit like the bee is hanging in midair with its wings unspread (and therefore not flying), at this detail level.', '2003-06-14 14:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(325175, 24415, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this one - it makes for a very airy, ethereal effect that''s so appropriate for your subject! Nice balance to the image, as well.</td>', 'I like the lighting on this one - it makes for a very airy, ethereal effect that''s so appropriate for your subject! Nice balance to the image, as well.', '2003-06-14 14:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(325202, 24430, 255, '<td valign="top">absolutely fabulous arnit--she is gorgeous, your photography is awesome and you, as usual, are my hero! :) <br/> <br/>i love the contrast of red and green with her blonde hair--very striking and stunning. my only teeny nitpick--more for real life than anything--is being careful of mixing warm and cool shades of red--this lipstick looks great on her, but generally red lipsick is glamorous on its own and tends to be worn more with neutral colors to highlight the splash of color and the elegance the red brings.  im still giving you a 10 because this shot is so wonderful, but had she a black or white shirt on i would have given you a 20! ;)</td>', 'absolutely fabulous arnit--she is gorgeous, your photography is awesome and you, as usual, are my hero! :)  i love the contrast of red and green with her blonde hair--very striking and stunning. my only teeny nitpick--more for real life than anything--is being careful of mixing warm and cool shades of red--this lipstick looks great on her, but generally red lipsick is glamorous on its own and tends to be worn more with neutral colors to highlight the splash of color and the elegance the red brings.  im still giving you a 10 because this shot is so wonderful, but had she a black or white shirt on i would have given you a 20! ;)', '2003-06-14 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(325206, 24290, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great composition, color and content. Lighting is just right. This image and the angle you have selected begs the would-be reader to look inside and find out what it is all about.<br/> <br/>There are few cases in this challenge where the photographer''s cover shot is better than the real magazine''s. Yours is, in fact, much better than what they usually put on their cover. They should hire you.<br/></td>', 'Great composition, color and content. Lighting is just right. This image and the angle you have selected begs the would-be reader to look inside and find out what it is all about. There are few cases in this challenge where the photographer''s cover shot is better than the real magazine''s. Yours is, in fact, much better than what they usually put on their cover. They should hire you.', '2003-06-14 16:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(325208, 24427, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful glass shadow. The pink textured background is spectacular. Good technical quality</td>', 'Wonderful glass shadow. The pink textured background is spectacular. Good technical quality', '2003-06-14 16:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(325209, 24140, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured image. Great lighting. Extreamly high technical quality.</td>', 'Beautifully captured image. Great lighting. Extreamly high technical quality.', '2003-06-14 16:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(325210, 24515, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and single color focus. Exceptional technical quality. Including the shells makes this an exceptional image.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and single color focus. Exceptional technical quality. Including the shells makes this an exceptional image.', '2003-06-14 16:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(325211, 24423, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and use of DOF</td>', 'Beautiful composition and use of DOF', '2003-06-14 16:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(325213, 24430, 5792, '<td valign="top">Your model''s "look" is perfect for Vogue. It is as good as their own covers. Soft focus green colored background adds color balance.</td>', 'Your model''s "look" is perfect for Vogue. It is as good as their own covers. Soft focus green colored background adds color balance.', '2003-06-14 16:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(325214, 24293, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptional high quality night shot. Would be perfect on the cover of your magazine. Lighting and color well balanced.</td>', 'Exceptional high quality night shot. Would be perfect on the cover of your magazine. Lighting and color well balanced.', '2003-06-14 16:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(325215, 24530, 7653, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range. Face might be a liiiiiitle too dark in that shadow, but otherwise great.</td>', 'Nice tonal range. Face might be a liiiiiitle too dark in that shadow, but otherwise great.', '2003-06-14 16:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(325216, 24461, 7653, '<td valign="top">I like the radiant colors. Like the grass as dominant subject. Dont like The telephone poles/wires, especially for the chosen magazine.</td>', 'I like the radiant colors. Like the grass as dominant subject. Dont like The telephone poles/wires, especially for the chosen magazine.', '2003-06-14 17:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(325217, 24406, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great stop-action shot. Captured a good moment.</td>', 'Great stop-action shot. Captured a good moment.', '2003-06-14 17:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(325218, 24464, 7653, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors for this sillouhete. Would like to see more separation of the bottom of ther person from the rock. She melds into it too much to distinguish. Same thing with the head, maybe have her turn to a side so we can get a better, more human-looking profile to the face.</td>', 'Beautiful colors for this sillouhete. Would like to see more separation of the bottom of ther person from the rock. She melds into it too much to distinguish. Same thing with the head, maybe have her turn to a side so we can get a better, more human-looking profile to the face.', '2003-06-14 17:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(325219, 24429, 7653, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... I like the concept, how the bottom of the jar fades into a perfect brightness. However I dont like how the printing is backwards, instinctually I need those numbers and words to be on the frontside so it doesnt ''bother'' me.</td>', 'Hmmmm... I like the concept, how the bottom of the jar fades into a perfect brightness. However I dont like how the printing is backwards, instinctually I need those numbers and words to be on the frontside so it doesnt ''bother'' me.', '2003-06-14 17:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(325220, 24042, 7653, '<td valign="top">This shot loses points for looking like it was taken in 2 seconds. I dont think it gives off a professional feel worthy of a mag cover. Colors in the sky are a bit oversatureated...</td>', 'This shot loses points for looking like it was taken in 2 seconds. I dont think it gives off a professional feel worthy of a mag cover. Colors in the sky are a bit oversatureated...', '2003-06-14 17:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(325221, 24218, 5792, '<td valign="top">A high quality image. A bit racy for this site, but well done. The darker tropical background highlights your subject;as if she needs more to attract the viewer''s eye to her. :)<br/> <br/>Good technical quality, focus and lighting.</td>', 'A high quality image. A bit racy for this site, but well done. The darker tropical background highlights your subject;as if she needs more to attract the viewer''s eye to her. :) Good technical quality, focus and lighting.', '2003-06-14 17:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(325222, 24334, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2003-06-14 17:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(325223, 24181, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this was quite the intent of the challenge. Then again, I suppose I could see something like this on a yearly review maybe. I do like the lighting, though, the shaft of light highlighting the magazines almost feels like reading them is a guilty pleasure and someone has opened a door into a dark room where the view is trying to read them.</td>', 'I''m not sure this was quite the intent of the challenge. Then again, I suppose I could see something like this on a yearly review maybe. I do like the lighting, though, the shaft of light highlighting the magazines almost feels like reading them is a guilty pleasure and someone has opened a door into a dark room where the view is trying to read them.', '2003-06-14 17:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(325224, 24139, 5792, '<td valign="top">Easily a cover quality image. A proud stance, just right for your magazin''e cover.</td>', 'Easily a cover quality image. A proud stance, just right for your magazin''e cover.', '2003-06-14 17:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(325225, 24415, 7653, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhh this is a beautiful shot. My only real complaint is that the photo feels kinda out of place with the studio setup (i.e. white background). The butterfly alone, or the flower alone on the stark white is fine, but with both together my mind wants to know "where''s all the grass, trees, and other greenage in the background?"</td>', 'Ahhhhh this is a beautiful shot. My only real complaint is that the photo feels kinda out of place with the studio setup (i.e. white background). The butterfly alone, or the flower alone on the stark white is fine, but with both together my mind wants to know "where''s all the grass, trees, and other greenage in the background?"', '2003-06-14 17:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(325226, 24049, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptional image. Perfect dimensions for a cover.</td>', 'Exceptional image. Perfect dimensions for a cover.', '2003-06-14 17:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(325227, 24045, 5792, '<td valign="top">I really like the color of this image. This is "cover quality" all the way.</td>', 'I really like the color of this image. This is "cover quality" all the way.', '2003-06-14 17:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(325228, 24533, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion and use of DOF</td>', 'Nice compostion and use of DOF', '2003-06-14 17:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(325229, 24175, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellant stop action shot. Soft background ficus highlights the main subject.</td>', 'Excellant stop action shot. Soft background ficus highlights the main subject.', '2003-06-14 17:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(325230, 24460, 5792, '<td valign="top">Just an exceptional image more than worthy for the cover of your magazine. Great lighting, composition and focus</td>', 'Just an exceptional image more than worthy for the cover of your magazine. Great lighting, composition and focus', '2003-06-14 17:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(325231, 24174, 5792, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of National Geo cover images in this challenge, including one of the more humorous and creative images I''ve seen in a long time. But yours is the best. It is certainly worthy for the cover of National Geographic. Terrific job.</td>', 'There are a lot of National Geo cover images in this challenge, including one of the more humorous and creative images I''ve seen in a long time. But yours is the best. It is certainly worthy for the cover of National Geographic. Terrific job.', '2003-06-14 17:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(325233, 24281, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptional image.</td>', 'Exceptional image.', '2003-06-14 17:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(325235, 24079, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good technical quality, focus and color</td>', 'Good technical quality, focus and color', '2003-06-14 17:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(325237, 24503, 5792, '<td valign="top">Insect shots are difficult. Just a good, good image. Exceptional quality.</td>', 'Insect shots are difficult. Just a good, good image. Exceptional quality.', '2003-06-14 17:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(325239, 24514, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image looks a little blurry and out of focus, probably due to camera shake from being taken handheld. The resolution also seems a little low, suggesting to me that it was possibly taken with a low-end camera. If that is the case then it is usually best to take shots with the highest possible resolution. I do like the light on her face and the side of the sheep, though. Another possible reason for the focus problem could be the dark face of the sheep compared to the bright face of the girl. The composition is good, although maybe a little extra space on the side of the sheep so it doesnt look like his ear is cropped off would have worked good too.</td>', 'The image looks a little blurry and out of focus, probably due to camera shake from being taken handheld. The resolution also seems a little low, suggesting to me that it was possibly taken with a low-end camera. If that is the case then it is usually best to take shots with the highest possible resolution. I do like the light on her face and the side of the sheep, though. Another possible reason for the focus problem could be the dark face of the sheep compared to the bright face of the girl. The composition is good, although maybe a little extra space on the side of the sheep so it doesnt look like his ear is cropped off would have worked good too.', '2003-06-14 17:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(325240, 24415, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image has a very high "WOW" coefficient. Good color, composition, preparation and a high degree of difficulty.</td>', 'This image has a very high "WOW" coefficient. Good color, composition, preparation and a high degree of difficulty.', '2003-06-14 17:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(325242, 24282, 7653, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, interesting. I liike any photograph that incorporates fire. I think you should have tried to get some light on the front of the helmet/flag... too dark.</td>', 'Hmmmm, interesting. I liike any photograph that incorporates fire. I think you should have tried to get some light on the front of the helmet/flag... too dark.', '2003-06-14 17:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(325243, 24042, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette and the fact that he is looking toward the light. The odd slant of the horizon is in some ways interesting and in others kinda off-putting, I cant really make up my mind if I like it or not. The image itself is a little small and you could afford to go as big as you can or the rules allow so as to get as much detail in as possible. The right side of the sky is a little over-exposed and blown out, using levels or curves in an editing program may have helped some. With a little tweaking I do see an image like this being on the cover of a dog magazine.</td>', 'I like the silhouette and the fact that he is looking toward the light. The odd slant of the horizon is in some ways interesting and in others kinda off-putting, I cant really make up my mind if I like it or not. The image itself is a little small and you could afford to go as big as you can or the rules allow so as to get as much detail in as possible. The right side of the sky is a little over-exposed and blown out, using levels or curves in an editing program may have helped some. With a little tweaking I do see an image like this being on the cover of a dog magazine.', '2003-06-14 17:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(325244, 23990, 7653, '<td valign="top">This woman is beautiful; the shot is pretty good. The lighting seems kinda harsh/bright for an Elle-style cover, the bright spot on the right side of her face is distracting. The hair should have been a little more in place too. I dont know about the choice of background....</td>', 'This woman is beautiful; the shot is pretty good. The lighting seems kinda harsh/bright for an Elle-style cover, the bright spot on the right side of her face is distracting. The hair should have been a little more in place too. I dont know about the choice of background....', '2003-06-14 17:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(325245, 24409, 7653, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Dont like how the tree is totally cropped out of the photo. Get a lot more, if not all, of it in the fame next time. There''s not much of interest here for potential viewers, except maybe the fractal-like pattern of the branches. Nevertheless, I think this could have been shown bettern in other ways.</td>', 'Hmmm. Dont like how the tree is totally cropped out of the photo. Get a lot more, if not all, of it in the fame next time. There''s not much of interest here for potential viewers, except maybe the fractal-like pattern of the branches. Nevertheless, I think this could have been shown bettern in other ways.', '2003-06-14 17:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(325246, 24407, 7653, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, this is interesting. I like it. The orange dots really detract from the rest of the spiral however. Get those out next time.</td>', 'Hmmm, this is interesting. I like it. The orange dots really detract from the rest of the spiral however. Get those out next time.', '2003-06-14 17:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(325248, 24339, 7653, '<td valign="top">This is a nice subject to get some good photos from. All those hats are really cute. However, I dont like the anle/composition you chose. I think either a straigh-on appraoch or some other angle (closer?) would have made these hats more interesting.</td>', 'This is a nice subject to get some good photos from. All those hats are really cute. However, I dont like the anle/composition you chose. I think either a straigh-on appraoch or some other angle (closer?) would have made these hats more interesting.', '2003-06-14 17:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(325249, 24236, 7653, '<td valign="top">This is too boring, in my opinion. Its too much of a point and shoot, standing above the table kind of shot. Get some different angles, I think any angle would be more interesting than this.</td>', 'This is too boring, in my opinion. Its too much of a point and shoot, standing above the table kind of shot. Get some different angles, I think any angle would be more interesting than this.', '2003-06-14 17:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(325250, 24207, 7653, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I like the iconic style here. Strange color to have chosen, but it keeps me interested. I really love the pattern from the net/fence. Nice crop choice. Well done.</td>', 'Yeah, I like the iconic style here. Strange color to have chosen, but it keeps me interested. I really love the pattern from the net/fence. Nice crop choice. Well done.', '2003-06-14 17:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(325251, 24217, 7653, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, would have liked to see more of the skateboarder fill the frame, instead of the surrounding concrete. I think maybe a side angle would have workeed better too, then we could have seen his legs spread out, whereas now, that front leg looses its dimension.</td>', 'Nice capture, would have liked to see more of the skateboarder fill the frame, instead of the surrounding concrete. I think maybe a side angle would have workeed better too, then we could have seen his legs spread out, whereas now, that front leg looses its dimension.', '2003-06-14 17:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(325252, 24488, 7653, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhh... I was going to try this mag for a cover shot. Dont have much to say except I dont think this setup makes the cigar or cigar-smoking look all that appealing.</td>', 'Ahhhhh... I was going to try this mag for a cover shot. Dont have much to say except I dont think this setup makes the cigar or cigar-smoking look all that appealing.', '2003-06-14 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(325253, 24439, 7653, '<td valign="top">There''s no way this would make the cover of Teen mag. Its nothing like the style of their covers, or most magazine covers for that matter. Camera needs to be way closer in to the girls. Chatting away on the phone is a nice concept, but again, there is simply just too much backgorund and not enough detail on these girls.</td>', 'There''s no way this would make the cover of Teen mag. Its nothing like the style of their covers, or most magazine covers for that matter. Camera needs to be way closer in to the girls. Chatting away on the phone is a nice concept, but again, there is simply just too much backgorund and not enough detail on these girls.', '2003-06-14 17:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(325254, 24500, 7653, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... usually I dont likea  composition where the flower sits smack dab in the center, but this one is kind of interesting. However, Im kind of bothered by the fack that I cant really see the stalk for the flower, too blurry.</td>', 'Hmmm... usually I dont likea  composition where the flower sits smack dab in the center, but this one is kind of interesting. However, Im kind of bothered by the fack that I cant really see the stalk for the flower, too blurry.', '2003-06-14 17:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(325255, 24452, 7653, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm. I dont like how the hills are so dark we lose all detail. This sky would have worked nicely for a sillouette, but I dont like this composition for it.</td>', 'Hmmmm. I dont like how the hills are so dark we lose all detail. This sky would have worked nicely for a sillouette, but I dont like this composition for it.', '2003-06-14 17:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(325256, 24447, 7653, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Chosen angle is dynamic and interesting to look at. My eye shuns that bridge (?) piece on the last two strings. I think a more appropriate hue of color could have been chosen, more of a traditinal, darker sepia probably. We start to see some noise towards the bottom where the focus drops out. Diddnt really mark down for this, but right before the fretboard starts its especially noticable.</td>', 'Hmmm. Chosen angle is dynamic and interesting to look at. My eye shuns that bridge (?) piece on the last two strings. I think a more appropriate hue of color could have been chosen, more of a traditinal, darker sepia probably. We start to see some noise towards the bottom where the focus drops out. Diddnt really mark down for this, but right before the fretboard starts its especially noticable.', '2003-06-14 17:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(325257, 24369, 7653, '<td valign="top">Dont take offense, but point-and-shoot taken from the nosebleed section = way too boring for me and anyone else looking at this. Sky is way overexposed.... but that doesnt really matter. Fine ANYTHING more interesting to shoot than this next time.</td>', 'Dont take offense, but point-and-shoot taken from the nosebleed section = way too boring for me and anyone else looking at this. Sky is way overexposed.... but that doesnt really matter. Fine ANYTHING more interesting to shoot than this next time.', '2003-06-14 17:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(325258, 24408, 7653, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Nice hues (red) and detail. Not sure if I agree witht he crop/composition choice. Would have liked to see more of the grill. I like the somewhat abstract attempt, better luck next time...</td>', 'Hmmm. Nice hues (red) and detail. Not sure if I agree witht he crop/composition choice. Would have liked to see more of the grill. I like the somewhat abstract attempt, better luck next time...', '2003-06-14 17:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(325259, 24320, 7653, '<td valign="top">Shot is much too dark. Guitar is bumping into the breast of the main subject. A yellow-green colorcast from the indoor lighting permeates the shot. Keep these in mind next time...</td>', 'Shot is much too dark. Guitar is bumping into the breast of the main subject. A yellow-green colorcast from the indoor lighting permeates the shot. Keep these in mind next time...', '2003-06-14 17:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(325260, 24402, 7653, '<td valign="top">Wow. Beautiul hues and I like that light sneaking out of the middle of the frame. Would have loved to see more of the road to tie the composition together...</td>', 'Wow. Beautiul hues and I like that light sneaking out of the middle of the frame. Would have loved to see more of the road to tie the composition together...', '2003-06-14 17:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(325261, 24303, 7653, '<td valign="top">LOL. Nice photo. This would have been perfect if not for 2 things. The left part of his face is a little too dark, and that tree behind his head is a bit distracting. Need something solid that his multi-colored hat would stand out against. Cool subject though.</td>', 'LOL. Nice photo. This would have been perfect if not for 2 things. The left part of his face is a little too dark, and that tree behind his head is a bit distracting. Need something solid that his multi-colored hat would stand out against. Cool subject though.', '2003-06-14 17:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(325262, 24048, 7653, '<td valign="top">Lighting is harsh. Thats the main, maybe only problem here. Composition works really nice and its cool how this lady almost looks like a manequin. Is she?</td>', 'Lighting is harsh. Thats the main, maybe only problem here. Composition works really nice and its cool how this lady almost looks like a manequin. Is she?', '2003-06-14 17:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(325263, 23968, 7653, '<td valign="top">LOL! I cant believe those teeth! I dont know about Horse Illustrated, but maybe Mr. ED MAGAZINE. Too bad you couldnt have entered this in some other contest. This is a great humor shot.</td>', 'LOL! I cant believe those teeth! I dont know about Horse Illustrated, but maybe Mr. ED MAGAZINE. Too bad you couldnt have entered this in some other contest. This is a great humor shot.', '2003-06-14 17:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(325264, 24313, 7653, '<td valign="top">Picture is generally out of focus. Not really much going on in the photo to link it directly with photography.</td>', 'Picture is generally out of focus. Not really much going on in the photo to link it directly with photography.', '2003-06-14 17:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(325265, 24297, 7653, '<td valign="top">Shot is ok. Shadow from tree is kind of distracting on the house. Wait for better light next time. Also, I''d like to see less street/sidewalk in the photo. Keep the composition strictly to the house next time.</td>', 'Shot is ok. Shadow from tree is kind of distracting on the house. Wait for better light next time. Also, I''d like to see less street/sidewalk in the photo. Keep the composition strictly to the house next time.', '2003-06-14 18:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(325269, 24269, 7653, '<td valign="top">GREAT SHOT! This looks made for a magazine cover. No improvements to suggest.</td>', 'GREAT SHOT! This looks made for a magazine cover. No improvements to suggest.', '2003-06-14 18:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(325270, 24092, 7653, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Exquisite detail, I cant believe you captured it with the ant in the mouth!!</td>', 'Great shot! Exquisite detail, I cant believe you captured it with the ant in the mouth!!', '2003-06-14 18:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(325271, 24326, 7653, '<td valign="top">The flower seems much less appealling shot from this under-angle. Overall, the shot is kind of dark. It could have been brightened up a bit with a levels adjustment. The additional stalks behind that of the main flower are distractions, as we cant even see the flowers they lead to.</td>', 'The flower seems much less appealling shot from this under-angle. Overall, the shot is kind of dark. It could have been brightened up a bit with a levels adjustment. The additional stalks behind that of the main flower are distractions, as we cant even see the flowers they lead to.', '2003-06-14 18:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(325272, 24213, 7653, '<td valign="top">My eye doesnt like how the homes sit right in the center of the photo, and we dont get a clear look at any of the dwellings either. I think it''d look better with the homes removed from the composition alltogether, or getting them more prominent in the frame so we can actually see them.</td>', 'My eye doesnt like how the homes sit right in the center of the photo, and we dont get a clear look at any of the dwellings either. I think it''d look better with the homes removed from the composition alltogether, or getting them more prominent in the frame so we can actually see them.', '2003-06-14 18:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(325274, 24289, 7369, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to say but I don''t think NG would ever put this picture on the cover of their magazine. Still the joke is nice :)</td>', 'I''m sorry to say but I don''t think NG would ever put this picture on the cover of their magazine. Still the joke is nice :)', '2003-06-14 18:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(325275, 24181, 7369, '<td valign="top">I don''t think NG would use this picture on their cover; just take a look at their magazine. Therefore I don''t think that you really meet the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t think NG would use this picture on their cover; just take a look at their magazine. Therefore I don''t think that you really meet the challenge.', '2003-06-14 18:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(325276, 24140, 7653, '<td valign="top">The lighting is nice, you reproduced the brown hues pretty well. The wood or whatever this cigar is resting on is kind of hard to make out. I would remove it from the picture next time, too confusing.</td>', 'The lighting is nice, you reproduced the brown hues pretty well. The wood or whatever this cigar is resting on is kind of hard to make out. I would remove it from the picture next time, too confusing.', '2003-06-14 18:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
