(325291, 24507, 7653, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.... I''d like to see the cube fill up less of the frame so that some surrounding negative space is visible. The top looks kind of ''messy'' as contrasted with the simplicity of the rest of the cube, maybe a different angle could have reduced this.</td>', 'Hmmmm.... I''d like to see the cube fill up less of the frame so that some surrounding negative space is visible. The top looks kind of ''messy'' as contrasted with the simplicity of the rest of the cube, maybe a different angle could have reduced this.', '2003-06-14 18:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
