(325335, 24181, 6165, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, if you could find a more creative way of presenting the magazines, the image would be alot stronger. I like the lighting though!</td>', 'Interesting idea, if you could find a more creative way of presenting the magazines, the image would be alot stronger. I like the lighting though!', '2003-06-14 20:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(325336, 24507, 6165, '<td valign="top">I like! Neat lighting, and good exposure.</td>', 'I like! Neat lighting, and good exposure.', '2003-06-14 20:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(325338, 24426, 6165, '<td valign="top">A nice, balanced photo. The rail''s a bit distracting but I think you did a great job making do with what you had.</td>', 'A nice, balanced photo. The rail''s a bit distracting but I think you did a great job making do with what you had.', '2003-06-14 20:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(325343, 24218, 6165, '<td valign="top">A nicely done portrait. Bonus points for the title =P</td>', 'A nicely done portrait. Bonus points for the title =P', '2003-06-14 20:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(325344, 24255, 6165, '<td valign="top">A nice photo, but the exposure is a bit imbalanced in places (bit dark in the back, and a little blown out up front). Food photography''s really hard to be good at and you did a great job with what you had!</td>', 'A nice photo, but the exposure is a bit imbalanced in places (bit dark in the back, and a little blown out up front). Food photography''s really hard to be good at and you did a great job with what you had!', '2003-06-14 20:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(325345, 24446, 6165, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. It''s almost eerie, and the complementary colors next to each other make my eyes tingle =P</td>', 'I really like this photo. It''s almost eerie, and the complementary colors next to each other make my eyes tingle =P', '2003-06-14 20:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(325346, 23968, 6165, '<td valign="top">Cute photo!</td>', 'Cute photo!', '2003-06-14 20:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(325347, 24362, 6165, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! Which golf course was this? I think I know where I want to spend my next vacation =)</td>', 'Nice photo! Which golf course was this? I think I know where I want to spend my next vacation =)', '2003-06-14 20:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(325349, 24338, 6165, '<td valign="top">A strong photograph, and of course, the effects really pop out and scream wow. Nicely done!</td>', 'A strong photograph, and of course, the effects really pop out and scream wow. Nicely done!', '2003-06-14 20:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(325350, 24417, 6165, '<td valign="top">A great sunset photo!</td>', 'A great sunset photo!', '2003-06-14 20:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(325351, 24456, 6165, '<td valign="top">A great photo. It seems a little dark in places, but other than that, it''s well composed and the cloud texture is goregous.</td>', 'A great photo. It seems a little dark in places, but other than that, it''s well composed and the cloud texture is goregous.', '2003-06-14 20:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(325352, 24371, 6165, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, the cold metallic feel is great!</td>', 'Nice picture, the cold metallic feel is great!', '2003-06-14 20:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(325353, 23998, 6165, '<td valign="top">A beautifully exposed and sharp photo. I think I can see my house =)</td>', 'A beautifully exposed and sharp photo. I think I can see my house =)', '2003-06-14 20:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(325354, 24429, 6165, '<td valign="top">A neat photo with the beginnings of a really creative and excellent piece. I feel that the photo could have been alot more vibrant and ''mad-science'' like if you had used a colored light source in the beaker instead (perhaps experimented with the glass and color effects).</td>', 'A neat photo with the beginnings of a really creative and excellent piece. I feel that the photo could have been alot more vibrant and ''mad-science'' like if you had used a colored light source in the beaker instead (perhaps experimented with the glass and color effects).', '2003-06-14 20:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(325355, 24034, 6165, '<td valign="top">Good concert photo piece! I know how hard it is to get things just right in a dark hall, and you''ve done an admirable job!</td>', 'Good concert photo piece! I know how hard it is to get things just right in a dark hall, and you''ve done an admirable job!', '2003-06-14 20:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(325356, 24524, 6165, '<td valign="top">A neat photo, you''ve got the beginnings of a creative idea. I''m not sure how to expand on that though...</td>', 'A neat photo, you''ve got the beginnings of a creative idea. I''m not sure how to expand on that though...', '2003-06-14 20:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(325357, 24533, 6165, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, perhaps a little fill flash to add some brigher catchlights?</td>', 'Nice photo, perhaps a little fill flash to add some brigher catchlights?', '2003-06-14 20:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(325358, 24411, 6165, '<td valign="top">A nice photo. When I hear Country Living, I think wide open spaces, I know forests are out in the country too, but the canopy of trees almost feels constricting.</td>', 'A nice photo. When I hear Country Living, I think wide open spaces, I know forests are out in the country too, but the canopy of trees almost feels constricting.', '2003-06-14 20:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(325360, 24470, 6165, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo, nice long exposure which gives a feeling a movement. One suggestion I have is to perhaps try flipping the photo horizontally. Alot of people here make a big deal about having things flow from left to right. Perhaps give it a try and see which one you like better. Overall, a beautifuly done picture.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo, nice long exposure which gives a feeling a movement. One suggestion I have is to perhaps try flipping the photo horizontally. Alot of people here make a big deal about having things flow from left to right. Perhaps give it a try and see which one you like better. Overall, a beautifuly done picture.', '2003-06-14 20:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(325361, 24075, 6165, '<td valign="top">The start of a good panned shot!</td>', 'The start of a good panned shot!', '2003-06-14 20:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(325362, 24483, 6165, '<td valign="top">Prickly =). Nicely exposed.</td>', 'Prickly =). Nicely exposed.', '2003-06-14 20:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(325363, 24271, 6165, '<td valign="top">Nice macro photography. It''s a shame the bug couldn''t be a little sharper (then again, expensive optics are... well... expensive =). Overall, a great photo!</td>', 'Nice macro photography. It''s a shame the bug couldn''t be a little sharper (then again, expensive optics are... well... expensive =). Overall, a great photo!', '2003-06-14 20:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(325364, 24051, 6165, '<td valign="top">A neat, evenly exposed picture.</td>', 'A neat, evenly exposed picture.', '2003-06-14 20:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(325365, 24377, 6165, '<td valign="top">Cool picture. The building looks somewhat skewed though (which happens sometimes when on the ground looking up).</td>', 'Cool picture. The building looks somewhat skewed though (which happens sometimes when on the ground looking up).', '2003-06-14 20:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(325366, 24235, 6165, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, it looks so nice and warm there!</td>', 'Nice photo, it looks so nice and warm there!', '2003-06-14 20:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(325367, 24197, 6165, '<td valign="top">That''s a neat traffic light =).</td>', 'That''s a neat traffic light =).', '2003-06-14 20:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
