(325372, 24409, 6165, '<td valign="top">The photo lacks a central theme to it (other than being a picture of a tree). Perhaps focusing on a particular aspect of the tree would give it a stronger feel to it.</td>', 'The photo lacks a central theme to it (other than being a picture of a tree). Perhaps focusing on a particular aspect of the tree would give it a stronger feel to it.', '2003-06-14 20:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(325373, 24460, 6165, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice house =). I like the soft shadows in the picture.</td>', 'That''s a nice house =). I like the soft shadows in the picture.', '2003-06-14 20:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(325374, 24244, 6165, '<td valign="top">A neat B&amp;W picture!</td>', 'A neat B&W picture!', '2003-06-14 20:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(325375, 24319, 6165, '<td valign="top">A neat idea with some great sillouettes (okay, so I can''t spell). One suggestion I have is to try composing the photographer (in the photo) closer to the other major elements in the photo so that she (I''m assuming it''s a her) is a more prominent aspect of the photo.<br/> <br/>Overall, it''s a great picture!</td>', 'A neat idea with some great sillouettes (okay, so I can''t spell). One suggestion I have is to try composing the photographer (in the photo) closer to the other major elements in the photo so that she (I''m assuming it''s a her) is a more prominent aspect of the photo. Overall, it''s a great picture!', '2003-06-14 20:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(325377, 24530, 6165, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, nice model. Perhaps a little more fill lighting to add some brighter catchlights.</td>', 'Cute photo, nice model. Perhaps a little more fill lighting to add some brighter catchlights.', '2003-06-14 20:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(325378, 24091, 6165, '<td valign="top">Neat picture!</td>', 'Neat picture!', '2003-06-14 20:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
