(325589, 24327, 1031, '<td valign="top">Most of these types of magazine covers feature over-saturated colors -- I''d try and tweak this one a little. Of course, could also be my monitor or eyes!</td>', 'Most of these types of magazine covers feature over-saturated colors -- I''d try and tweak this one a little. Of course, could also be my monitor or eyes!', '2003-06-15 13:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
