(325659, 24123, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice - I like how stark this is, and the use of white on white. The edges of the plants are almost too sharp, but it makes a nice, lacy effect in this context. (Was that a sharp filter, or just a really good mingling of lighting and subject?)</td>', 'Nice - I like how stark this is, and the use of white on white. The edges of the plants are almost too sharp, but it makes a nice, lacy effect in this context. (Was that a sharp filter, or just a really good mingling of lighting and subject?)', '2003-06-15 15:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(325663, 24405, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo.  The focus is perfect with great DOF.  The rooster is a beautiful color and nicely detailed.  Only drawback is the shadows of the tree limbs on the bird.  10  Side note:  I''m not entirely sure if this is really appropriate for the name of your magazine...LOL...I would think "Farm Bird''s Life" maybe.  My mom was a bird watcher but I don''t think she went around farms identifying roosters.  Still a 10, though cause I''m voting on the quality of the picture.</td>', 'This is an excellent photo.  The focus is perfect with great DOF.  The rooster is a beautiful color and nicely detailed.  Only drawback is the shadows of the tree limbs on the bird.  10  Side note:  I''m not entirely sure if this is really appropriate for the name of your magazine...LOL...I would think "Farm Bird''s Life" maybe.  My mom was a bird watcher but I don''t think she went around farms identifying roosters.  Still a 10, though cause I''m voting on the quality of the picture.', '2003-06-15 15:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(325664, 24464, 3669, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette and the colors.  Also how the sun kind of shines though the crook of the person''s arm.  I think I could see this picture on the cover of your magazine.  Good job!</td>', 'I like the silhouette and the colors.  Also how the sun kind of shines though the crook of the person''s arm.  I think I could see this picture on the cover of your magazine.  Good job!', '2003-06-15 15:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
