(325680, 24076, 693, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  I would have cropped out the botton row of electrical wires/poles to really emphasize the "eco" part of your title.  If you cover up the bottom portion with a piece of blank paper to expose only the windmill, you''ll see how much more emphasis this will give the windmill and the surrounding canvas of blank sky. 8.</td>', 'Not bad.  I would have cropped out the botton row of electrical wires/poles to really emphasize the "eco" part of your title.  If you cover up the bottom portion with a piece of blank paper to expose only the windmill, you''ll see how much more emphasis this will give the windmill and the surrounding canvas of blank sky. 8.', '2003-06-15 16:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
