(325683, 24458, 693, '<td valign="top">Good action shot.  nice contrast of colours also.  A better title (eg. Powerboat or Hydrocraft Racing) would have made this a real magazine cover. 8.</td>', 'Good action shot.  nice contrast of colours also.  A better title (eg. Powerboat or Hydrocraft Racing) would have made this a real magazine cover. 8.', '2003-06-15 16:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
