(325689, 24415, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is really nice... very professional looking.  I like the white background, amazing you got the butterfly to stay for the photo?  Is it a real, live butterfly?  Very nice macro.  The only thing I question would be if there is room to put in the type.  Just a little something that might be important for the magazine cover... I''m sure there could be a way though.  Nice job!  Good luck!</td>', 'This is really nice... very professional looking.  I like the white background, amazing you got the butterfly to stay for the photo?  Is it a real, live butterfly?  Very nice macro.  The only thing I question would be if there is room to put in the type.  Just a little something that might be important for the magazine cover... I''m sure there could be a way though.  Nice job!  Good luck!', '2003-06-15 16:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(325690, 24510, 6172, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best I''ve seen so far, I think you should win a ribbon with this, or come very close.  Maybe you should submit it to them?</td>', 'This is one of the best I''ve seen so far, I think you should win a ribbon with this, or come very close.  Maybe you should submit it to them?', '2003-06-15 16:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(325691, 24396, 4967, '<td valign="top">Thats a crazy looking mushroom!  Mushroom News?  is there really a Mushroom News magazine?  hehehehe... Nice DOF on this photo.  I wonder though whether there would be enough room for type at the top... I think it wouldn''t be too much of a problem though.  I think this photo is well done and would definitely fit for the said magazine.  Don''t care for the border, not sure that most magazines have borders... thats just me though.</td>', 'Thats a crazy looking mushroom!  Mushroom News?  is there really a Mushroom News magazine?  hehehehe... Nice DOF on this photo.  I wonder though whether there would be enough room for type at the top... I think it wouldn''t be too much of a problem though.  I think this photo is well done and would definitely fit for the said magazine.  Don''t care for the border, not sure that most magazines have borders... thats just me though.', '2003-06-15 16:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
