(325698, 24533, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice model, and I love this shot.  I have to comment on the orientation of the photo, however, because if this were cropped to be a magazine cover it would look different.</td>', 'Very nice model, and I love this shot.  I have to comment on the orientation of the photo, however, because if this were cropped to be a magazine cover it would look different.', '2003-06-15 16:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(325700, 24145, 4967, '<td valign="top">Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  This is very pretty how you put it in front of the window kind of lightingup the glass.  This might have been a cool picture for the glass challenge.  I like the photo, as just that a photo, I don''t think it would work as the cover of a magazine for various reasons, including the shape of the photograph, and I couldn''t imagine how it would ever fit a vertical page.  Although I like the photo I have to count down for my belief that it doesn''t really fit the challenge.  Sorry<br/></td>', 'Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.  This is very pretty how you put it in front of the window kind of lightingup the glass.  This might have been a cool picture for the glass challenge.  I like the photo, as just that a photo, I don''t think it would work as the cover of a magazine for various reasons, including the shape of the photograph, and I couldn''t imagine how it would ever fit a vertical page.  Although I like the photo I have to count down for my belief that it doesn''t really fit the challenge.  Sorry', '2003-06-15 16:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(325701, 24049, 6172, '<td valign="top">My one and only problem with this photo is that the birds head is where the title of the magazine would be.  This might not be a problem, but in this case the birds head is small and it would be distracting to have the print there.</td>', 'My one and only problem with this photo is that the birds head is where the title of the magazine would be.  This might not be a problem, but in this case the birds head is small and it would be distracting to have the print there.', '2003-06-15 16:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
