(326575, 24401, 4967, '<td valign="top">Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.   It''s a pity that you didn''t make this a vertical photo... I think you prolly would have scored a lot higher than you are because voters wanted vertical photos.  This is nice... I could definitely see it on the front of said magazine?  How did you do the lemon (?)  Interesting... good texture, good lighting</td>', 'Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.   It''s a pity that you didn''t make this a vertical photo... I think you prolly would have scored a lot higher than you are because voters wanted vertical photos.  This is nice... I could definitely see it on the front of said magazine?  How did you do the lemon (?)  Interesting... good texture, good lighting', '2003-06-16 12:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326576, 24406, 4967, '<td valign="top">Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.   This is a pretty good action shot... I really like it... His face looks a little off color, but that may be how it was.  I would have liked to have seen this as a vertical.  Where were you when you took this?</td>', 'Personally I do not consider magazines to be in a horizontal shape... thats just me though.   This is a pretty good action shot... I really like it... His face looks a little off color, but that may be how it was.  I would have liked to have seen this as a vertical.  Where were you when you took this?', '2003-06-16 12:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(326577, 24511, 4967, '<td valign="top">The color on this and the graininess aren''t very good... I like the two horses and where you put them in the photo, but I think it could have been improved.  Good job leaving space at the top for type.  I would have played with Photoshop or similar program on this.</td>', 'The color on this and the graininess aren''t very good... I like the two horses and where you put them in the photo, but I think it could have been improved.  Good job leaving space at the top for type.  I would have played with Photoshop or similar program on this.', '2003-06-16 12:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(326579, 24524, 4967, '<td valign="top">LOL... this is cute.  Nice shot of the cameras.. good job making this a vertical.  Not sure I would have put the border, most magazines don''t have borders, and I''m not big on them, but thats just me.  I think I could definitelly see this as the cover of the said magazine, but prolly not with that headline &lt;GRIN&gt;  The shadow is kind of bothersome, but not too bad.  Good luck!</td>', 'LOL... this is cute.  Nice shot of the cameras.. good job making this a vertical.  Not sure I would have put the border, most magazines don''t have borders, and I''m not big on them, but thats just me.  I think I could definitelly see this as the cover of the said magazine, but prolly not with that headline <GRIN>  The shadow is kind of bothersome, but not too bad.  Good luck!', '2003-06-16 12:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(326581, 24101, 4967, '<td valign="top">NICE JOB making this a vertical, it would have been so easy to make it a horizontal.  Nice looking car.  I like your lighting and your composition in this photo, it''s very well done.  The trees add a lot to this... as if to say, sporty in the country.  Plenty of room for type.  Very well done.</td>', 'NICE JOB making this a vertical, it would have been so easy to make it a horizontal.  Nice looking car.  I like your lighting and your composition in this photo, it''s very well done.  The trees add a lot to this... as if to say, sporty in the country.  Plenty of room for type.  Very well done.', '2003-06-16 12:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(326595, 24317, 4224, '<td valign="top">the solid green background combined with the out of focus pedals in the back i find a bit displeasing...  mostly personal taste i think.  still a cool picture.</td>', 'the solid green background combined with the out of focus pedals in the back i find a bit displeasing...  mostly personal taste i think.  still a cool picture.', '2003-06-16 13:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326597, 24282, 4224, '<td valign="top">very dramatic :)  might''ve been nice to have a little more lighting on the front of the shot, as it is pretty dark and hard to see the details of the helmet.</td>', 'very dramatic :)  might''ve been nice to have a little more lighting on the front of the shot, as it is pretty dark and hard to see the details of the helmet.', '2003-06-16 13:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(326598, 24420, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo and I absolutely love the composition but think it would be more effective if it were in color. I''m going to give it a high mark anyway.</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo and I absolutely love the composition but think it would be more effective if it were in color. I''m going to give it a high mark anyway.', '2003-06-16 13:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
