(326609, 24388, 4224, '<td valign="top">beautiful blend of colors, very stunning.  love this picture.</td>', 'beautiful blend of colors, very stunning.  love this picture.', '2003-06-16 13:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(326614, 24529, 4224, '<td valign="top">wow that is a really cool picture.  it''s just abstract enough to make me think twice about it.  the petals have so many tones to them, and the detail in the center of the flower is just fantastic.  wonderful job.</td>', 'wow that is a really cool picture.  it''s just abstract enough to make me think twice about it.  the petals have so many tones to them, and the detail in the center of the flower is just fantastic.  wonderful job.', '2003-06-16 13:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(326617, 24371, 4224, '<td valign="top">whoa, awesome.  looove the tone of the shot.  if i was a jaguar owner I would have to have a print of this, it is so striking.</td>', 'whoa, awesome.  looove the tone of the shot.  if i was a jaguar owner I would have to have a print of this, it is so striking.', '2003-06-16 13:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(326618, 24361, 4224, '<td valign="top">There is a lot going on here, but for whatever reason it doesn''t especially capture my eye.  I didn''t even notice the water right away.  Actually, the picture kind of feels two-dimensional to me.</td>', 'There is a lot going on here, but for whatever reason it doesn''t especially capture my eye.  I didn''t even notice the water right away.  Actually, the picture kind of feels two-dimensional to me.', '2003-06-16 13:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(326619, 24411, 5822, '<td valign="top">Colors are very nice and came out very saturated, which I like, but I think the photo is underexposed, on the whole. Also, I think you could have cropped out the dark top 1/4th of the picture.</td>', 'Colors are very nice and came out very saturated, which I like, but I think the photo is underexposed, on the whole. Also, I think you could have cropped out the dark top 1/4th of the picture.', '2003-06-16 13:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(326621, 24456, 4224, '<td valign="top">simply put, this is an incredible shot.</td>', 'simply put, this is an incredible shot.', '2003-06-16 13:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(326628, 23971, 5822, '<td valign="top">I find the item in the foreground too blown out and way too blurry so that it''s very distracting.  I think your photo would have been more effective if you had not used such a narrow DOF.</td>', 'I find the item in the foreground too blown out and way too blurry so that it''s very distracting.  I think your photo would have been more effective if you had not used such a narrow DOF.', '2003-06-16 13:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326637, 24530, 4224, '<td valign="top">nice portrait, good lighting, cute expression.</td>', 'nice portrait, good lighting, cute expression.', '2003-06-16 13:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(326638, 24442, 4224, '<td valign="top">great action shot, love the angle.  seems like he should be covered in blue or purple drops of sweat though ;)  j/k, very well done.</td>', 'great action shot, love the angle.  seems like he should be covered in blue or purple drops of sweat though ;)  j/k, very well done.', '2003-06-16 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(326640, 24510, 4224, '<td valign="top">lovely colors, I like the framing of the shot as well.  A little hard to see it as a magazine cover, but I don''t think that marks it down much.</td>', 'lovely colors, I like the framing of the shot as well.  A little hard to see it as a magazine cover, but I don''t think that marks it down much.', '2003-06-16 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(326641, 24501, 4224, '<td valign="top">I don''t personally find this to be a very enticing picture.  Perhaps a different angle, or sharper blacks and whites?</td>', 'I don''t personally find this to be a very enticing picture.  Perhaps a different angle, or sharper blacks and whites?', '2003-06-16 13:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326642, 24281, 4224, '<td valign="top">lovely shot, love the tones and the sun in the clouds.</td>', 'lovely shot, love the tones and the sun in the clouds.', '2003-06-16 13:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(326644, 24416, 3080, '<td valign="top">Light is getting a little bright on the tops of the leaves.  I like the angle and the background isn''t distracting, but pink doesn''t really look right against the green.  Good for a gardening shot, but this looks like it''s in a pot? yes? should it be in a garden?  either way, your focus and clarity are good.  might have been a little more interesting with a few bits of color within the green, but doesn''t really matter.</td>', 'Light is getting a little bright on the tops of the leaves.  I like the angle and the background isn''t distracting, but pink doesn''t really look right against the green.  Good for a gardening shot, but this looks like it''s in a pot? yes? should it be in a garden?  either way, your focus and clarity are good.  might have been a little more interesting with a few bits of color within the green, but doesn''t really matter.', '2003-06-16 13:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(326647, 24380, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think I''d prefer a lower angle on this so that we are not looking at the tops of the bottles, but rather looking straight on at them (or close) so that we can see what it even is.  Also, maybe better had the labels been turned our way.   Focus seems a bit soft. not really as crisp as I''d like to see for a magazine cover.  Good products though.  The shot is a little unballanced by the large block on the right sticking so far out of the photo, and for the most part, the left is mostly in the frame of the photo.</td>', 'I think I''d prefer a lower angle on this so that we are not looking at the tops of the bottles, but rather looking straight on at them (or close) so that we can see what it even is.  Also, maybe better had the labels been turned our way.   Focus seems a bit soft. not really as crisp as I''d like to see for a magazine cover.  Good products though.  The shot is a little unballanced by the large block on the right sticking so far out of the photo, and for the most part, the left is mostly in the frame of the photo.', '2003-06-16 13:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(326650, 23998, 3724, '<td valign="top">your lover in the arms of another.........</td>', 'your lover in the arms of another.........', '2003-06-16 13:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(326653, 24071, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is picky, but I''d like to see the yellow flower more off center.  I think that if you were to crop off the top right below the top most flower, this would bring the yellow flower up toward the top a bit, and would also remove the green tangle in the upper right corner that I find to be a bit distracting.  Colors are good, as is focus and clarity.</td>', 'This is picky, but I''d like to see the yellow flower more off center.  I think that if you were to crop off the top right below the top most flower, this would bring the yellow flower up toward the top a bit, and would also remove the green tangle in the upper right corner that I find to be a bit distracting.  Colors are good, as is focus and clarity.', '2003-06-16 13:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(326657, 24446, 3080, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, but the chin looks to be a little TOO lit.  It''s bright and bothers my eyes.  Also there looks to be a shadow right above his belly behind that flower looking thing.  Other than the overpowering light near the bottom, I think that this is lit nicely.  I like the effect it has on the background.  Black at the top, and in the two bottom corners, colored slightly.</td>', 'Good lighting, but the chin looks to be a little TOO lit.  It''s bright and bothers my eyes.  Also there looks to be a shadow right above his belly behind that flower looking thing.  Other than the overpowering light near the bottom, I think that this is lit nicely.  I like the effect it has on the background.  Black at the top, and in the two bottom corners, colored slightly.', '2003-06-16 14:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(326662, 24045, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like how this is divided in the background by that pot.  The pattern is a bit distracting from the main subject in the front.  The angle and framing/cropping of the statue is good.  and I could see this on the front cover, with a different background.  maybe just a plain one.  continue the right side all the way to the left edge of the frame, and I think that would appeal to me more.<br/></td>', 'I''m not sure I like how this is divided in the background by that pot.  The pattern is a bit distracting from the main subject in the front.  The angle and framing/cropping of the statue is good.  and I could see this on the front cover, with a different background.  maybe just a plain one.  continue the right side all the way to the left edge of the frame, and I think that would appeal to me more.', '2003-06-16 14:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(326674, 23950, 4224, '<td valign="top">very nice how the white of the background compliments the subject, and the green helps it stand out.  very nice.</td>', 'very nice how the white of the background compliments the subject, and the green helps it stand out.  very nice.', '2003-06-16 14:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326685, 24139, 3080, '<td valign="top">Really good angle.  I like how you got down to the dogs level for this shot.  The background however is cutting the dog in half.  see the strong horizontal line in the background that cuts right through his neck?  Unfortunatly at such a low angle, it''s a bit hard to avoid without completely relocating or shooting from a bit higher, which wouldn''t be as appealing.<br/>Focus and clarity are really good.  i wonder if this would have more visual impact had the dog not been wearing a harness and leash.  I think it would make him seem more dignified and well behaved. anyway, it''s a good shot.</td>', 'Really good angle.  I like how you got down to the dogs level for this shot.  The background however is cutting the dog in half.  see the strong horizontal line in the background that cuts right through his neck?  Unfortunatly at such a low angle, it''s a bit hard to avoid without completely relocating or shooting from a bit higher, which wouldn''t be as appealing.Focus and clarity are really good.  i wonder if this would have more visual impact had the dog not been wearing a harness and leash.  I think it would make him seem more dignified and well behaved. anyway, it''s a good shot.', '2003-06-16 14:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(326689, 24507, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like something that could be on a magazine.  Good dramatic lighting.  Like the colors.  This looks like a Kleenex box though.  See how the Kleenex pops up through the hole in the top? lol Anyway, not sure exactly what it is, but there''s my impression. lol<br/>Focus and clarity look good as well.</td>', 'Looks like something that could be on a magazine.  Good dramatic lighting.  Like the colors.  This looks like a Kleenex box though.  See how the Kleenex pops up through the hole in the top? lol Anyway, not sure exactly what it is, but there''s my impression. lolFocus and clarity look good as well.', '2003-06-16 14:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
