(327486, 24371, 7541, '<td valign="top">My favourite color, pity about some of the more detailed reflections and a bit larger Jaguar to cut unnecessary background.</td>', 'My favourite color, pity about some of the more detailed reflections and a bit larger Jaguar to cut unnecessary background.', '2003-06-17 07:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(327487, 24532, 7541, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detailed image, not the full plate but lovely contrast and designed for the purpose.  Great image.</td>', 'Beautiful detailed image, not the full plate but lovely contrast and designed for the purpose.  Great image.', '2003-06-17 07:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(327488, 24430, 7541, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and up front. Not much wrong with this one, I''ll leave that to the experts and await their comments.</td>', 'Beautiful and up front. Not much wrong with this one, I''ll leave that to the experts and await their comments.', '2003-06-17 07:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(327489, 24297, 7541, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, especially the pole and sign post that aren''t there, and, the fire hydrant. All create an impression that this house is safe, and don''t ask me why, because it does.</td>', 'Excellent image, especially the pole and sign post that aren''t there, and, the fire hydrant. All create an impression that this house is safe, and don''t ask me why, because it does.', '2003-06-17 07:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(327490, 24077, 8274, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, it is a picture that makes you look more then once.</td>', 'I like the composition, it is a picture that makes you look more then once.', '2003-06-17 07:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(327492, 24218, 7541, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image, great detail till we get to the reflections in her hair. Great model, expression and composition. Would have been nice to show full length, but I don''t think the photographer wanted that.  Great imgae though.</td>', 'Fantastic image, great detail till we get to the reflections in her hair. Great model, expression and composition. Would have been nice to show full length, but I don''t think the photographer wanted that.  Great imgae though.', '2003-06-17 07:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(327493, 24079, 7541, '<td valign="top">Great tones and plenty of class with this image. Not too much, just enough in fact to say what this is about.  Well done.</td>', 'Great tones and plenty of class with this image. Not too much, just enough in fact to say what this is about.  Well done.', '2003-06-17 07:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(327494, 24464, 8274, '<td valign="top">I am not sure whether I like this or not, however the blue fade in background is stunning and I appreciate the merit of the picture.</td>', 'I am not sure whether I like this or not, however the blue fade in background is stunning and I appreciate the merit of the picture.', '2003-06-17 07:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(327495, 24190, 7541, '<td valign="top">Excellent, frustrating initially but it makes a closer look worthwhile. Not very much to fault here, from my viewpoint.</td>', 'Excellent, frustrating initially but it makes a closer look worthwhile. Not very much to fault here, from my viewpoint.', '2003-06-17 07:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(327496, 24429, 7541, '<td valign="top">Like a bottomless pitt, great magazine cover. Right to the point and nothing to fault.  Great image.</td>', 'Like a bottomless pitt, great magazine cover. Right to the point and nothing to fault.  Great image.', '2003-06-17 07:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(327497, 24112, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and interesting combo of materials and metal objects. Don''t like sepia choice - seems too "Little House on the Prairie" for the sunject matter chosen.</td>', 'Nice textures and interesting combo of materials and metal objects. Don''t like sepia choice - seems too "Little House on the Prairie" for the sunject matter chosen.', '2003-06-17 07:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(327498, 24505, 7541, '<td valign="top">Great shot (pardon the pun), pity about the antique car.</td>', 'Great shot (pardon the pun), pity about the antique car.', '2003-06-17 07:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(327499, 24048, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and pose, personally not keen on lighting choices.</td>', 'Nice composition and pose, personally not keen on lighting choices.', '2003-06-17 07:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(327500, 24117, 7541, '<td valign="top">Excellent, these flowers jump out at you. Shame there aren''t any birds around.  Great image once again.</td>', 'Excellent, these flowers jump out at you. Shame there aren''t any birds around.  Great image once again.', '2003-06-17 08:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(327502, 24076, 3087, '<td valign="top">Would have liked this better without electricity lines in frame. Nice low contrast, calming image.</td>', 'Would have liked this better without electricity lines in frame. Nice low contrast, calming image.', '2003-06-17 08:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(327503, 24465, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky colours and good foreground detail.</td>', 'Lovely sky colours and good foreground detail.', '2003-06-17 08:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(327504, 24501, 7541, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and composition.</td>', 'Excellent detail and composition.', '2003-06-17 08:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(327505, 24334, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Personally, I would like this even better if we had eye contact with the surfer or if his face was turned more to the camera. That said, it''s a good angle as it is and his expression is full of concentration - I can imagine it being popular with other serious surfers.</td>', 'Good capture. Personally, I would like this even better if we had eye contact with the surfer or if his face was turned more to the camera. That said, it''s a good angle as it is and his expression is full of concentration - I can imagine it being popular with other serious surfers.', '2003-06-17 08:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(327506, 24071, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours but not so keen on the central composition - feels a little unbalanced to me.</td>', 'Lovely colours but not so keen on the central composition - feels a little unbalanced to me.', '2003-06-17 08:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(327508, 24406, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture of motion and effort. Only improvements for me would be more fill-in light on his face and for his eyes to be more visible. <br/>Not keen on border treatment.</td>', 'Fantastic capture of motion and effort. Only improvements for me would be more fill-in light on his face and for his eyes to be more visible. Not keen on border treatment.', '2003-06-17 08:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(327510, 24092, 8274, '<td valign="top">Excellent closeup.</td>', 'Excellent closeup.', '2003-06-17 08:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(327511, 24490, 7541, '<td valign="top">Great image, excellent composition, unfortunately some of the highlights in the top third of the image lack detail that would have made this image.</td>', 'Great image, excellent composition, unfortunately some of the highlights in the top third of the image lack detail that would have made this image.', '2003-06-17 08:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(327512, 24442, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of motion and concentration. Nice clean background - no extraneous objects in view. Only preference would be for a little more sky to be included at top of frame - feels a little too closely cropped to me.</td>', 'Excellent capture of motion and concentration. Nice clean background - no extraneous objects in view. Only preference would be for a little more sky to be included at top of frame - feels a little too closely cropped to me.', '2003-06-17 08:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(327514, 24465, 7541, '<td valign="top">Great shot, sunrises and sunsets make terrific photographs and this is one unusual concept. For a magazine its A1.</td>', 'Great shot, sunrises and sunsets make terrific photographs and this is one unusual concept. For a magazine its A1.', '2003-06-17 08:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(327515, 24458, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the water spray - tilted horizon doesn''t work for me in this particular instance.</td>', 'Love the water spray - tilted horizon doesn''t work for me in this particular instance.', '2003-06-17 08:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(327516, 24319, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - one of the main problems I find with sunset shots is that there is seldom a really striking focal point - clever idea to make yours tie in to the title so well. I''d prefer that I couldn''t see the tripod leg - kind of loses the silhouette effect a little - but that''s a minor point. <br/>I prefer this in portrait - cropping a lot from the left and just a little from the right.</td>', 'Nice idea - one of the main problems I find with sunset shots is that there is seldom a really striking focal point - clever idea to make yours tie in to the title so well. I''d prefer that I couldn''t see the tripod leg - kind of loses the silhouette effect a little - but that''s a minor point. I prefer this in portrait - cropping a lot from the left and just a little from the right.', '2003-06-17 08:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(327517, 24354, 7541, '<td valign="top">Excellent, I would like to see the film case a bit closer, too much white space between subjects.  I like the concept and the lack of clutter very much.</td>', 'Excellent, I would like to see the film case a bit closer, too much white space between subjects.  I like the concept and the lack of clutter very much.', '2003-06-17 08:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(327518, 24115, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well taken, interesting angle. Content doesn''t excite me in any way but I''m willing to assume that it does the business for gun lovers.</td>', 'Well taken, interesting angle. Content doesn''t excite me in any way but I''m willing to assume that it does the business for gun lovers.', '2003-06-17 08:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(327521, 24513, 7541, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful with plenty of color, a bit more detail in the flowers would have been great.  Was this shot hand held?</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful with plenty of color, a bit more detail in the flowers would have been great.  Was this shot hand held?', '2003-06-17 08:23:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(327524, 24293, 7541, '<td valign="top">Excellent theme on lighting of old buildings. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent theme on lighting of old buildings. Well done.', '2003-06-17 08:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(327525, 24210, 7541, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.</td>', 'Beautiful image.', '2003-06-17 08:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(327527, 24303, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great portrait! Lighting seems very odd - seems to be a shaft of sunlight falling only on his nose - perhaps taking a shot a few seconds earlier or later might have caught him with light on more of his face. I''d also, personally, prefer the background to be thrown out of focus more, though the demonstration (?) behind may be relevant to the story? Would be an 8 or 9 with better lighting and less distracting background.</td>', 'Great portrait! Lighting seems very odd - seems to be a shaft of sunlight falling only on his nose - perhaps taking a shot a few seconds earlier or later might have caught him with light on more of his face. I''d also, personally, prefer the background to be thrown out of focus more, though the demonstration (?) behind may be relevant to the story? Would be an 8 or 9 with better lighting and less distracting background.', '2003-06-17 08:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(327528, 24362, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely light - taken at just the right time of day.</td>', 'Lovely light - taken at just the right time of day.', '2003-06-17 08:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(327530, 24446, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice colour - doesn''t seem very sharp though. 7.</td>', 'Nice colour - doesn''t seem very sharp though. 7.', '2003-06-17 08:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(327531, 24460, 7541, '<td valign="top">Great image, great composition, detail and color tones. Not much to complain about here.</td>', 'Great image, great composition, detail and color tones. Not much to complain about here.', '2003-06-17 08:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(327532, 24510, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the foreground but not the back. I''d prefer this as a landscape picture cropped from the top to just below where the plate touches the left edge - to make a striking diagonal of black at the top left. That said, I do appreciate that your chosen orientation works better with the magazine in question.<br/>Perhaps more attention on colours/ and surfaces for background objects would make that area as appealing as the front?</td>', 'I love the foreground but not the back. I''d prefer this as a landscape picture cropped from the top to just below where the plate touches the left edge - to make a striking diagonal of black at the top left. That said, I do appreciate that your chosen orientation works better with the magazine in question.Perhaps more attention on colours/ and surfaces for background objects would make that area as appealing as the front?', '2003-06-17 08:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(327537, 23990, 7541, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph, nothing to complain about, except for the strain on the subjects shoulder showing those couple of veins. Very picky I know, but this is a very good photograph.  The light is great and so is the image.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph, nothing to complain about, except for the strain on the subjects shoulder showing those couple of veins. Very picky I know, but this is a very good photograph.  The light is great and so is the image.', '2003-06-17 08:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(327539, 24269, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture - nice light, great expressions, good composition, love that their outfits are all different yet they are tied together by their caps, the "danskin" line helps composition as does the backdrop.</td>', 'Excellent capture - nice light, great expressions, good composition, love that their outfits are all different yet they are tied together by their caps, the "danskin" line helps composition as does the backdrop.', '2003-06-17 08:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(327540, 24215, 3087, '<td valign="top">Can''t imagine what a magazine of this title might be about but the image is cute and rather enigmatic.</td>', 'Can''t imagine what a magazine of this title might be about but the image is cute and rather enigmatic.', '2003-06-17 08:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(327541, 24402, 7541, '<td valign="top">Another great image, you can''t beat lots of greens, maybe a bit heavy on the right, but a very nice shot.</td>', 'Another great image, you can''t beat lots of greens, maybe a bit heavy on the right, but a very nice shot.', '2003-06-17 08:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(327542, 24402, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love that area where dusty light shows through and the way the sun twinkles through the leaves above it.<br/>I think this could be improved by being cropped - taking a little off the left.</td>', 'Love that area where dusty light shows through and the way the sun twinkles through the leaves above it.I think this could be improved by being cropped - taking a little off the left.', '2003-06-17 08:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(327543, 24339, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great colours and pattern. I would like to see a shallower DOF to throw out the background, which adds nothing to the shot for me.</td>', 'Great colours and pattern. I would like to see a shallower DOF to throw out the background, which adds nothing to the shot for me.', '2003-06-17 08:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(327546, 24510, 7541, '<td valign="top">More emphasis on the Kiwi dish and get rid of the mains. Excellent color and detail, just no need for the shaslik''s.</td>', 'More emphasis on the Kiwi dish and get rid of the mains. Excellent color and detail, just no need for the shaslik''s.', '2003-06-17 08:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(327548, 24513, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken, nice curves at the edge of the lawn and framing from the leaves. Not an overly exciting Wow! shot but probably suitable for this kind of magazine.</td>', 'Nicely taken, nice curves at the edge of the lawn and framing from the leaves. Not an overly exciting Wow! shot but probably suitable for this kind of magazine.', '2003-06-17 08:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(327551, 24427, 7541, '<td valign="top">Terrific concept, great colors, but where is the wine?</td>', 'Terrific concept, great colors, but where is the wine?', '2003-06-17 08:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(327553, 24461, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this. I can''t decide whether I''d like it even more if it were even more simple - just grass, sky and clouds and nothing more. I know I''d rather it didn''t have the pole and wires but can''t decide about the dark trees. More interesting a photo than first glance might suggest.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this. I can''t decide whether I''d like it even more if it were even more simple - just grass, sky and clouds and nothing more. I know I''d rather it didn''t have the pole and wires but can''t decide about the dark trees. More interesting a photo than first glance might suggest.', '2003-06-17 08:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(327557, 23969, 3087, '<td valign="top">Bikes are great - background behind them not so great.<br/>Firstly I\\\''d say that waiting till the shot was free of people would help - especially people with their back to camera and leaving the scene.<br/>Would shallower DOF disguise that? Focus on foreground and more blurred in background?<br/>I think you could also do with losing (cropping) some of the top of the shot out.</td>', 'Bikes are great - background behind them not so great.Firstly I\\\''d say that waiting till the shot was free of people would help - especially people with their back to camera and leaving the scene.Would shallower DOF disguise that? Focus on foreground and more blurred in background?I think you could also do with losing (cropping) some of the top of the shot out.', '2003-06-17 08:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(327563, 24316, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. Background showing some areas of shadow/ colour - perhaps needs additional lighting on backdrop?<br/>8</td>', 'Excellent composition. Background showing some areas of shadow/ colour - perhaps needs additional lighting on backdrop?8', '2003-06-17 08:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(327565, 24354, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great idea, excellent use of DOF to actually add to the meaning and good use of white space. 8</td>', 'Great idea, excellent use of DOF to actually add to the meaning and good use of white space. 8', '2003-06-17 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(327567, 24034, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and good composition. 8</td>', 'Great lighting and good composition. 8', '2003-06-17 08:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(327568, 23934, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not a particularly original treatment but nicely done. Lighting on the eyes is a little uneven - one is darker than the other. Minor issue. <br/>8</td>', 'Not a particularly original treatment but nicely done. Lighting on the eyes is a little uneven - one is darker than the other. Minor issue. 8', '2003-06-17 08:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(327569, 24519, 3087, '<td valign="top">8 - I love when people are brave enough to crop in close.</td>', '8 - I love when people are brave enough to crop in close.', '2003-06-17 09:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(327571, 24366, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful study. 8</td>', 'A beautiful study. 8', '2003-06-17 09:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(327572, 24079, 8522, '<td valign="top">Stunning textures, incredible lighting, very sharp. Don''t like the composition though, too much white space for my taste towards the right. Nice angle though. 9</td>', 'Stunning textures, incredible lighting, very sharp. Don''t like the composition though, too much white space for my taste towards the right. Nice angle though. 9', '2003-06-17 09:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(327576, 24317, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of colour here. Great composition. Interesting mixture of textures. Nicely saturated. DOF not quite to my taste though... perhaps if the (excuse the ignorance!) bit of flower poking out to the top-right was more in focus this would be better for me. 9</td>', 'Wonderful use of colour here. Great composition. Interesting mixture of textures. Nicely saturated. DOF not quite to my taste though... perhaps if the (excuse the ignorance!) bit of flower poking out to the top-right was more in focus this would be better for me. 9', '2003-06-17 09:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(327578, 24371, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the colourisation, the DoF, the reflections - a striking image. 9</td>', 'I love the colourisation, the DoF, the reflections - a striking image. 9', '2003-06-17 09:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(327579, 24492, 3087, '<td valign="top">Better lit than many other flower entries. Nice composition.</td>', 'Better lit than many other flower entries. Nice composition.', '2003-06-17 09:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(327581, 24319, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo... love the female silhouette. Her hair works especially well. Not sure about the placement of the sun just off-centre here. Dead-on centre or to one side would have worked better for me. The ducks are a little distracting as well. Love the foreground leaves. 9</td>', 'Wonderful photo... love the female silhouette. Her hair works especially well. Not sure about the placement of the sun just off-centre here. Dead-on centre or to one side would have worked better for me. The ducks are a little distracting as well. Love the foreground leaves. 9', '2003-06-17 09:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(327583, 24447, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this but it totally feels upside down to me. Scoring it an 8 but would be 9 if it were other way up - yes I appreciate that an editor would see past that and simply rotate it but I think it was a poor choice to present it upside down in this challenge. <br/></td>', 'I really like this but it totally feels upside down to me. Scoring it an 8 but would be 9 if it were other way up - yes I appreciate that an editor would see past that and simply rotate it but I think it was a poor choice to present it upside down in this challenge. ', '2003-06-17 09:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(327585, 24195, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great angle.</td>', 'Great angle.', '2003-06-17 09:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(327588, 24188, 3087, '<td valign="top">A little soft for my tastes. Also don''t like the harsh spot light on the wall. Do like the dark shadow areas. 8</td>', 'A little soft for my tastes. Also don''t like the harsh spot light on the wall. Do like the dark shadow areas. 8', '2003-06-17 09:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(327589, 23934, 8522, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, great textures and composition. Good concept. Really nice skin tones. Only thing that spoils it are the eyes... the reflection of the wood in her left eye cuts across her pupil, lessening the impact of the photo. 9</td>', 'Brilliant, great textures and composition. Good concept. Really nice skin tones. Only thing that spoils it are the eyes... the reflection of the wood in her left eye cuts across her pupil, lessening the impact of the photo. 9', '2003-06-17 09:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(327592, 24290, 8522, '<td valign="top">What on earth is that thing? Intesting use of light, a bit of glare in places though. Composition a bit cluttered for my taste. 7</td>', 'What on earth is that thing? Intesting use of light, a bit of glare in places though. Composition a bit cluttered for my taste. 7', '2003-06-17 09:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(327594, 24423, 8522, '<td valign="top">Aw, that''s much better than any picture of a dandelion I''ve ever taken! Nice contrast between the white and the green background.  Nice dof. Not sure i''d see it on the front of any magazine about gardening though. 7</td>', 'Aw, that''s much better than any picture of a dandelion I''ve ever taken! Nice contrast between the white and the green background.  Nice dof. Not sure i''d see it on the front of any magazine about gardening though. 7', '2003-06-17 09:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(327595, 24055, 8522, '<td valign="top">Mediocre lighting, don''t like the shadow. Not very saturated. Don''t like the cropping, would like to see more of the left hand side of the photo. I don''t think the table was a good choice of base...  the wood grain doesn''t do anything to help your main subject. However, there''s a certain character to this I like. 6</td>', 'Mediocre lighting, don''t like the shadow. Not very saturated. Don''t like the cropping, would like to see more of the left hand side of the photo. I don''t think the table was a good choice of base...  the wood grain doesn''t do anything to help your main subject. However, there''s a certain character to this I like. 6', '2003-06-17 09:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(327596, 24423, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. 8</td>', 'Beautiful capture. 8', '2003-06-17 09:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(327597, 24407, 3087, '<td valign="top">Funky! 8</td>', 'Funky! 8', '2003-06-17 09:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(327622, 24110, 2764, '<td valign="top">straighten it</td>', 'straighten it', '2003-06-17 10:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(327628, 24140, 9411, '<td valign="top">Fits the requirements for a good cover shot to be used with multiple type additions.<br/>Nice detail...</td>', 'Fits the requirements for a good cover shot to be used with multiple type additions.Nice detail...', '2003-06-17 10:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(327635, 24343, 4224, '<td valign="top">Seems it would benefit from a sharper focus, maybe a slightly wider cropping?</td>', 'Seems it would benefit from a sharper focus, maybe a slightly wider cropping?', '2003-06-17 10:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(327637, 24244, 4224, '<td valign="top">interesting use of the puddle for reflection.  Kind of a shame the sky is such a bland gray, but it is still a very nice (night?) shot.  I would suggest cropping off the left edge just slightly, so that there is more balance between those two, I believe they are trash cans.  Just a thought.</td>', 'interesting use of the puddle for reflection.  Kind of a shame the sky is such a bland gray, but it is still a very nice (night?) shot.  I would suggest cropping off the left edge just slightly, so that there is more balance between those two, I believe they are trash cans.  Just a thought.', '2003-06-17 10:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(327638, 24354, 4224, '<td valign="top">nice use of shadows, and nice clean composition.  good work.</td>', 'nice use of shadows, and nice clean composition.  good work.', '2003-06-17 10:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(327639, 24208, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful subject with wonderful colours and reflective qualities. Focus seems a little soft. Composition is reasonably interesting. 8</td>', 'A beautiful subject with wonderful colours and reflective qualities. Focus seems a little soft. Composition is reasonably interesting. 8', '2003-06-17 10:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(327640, 24390, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great colours and reasonably interesting content. However what makes it more appealing for me is the shape of the water itself - I can really see the swell and movement of the water. 8</td>', 'Great colours and reasonably interesting content. However what makes it more appealing for me is the shape of the water itself - I can really see the swell and movement of the water. 8', '2003-06-17 10:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(327641, 24464, 4224, '<td valign="top">I love the background of this shot, although I kinda wish the climber was more than just a silhoutte.  It makes me lose the scope of the image.  Well, it''s like the foreground is telling me one thing and the background is telling me another, and I like the background more :)</td>', 'I love the background of this shot, although I kinda wish the climber was more than just a silhoutte.  It makes me lose the scope of the image.  Well, it''s like the foreground is telling me one thing and the background is telling me another, and I like the background more :)', '2003-06-17 10:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(327643, 24518, 4224, '<td valign="top">I think this would benefit from being a bit sharper.  Nice Silhouette, and I like the hue of the sky.</td>', 'I think this would benefit from being a bit sharper.  Nice Silhouette, and I like the hue of the sky.', '2003-06-17 10:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(327645, 24175, 3087, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely capture and great DOF. Composition just superb, especially for a magazine cover, with title text. Image itself seems very grainy and I think the lighting on the bird could do with being a little more even. 9</td>', 'Such a lovely capture and great DOF. Composition just superb, especially for a magazine cover, with title text. Image itself seems very grainy and I think the lighting on the bird could do with being a little more even. 9', '2003-06-17 11:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(327646, 24529, 3087, '<td valign="top">High colour and high impact, strong composition. 8</td>', 'High colour and high impact, strong composition. 8', '2003-06-17 11:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(327647, 24422, 4224, '<td valign="top">First things first, a modeling photo needs to have a much more striking background than this.  Even if it was just a big blur, that would be better.  Secondly, the way he is leaning over broodingly, he looks more like a musician than a Cosmo model.  Cosmo models have big smiles, perfect lighting, and flawless makeup.  Clothes too.  Musicians can get away with casual, models can not.  Just a few thoughts.</td>', 'First things first, a modeling photo needs to have a much more striking background than this.  Even if it was just a big blur, that would be better.  Secondly, the way he is leaning over broodingly, he looks more like a musician than a Cosmo model.  Cosmo models have big smiles, perfect lighting, and flawless makeup.  Clothes too.  Musicians can get away with casual, models can not.  Just a few thoughts.', '2003-06-17 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(327648, 24208, 4224, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what I''m looking at, but it''s interesting.</td>', 'I have no idea what I''m looking at, but it''s interesting.', '2003-06-17 11:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(327649, 24210, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image - well lit and I like the catchlight (is that the word I''m looking for?) in the eye. Doesn''t quite feel like a balanced composition. Metal object in bottom right foreground distracts from clean "background". 8</td>', 'Wonderful image - well lit and I like the catchlight (is that the word I''m looking for?) in the eye. Doesn''t quite feel like a balanced composition. Metal object in bottom right foreground distracts from clean "background". 8', '2003-06-17 11:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(327650, 24461, 4224, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot a lot.  It''s kinda a shame the power lines are in it though.  For some reason I''m also curious to see it in more abstract color tones.  Just a thought.  Love the grass.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot a lot.  It''s kinda a shame the power lines are in it though.  For some reason I''m also curious to see it in more abstract color tones.  Just a thought.  Love the grass.', '2003-06-17 11:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(327651, 23993, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely, simple, but unusual perspective - really makes use of that wonderful spiral at the centre. Shame the leaves are so tattered/ chewed. 8</td>', 'Lovely, simple, but unusual perspective - really makes use of that wonderful spiral at the centre. Shame the leaves are so tattered/ chewed. 8', '2003-06-17 11:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(327652, 24045, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of colour (was it taken this way or colourised afterwards?). Nice composition, interesting background. 8</td>', 'Excellent use of colour (was it taken this way or colourised afterwards?). Nice composition, interesting background. 8', '2003-06-17 11:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(327653, 24379, 3087, '<td valign="top">High impact, great angle/ composition. Not sure on DOF choice. Crop feels just a fraction too tight at left and right sides, not much though. 8</td>', 'High impact, great angle/ composition. Not sure on DOF choice. Crop feels just a fraction too tight at left and right sides, not much though. 8', '2003-06-17 11:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(327654, 24428, 4224, '<td valign="top">Why so small?  Lovely picture.</td>', 'Why so small?  Lovely picture.', '2003-06-17 11:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(327656, 24528, 4224, '<td valign="top">Playboy typically doesn''t feature handsome men on the cover :P  Still it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'Playboy typically doesn''t feature handsome men on the cover :P  Still it''s a nice photo.', '2003-06-17 11:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(327657, 23990, 3087, '<td valign="top">Superbly lit. Excellent composition and good choice of background. Not my cup of tea but scores an 8. I can visualise this on a cover. If you have local women''s magazines or weekly ones, recommend submitting this as a "reader on the cover" feature.</td>', 'Superbly lit. Excellent composition and good choice of background. Not my cup of tea but scores an 8. I can visualise this on a cover. If you have local women''s magazines or weekly ones, recommend submitting this as a "reader on the cover" feature.', '2003-06-17 11:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(327658, 24200, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very much the right style for the magazine. I think this is an excellent image in many ways. Great eye contact and wonderful emotional connection with the subjects. <br/>Feels cropped a little too tight at the bottom - I''d like to see all of her arm/ hand in the shot. <br/>The strong highlight on her nose is also a little distracting.<br/>8</td>', 'Very much the right style for the magazine. I think this is an excellent image in many ways. Great eye contact and wonderful emotional connection with the subjects. Feels cropped a little too tight at the bottom - I''d like to see all of her arm/ hand in the shot. The strong highlight on her nose is also a little distracting.8', '2003-06-17 11:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(327660, 24218, 4224, '<td valign="top">My only question is, why is the background so ominously dark?  It strikes me as odd, especially since the lighting on the model is flawless.  I kinda wish she was wearing something slightly less revealing, but that''s just me.  Oh, and why the border?  It goes well with the color of her bikini, but this isn''t National Geographic.</td>', 'My only question is, why is the background so ominously dark?  It strikes me as odd, especially since the lighting on the model is flawless.  I kinda wish she was wearing something slightly less revealing, but that''s just me.  Oh, and why the border?  It goes well with the color of her bikini, but this isn''t National Geographic.', '2003-06-17 11:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(327661, 24173, 3087, '<td valign="top">Striking and simple. Clever and modern treatment of such an old and simple instrument. I still remember learning to play mine as a small child. 8</td>', 'Striking and simple. Clever and modern treatment of such an old and simple instrument. I still remember learning to play mine as a small child. 8', '2003-06-17 11:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(327662, 24217, 4224, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like the angle you took, although  I would be curious to see it from slightly to the left and further down looking up at the boarder.  I also kinda wish there wasn''t any blur, but that''s just me.  Still, very cool.  Spectators work well.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like the angle you took, although  I would be curious to see it from slightly to the left and further down looking up at the boarder.  I also kinda wish there wasn''t any blur, but that''s just me.  Still, very cool.  Spectators work well.', '2003-06-17 11:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(327663, 24312, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great capture - I especially like that both her feet are off the ground and also the positioning of the three closest runners off to the left of the frame. Could do with a little fill-in light on her face which is a little shaded by her cap. 8</td>', 'Great capture - I especially like that both her feet are off the ground and also the positioning of the three closest runners off to the left of the frame. Could do with a little fill-in light on her face which is a little shaded by her cap. 8', '2003-06-17 11:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(327665, 24462, 4224, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2003-06-17 11:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(327666, 24396, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting - looks like golden afternoon light. Nice DOF also. (I''m a sucker for shallow DOF when well used). 8</td>', 'Nice lighting - looks like golden afternoon light. Nice DOF also. (I''m a sucker for shallow DOF when well used). 8', '2003-06-17 11:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(327667, 24056, 3087, '<td valign="top">So vibrant and incredibly striking. Great composition and black background works very well with the black shadows of the head bit (not a horticulturalist, does it show? :) That head looks like it''s on fire. 9</td>', 'So vibrant and incredibly striking. Great composition and black background works very well with the black shadows of the head bit (not a horticulturalist, does it show? :) That head looks like it''s on fire. 9', '2003-06-17 11:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(327668, 23998, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Would like more black space above. 8</td>', 'Good capture. Would like more black space above. 8', '2003-06-17 11:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(327669, 24032, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great set up and I like that it has a story associated with it ! I can see this used as an image within a box on a cover but not as the entire cover - the text in the image would clash for attention with the title and cover text. 8</td>', 'Great set up and I like that it has a story associated with it ! I can see this used as an image within a box on a cover but not as the entire cover - the text in the image would clash for attention with the title and cover text. 8', '2003-06-17 11:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(327670, 24401, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strangely attractive for a dried up slice of fruit ;) <br/>I like decision to use white space and off centre composition but it''s not quite there for me - I think perhaps a little more white space to the left and either more or no cropping of the slice of fruit.<br/>8</td>', 'Strangely attractive for a dried up slice of fruit ;) I like decision to use white space and off centre composition but it''s not quite there for me - I think perhaps a little more white space to the left and either more or no cropping of the slice of fruit.8', '2003-06-17 11:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(327671, 24207, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an unusual and clever silhouette. Really very creative. Although the way that the border blends into the perch is clever, I prefer this without a border. 9</td>', 'What an unusual and clever silhouette. Really very creative. Although the way that the border blends into the perch is clever, I prefer this without a border. 9', '2003-06-17 11:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(327674, 24079, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting, good lighting, excellent composition. 8</td>', 'Interesting, good lighting, excellent composition. 8', '2003-06-17 11:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(327676, 24415, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very striking. Lighting on butterfly seems good but seems a bit too much on the flower? 8</td>', 'Very striking. Lighting on butterfly seems good but seems a bit too much on the flower? 8', '2003-06-17 11:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(327679, 24509, 3087, '<td valign="top">Unusual image yet very ordinary subject. Has quite a strong ''ambience'' to it for a shot of half a pear! 8</td>', 'Unusual image yet very ordinary subject. Has quite a strong ''ambience'' to it for a shot of half a pear! 8', '2003-06-17 11:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(327680, 24403, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! Striking! Composition works well and I can picture it as a magazine cover very well. Would love more detail in their faces. 9</td>', 'Wow! Striking! Composition works well and I can picture it as a magazine cover very well. Would love more detail in their faces. 9', '2003-06-17 11:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(327682, 24317, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! What an unusual combination of colours - a well chosen background really highlights the white and red-pinks! Good composition too! 8</td>', 'Wow! What an unusual combination of colours - a well chosen background really highlights the white and red-pinks! Good composition too! 8', '2003-06-17 11:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(327683, 24338, 3087, '<td valign="top">Composition of background is what sets this apart from all the many similar shots we''ve seen recently. I think that this would work well as a cover. 8</td>', 'Composition of background is what sets this apart from all the many similar shots we''ve seen recently. I think that this would work well as a cover. 8', '2003-06-17 11:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(327684, 24480, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting - modern and yet the art is primitive in style. Nice bright highlight through the eye. 8</td>', 'Interesting - modern and yet the art is primitive in style. Nice bright highlight through the eye. 8', '2003-06-17 11:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(327685, 24515, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good use of white space and love the use of all similar colour objects. Lighting a little harsh on one sandal and shadowed on other. Could do with just a touch more space below toe at left of image - more sand. Even with magazine title and other text this would still retain that negative space feel. 8</td>', 'Nice composition, good use of white space and love the use of all similar colour objects. Lighting a little harsh on one sandal and shadowed on other. Could do with just a touch more space below toe at left of image - more sand. Even with magazine title and other text this would still retain that negative space feel. 8', '2003-06-17 11:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(327686, 24271, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and DOF. 9</td>', 'Beautiful composition and DOF. 9', '2003-06-17 11:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(327688, 24315, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great capture and I like the horizontal lines of the blue court surface and the lights and boards at the top. 8</td>', 'Great capture and I like the horizontal lines of the blue court surface and the lights and boards at the top. 8', '2003-06-17 11:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(327690, 24166, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really hate spiders but this is such a superb image that I''m still giving it a 10. I often like shallow DOF but here it just blows me away - a perfect choice. It creates what looks like a painting behind the web and really evokes the idea of a home in the sunny mediterranean or caribbean.</td>', 'I really hate spiders but this is such a superb image that I''m still giving it a 10. I often like shallow DOF but here it just blows me away - a perfect choice. It creates what looks like a painting behind the web and really evokes the idea of a home in the sunny mediterranean or caribbean.', '2003-06-17 11:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(327692, 23968, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a gem - that expression is just superb! Makes me grin each time I look at it! I''d like to see a shallower DOF to throw that background out even further. 9</td>', 'What a gem - that expression is just superb! Makes me grin each time I look at it! I''d like to see a shallower DOF to throw that background out even further. 9', '2003-06-17 11:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(327693, 24092, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! Superb capture - such excellent detail. Background (perch and backdrop) both just the right colours - like a painting. 10</td>', 'Wow! Superb capture - such excellent detail. Background (perch and backdrop) both just the right colours - like a painting. 10', '2003-06-17 11:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(327694, 24488, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro - I really love the tendrils of smoke and the DOF. Only negative for me is composition - too close to centre to be centred but not far enough off centred (for my tastes) to be balanced as an off-centre. 9 (would be 10 with better composition)</td>', 'Wonderful macro - I really love the tendrils of smoke and the DOF. Only negative for me is composition - too close to centre to be centred but not far enough off centred (for my tastes) to be balanced as an off-centre. 9 (would be 10 with better composition)', '2003-06-17 11:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(327696, 24140, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tendril of smoke, lovely rich colours, good lighting and nice focus. I like that even with magazine text this image would still allow for a feeling of negative space. 10</td>', 'Beautiful tendril of smoke, lovely rich colours, good lighting and nice focus. I like that even with magazine text this image would still allow for a feeling of negative space. 10', '2003-06-17 11:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(327697, 24286, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! I think this is excellent - very Jacky Kennedy/ Audrey Hepburn. I like the lighting, the slightly dark feel (dancing outdoors at night?), the way her hair merges into the sky and the candid nature of the expressions. Great also to have captured motion in her arms and in the applause of spectators. Wish she had that reflected light in both eyes though you could add that in before putting this on sale on DPC Prints if you were intending to do that? 10</td>', 'Wow! I think this is excellent - very Jacky Kennedy/ Audrey Hepburn. I like the lighting, the slightly dark feel (dancing outdoors at night?), the way her hair merges into the sky and the candid nature of the expressions. Great also to have captured motion in her arms and in the applause of spectators. Wish she had that reflected light in both eyes though you could add that in before putting this on sale on DPC Prints if you were intending to do that? 10', '2003-06-17 12:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(327698, 24218, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well taken and very well lit. <br/>I must admit to being put off a little by the amount of pubic area showing. I''m sooo not puritanical so it''s not that - it just looks really odd in this particular image. I think I''d prefer  pubic area covered or completely nude. <br/>However, the part hidden part on display style works much better on the bosom area. <br/>Great background and that beautiful dark sky and greenery really looks good against her skin. Is it real or a photo backdrop? Just curious. <br/>This really isn''t my cup of tea but I do think it''s very well taken, so giving it a 9.</td>', 'Well taken and very well lit. I must admit to being put off a little by the amount of pubic area showing. I''m sooo not puritanical so it''s not that - it just looks really odd in this particular image. I think I''d prefer  pubic area covered or completely nude. However, the part hidden part on display style works much better on the bosom area. Great background and that beautiful dark sky and greenery really looks good against her skin. Is it real or a photo backdrop? Just curious. This really isn''t my cup of tea but I do think it''s very well taken, so giving it a 9.', '2003-06-17 12:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(327702, 24343, 1041, '<td valign="top">The composition and subject are great for a "National Wildlife" magazine, enough interest, yet still room for text to be added, and in a format that typically reflects magazines.  However, as both a magazine cover and a photo, you are really being let down by the lack of focus and sharpness.  This needs to be really crisp for this kind of photo to work ... did you maybe get closer than your camera could properly focus (I know I do that way too often).  I do like the crop. (2)</td>', 'The composition and subject are great for a "National Wildlife" magazine, enough interest, yet still room for text to be added, and in a format that typically reflects magazines.  However, as both a magazine cover and a photo, you are really being let down by the lack of focus and sharpness.  This needs to be really crisp for this kind of photo to work ... did you maybe get closer than your camera could properly focus (I know I do that way too often).  I do like the crop. (2)', '2003-06-17 12:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(327704, 24048, 1041, '<td valign="top">The composition looks a little off (don''t like her head to the side like that to fit in the frame), but it does allow room for text which is good.  Is this shot through a window?   There seems to be a reflection in the lower left quadrant.  The lighting is also a little harsh and uneven (blown out highlights on the neck and leg). (2)</td>', 'The composition looks a little off (don''t like her head to the side like that to fit in the frame), but it does allow room for text which is good.  Is this shot through a window?   There seems to be a reflection in the lower left quadrant.  The lighting is also a little harsh and uneven (blown out highlights on the neck and leg). (2)', '2003-06-17 12:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(327705, 24432, 1041, '<td valign="top">Don''t they look peaceful when they sleep?  While the subject certainly fits the magazine, I can''t really see this on a magazine cover, sorry.  The angle would make people try and turn the magazine on its head to see the pic the "right" way up (even though I''m pretty sure this is the way you took the photo), and it''s overall a little dark and soft.  It does allow for text to be added though which is also important. (3)</td>', 'Don''t they look peaceful when they sleep?  While the subject certainly fits the magazine, I can''t really see this on a magazine cover, sorry.  The angle would make people try and turn the magazine on its head to see the pic the "right" way up (even though I''m pretty sure this is the way you took the photo), and it''s overall a little dark and soft.  It does allow for text to be added though which is also important. (3)', '2003-06-17 12:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(327706, 24392, 1041, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t find anything on this magazine with a quick surf on the internet, so I don''t know how appropriate this is for a cover photo.  Based on other magazines I''ve seen, I would expect this to be an acceptable photo only if the people are celebrities. (3)<br/> <br/>I like the format you''ve chosen and the space you left for text, but she''s more in focus than he is and they are both making goofy faces which is not typical for what you see ... good photo for those that know them, not as interesting to others ...</td>', 'Couldn''t find anything on this magazine with a quick surf on the internet, so I don''t know how appropriate this is for a cover photo.  Based on other magazines I''ve seen, I would expect this to be an acceptable photo only if the people are celebrities. (3) I like the format you''ve chosen and the space you left for text, but she''s more in focus than he is and they are both making goofy faces which is not typical for what you see ... good photo for those that know them, not as interesting to others ...', '2003-06-17 12:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(327707, 24094, 1041, '<td valign="top">I just checked out NJMonthly on the web and it seems they use quite a variety of cover photo formats so I''ll accept this one ... even though it doesn''t strike me as very typical, or easily cropped into a vertical format.  But there''s room at the top to put text, that''s a bonus. (4)<br/> <br/>Anyhow, as a photo, I like how you''ve filled the space with the boat.  The little parachute is a nice addition.  I can see this kind of pic being used to lure people to NJ.  Overall, your image appears quite soft though, and that''s something I wouldn''t expect to see on a magazine cover.  Not sure if that''s focus or might be easily fixed with a little USM.</td>', 'I just checked out NJMonthly on the web and it seems they use quite a variety of cover photo formats so I''ll accept this one ... even though it doesn''t strike me as very typical, or easily cropped into a vertical format.  But there''s room at the top to put text, that''s a bonus. (4) Anyhow, as a photo, I like how you''ve filled the space with the boat.  The little parachute is a nice addition.  I can see this kind of pic being used to lure people to NJ.  Overall, your image appears quite soft though, and that''s something I wouldn''t expect to see on a magazine cover.  Not sure if that''s focus or might be easily fixed with a little USM.', '2003-06-17 12:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(327708, 24504, 1041, '<td valign="top">This one makes me smile every time I see it.  Definitely could see it on the magazine cover, but probably with the background edited out.  Just wish your submission was a little larger (I''m sure you''ve already heard that one once or twice) so I can see if it is in focus and enjoy the details of your baby''s face.  As it is, I get the feel it''s just a little out of focus.  Still, a precious expression, plus great catchlights in the eyes. (5)</td>', 'This one makes me smile every time I see it.  Definitely could see it on the magazine cover, but probably with the background edited out.  Just wish your submission was a little larger (I''m sure you''ve already heard that one once or twice) so I can see if it is in focus and enjoy the details of your baby''s face.  As it is, I get the feel it''s just a little out of focus.  Still, a precious expression, plus great catchlights in the eyes. (5)', '2003-06-17 12:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(327709, 24071, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wonderful flowers, but the rose looks totally out of place.  I suspect that\''s just what you wanted to achieve, but it still looks very strange to me.  But, your focus and lighting is very good.  I generally like the \"odd one out\" idea, maybe if you had placed the rose not in the center of the image ... dunno. (5)</td>', 'Wonderful flowers, but the rose looks totally out of place.  I suspect that\''s just what you wanted to achieve, but it still looks very strange to me.  But, your focus and lighting is very good.  I generally like the \"odd one out\" idea, maybe if you had placed the rose not in the center of the image ... dunno. (5)', '2003-06-17 12:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(327710, 24281, 1041, '<td valign="top">I just checked out Action Asia on the web and the format and topic you have chosen seems to fit the magazine well, so you definitely met the challenge.  They do generally seem to have some more obvious (larger) main focus in their pictures, though. (6)<br/> <br/>Anyhow, as a photo, I like this a lot, the birds add a very nice touch and the layers of the land behind the lake are nice, too.  Clouds are always a plus for sunset shots, especially if they at least partially hide the sun and therefore avoiding the blown out effect a bit.  Nice entry :)</td>', 'I just checked out Action Asia on the web and the format and topic you have chosen seems to fit the magazine well, so you definitely met the challenge.  They do generally seem to have some more obvious (larger) main focus in their pictures, though. (6) Anyhow, as a photo, I like this a lot, the birds add a very nice touch and the layers of the land behind the lake are nice, too.  Clouds are always a plus for sunset shots, especially if they at least partially hide the sun and therefore avoiding the blown out effect a bit.  Nice entry :)', '2003-06-17 12:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(327711, 24510, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color, great choice of DOF.  Not sure about the funky angle but I think it might just work.  The starfish and piece of wood seem very out of place for me, and a tablecloth that covers the whole table would''ve just perfected the scene.  Still a pretty good shot. (6)</td>', 'Wonderful color, great choice of DOF.  Not sure about the funky angle but I think it might just work.  The starfish and piece of wood seem very out of place for me, and a tablecloth that covers the whole table would''ve just perfected the scene.  Still a pretty good shot. (6)', '2003-06-17 12:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(327712, 24415, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.  Love the focus and the colors and the fact you captured this in a single photo and for the challenge.  Now, this is going to sound strange coming from me, knowing my love for the perfect white background (which you''ve defintely achieved here, but it looks unnatural.  I would fully expect some blurred green vegetation in the background.  Plus, the angle of the flower and the butterfly on it looks a little strange, too.  Regardless, focus and lighting is exquisite. (7)</td>', 'Very beautiful.  Love the focus and the colors and the fact you captured this in a single photo and for the challenge.  Now, this is going to sound strange coming from me, knowing my love for the perfect white background (which you''ve defintely achieved here, but it looks unnatural.  I would fully expect some blurred green vegetation in the background.  Plus, the angle of the flower and the butterfly on it looks a little strange, too.  Regardless, focus and lighting is exquisite. (7)', '2003-06-17 12:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(327713, 24396, 1041, '<td valign="top">LOL ... I can''t believe there''s actually a magazine just about mushrooms but I found it on the net.  Your photo fits it well and is also a good photo in itself.  Nice DOF and composition, just some blown out areas on the stems ... maybe take a gauze scarf or something with you onto your photo endeavors and then hold that between the subject and the sun to soften the light.  Still high marks from me. (7)</td>', 'LOL ... I can''t believe there''s actually a magazine just about mushrooms but I found it on the net.  Your photo fits it well and is also a good photo in itself.  Nice DOF and composition, just some blown out areas on the stems ... maybe take a gauze scarf or something with you onto your photo endeavors and then hold that between the subject and the sun to soften the light.  Still high marks from me. (7)', '2003-06-17 12:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(327714, 24316, 1041, '<td valign="top">Love the room you left for text without just having too much empty space.  Could see this on the magazine cover, but maby with a whiter background. (8)</td>', 'Love the room you left for text without just having too much empty space.  Could see this on the magazine cover, but maby with a whiter background. (8)', '2003-06-17 12:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(327715, 24092, 1041, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture.  Could see that on a bird watcher magazine.  Love how the insect and the head of the bird are in focus, just a litlte more DOF to have the body in sharper focus would be even better.  Nice unobtrusive background and room for text.  High marks. (8)</td>', 'Awesome capture.  Could see that on a bird watcher magazine.  Love how the insect and the head of the bird are in focus, just a litlte more DOF to have the body in sharper focus would be even better.  Nice unobtrusive background and room for text.  High marks. (8)', '2003-06-17 12:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(327716, 24430, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen her in so many pix, but her eyes are still wonderful and stunning.  Love the pose and the slight breeze through the hair, can absolutely see this on the cover of a magazine.  Just some minor overexposure on the hands plus the lipstick clashes with her top!  Those are nitpicks, this is great work, Arni. (9)</td>', 'I''ve seen her in so many pix, but her eyes are still wonderful and stunning.  Love the pose and the slight breeze through the hair, can absolutely see this on the cover of a magazine.  Just some minor overexposure on the hands plus the lipstick clashes with her top!  Those are nitpicks, this is great work, Arni. (9)', '2003-06-17 12:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(327717, 24200, 1041, '<td valign="top">Totally hit the spot ... I can absolutely see this on the cover of a magazine.  As a photo, evokes a lot of emotion, which is good, plus is well executed.  I wouldn''t be surprised if you got a ribbon for this one ... (10)</td>', 'Totally hit the spot ... I can absolutely see this on the cover of a magazine.  As a photo, evokes a lot of emotion, which is good, plus is well executed.  I wouldn''t be surprised if you got a ribbon for this one ... (10)', '2003-06-17 12:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(327718, 23934, 1041, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  So wonderfully composed with lots of space that can be used for text, but is just as interesting w/out.  Those beautiful huge brown eyes peeking through ... if I had taken this it would be hanging on my wall.  You might very well get a ribbon for this :)  (10)</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  So wonderfully composed with lots of space that can be used for text, but is just as interesting w/out.  Those beautiful huge brown eyes peeking through ... if I had taken this it would be hanging on my wall.  You might very well get a ribbon for this :)  (10)', '2003-06-17 12:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(327719, 23990, 1041, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Great composition for a magazine with room for text.  I would see this with the grass cloned out but of course you cannot do that for this challenge.  The lighting is beautiful, just slightly textures, her eyes and the lipstick gleam and match the top ... it all looks very professional.  Ribbon material if you ask me :)  (10)</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Great composition for a magazine with room for text.  I would see this with the grass cloned out but of course you cannot do that for this challenge.  The lighting is beautiful, just slightly textures, her eyes and the lipstick gleam and match the top ... it all looks very professional.  Ribbon material if you ask me :)  (10)', '2003-06-17 12:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
