(327872, 23998, 7653, '<td valign="top">Great Image. The only thing I might suggest is rotating this so that the cresent is more vertical than diagonal. Only because I think Im used to seeing it that way.... also might lend itself towards easier copy placement on the mag cover. Stunning detail in this shot though. Congrats.</td>', 'Great Image. The only thing I might suggest is rotating this so that the cresent is more vertical than diagonal. Only because I think Im used to seeing it that way.... also might lend itself towards easier copy placement on the mag cover. Stunning detail in this shot though. Congrats.', '2003-06-17 14:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(327876, 24480, 7653, '<td valign="top">I like this. Seems as if extraneous color (inbetween the faces and in the eye of the black) could have been minimized the photo might have worked better, just the red and black masks.</td>', 'I like this. Seems as if extraneous color (inbetween the faces and in the eye of the black) could have been minimized the photo might have worked better, just the red and black masks.', '2003-06-17 14:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(327879, 24420, 7653, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range, flowers and the hat are cute... I dont like something about the composition... needs a different crop or arangement. Cant quite put my finger on it. Nice photo anyway...</td>', 'Nice tonal range, flowers and the hat are cute... I dont like something about the composition... needs a different crop or arangement. Cant quite put my finger on it. Nice photo anyway...', '2003-06-17 14:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(327891, 23983, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s colorful, but the focus point seems to be beyond the graphic.  No idea of what mag you''re going for.  The shadow bars from the rail distract from the picture.  4 Rob the Swash</td>', 'It''s colorful, but the focus point seems to be beyond the graphic.  No idea of what mag you''re going for.  The shadow bars from the rail distract from the picture.  4 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(327895, 24313, 1005, '<td valign="top">I think I get the idea, these two are learning about developing, right?  No enough information to tell the story completely.  It might have been nice to see both faces.  Somewhat grainy - loses some of the definition.  Color seems pretty good.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'I think I get the idea, these two are learning about developing, right?  No enough information to tell the story completely.  It might have been nice to see both faces.  Somewhat grainy - loses some of the definition.  Color seems pretty good.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 14:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(327896, 24200, 5364, '<td valign="top">Of all the Natioanl Geographic covers here, yours is the one that feels most appropriate. It''s a pity it''s slightly out of focus. Nice job otherwise.</td>', 'Of all the Natioanl Geographic covers here, yours is the one that feels most appropriate. It''s a pity it''s slightly out of focus. Nice job otherwise.', '2003-06-17 14:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(327897, 24422, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good color, esp. for being in the shadows.  It''s a bit grainy.  It''s not a glamour shot (IMO) (see title).  Background is plain, adds nothing to the pic.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Good color, esp. for being in the shadows.  It''s a bit grainy.  It''s not a glamour shot (IMO) (see title).  Background is plain, adds nothing to the pic.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 14:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(327898, 24338, 9131, '<td valign="top">very interesting idea!  awesome!</td>', 'very interesting idea!  awesome!', '2003-06-17 15:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(327899, 24514, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good color.  I''m guessing...low end camera?  There are details in this shot (see her t-shirt), but many details are lacking (see teeth).  The black face is a difficult subject (hard to bring out details).  The glare on her shoulder is a touch harsh, too.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Good color.  I''m guessing...low end camera?  There are details in this shot (see her t-shirt), but many details are lacking (see teeth).  The black face is a difficult subject (hard to bring out details).  The glare on her shoulder is a touch harsh, too.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(327903, 24320, 1005, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, but a fun view.  The motion of the drummer''s hand shows the action, where the rest is fairly solid.  The guitar head coming across the subject is a bit unfortunate.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'A bit dark, but a fun view.  The motion of the drummer''s hand shows the action, where the rest is fairly solid.  The guitar head coming across the subject is a bit unfortunate.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(327904, 24442, 7653, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I used to run long distance myself. Might have been a nice touch if you could have had the runner looking at the camera.</td>', 'Nice shot. I used to run long distance myself. Might have been a nice touch if you could have had the runner looking at the camera.', '2003-06-17 15:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(327908, 24334, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good action shot!  Color is very good.  Since the wave he''s riding doesn''t seem really impressive, it''s probably a good thing to not include it, but maybe a little more in front, but then again, it''s already a landscape shot, so you''re probably getting heck of that issue (sorry).  I still think it''s at least a 9.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Good action shot!  Color is very good.  Since the wave he''s riding doesn''t seem really impressive, it''s probably a good thing to not include it, but maybe a little more in front, but then again, it''s already a landscape shot, so you''re probably getting heck of that issue (sorry).  I still think it''s at least a 9.  Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(327909, 24229, 9131, '<td valign="top">a little too centered for my liking...a good pic, though.</td>', 'a little too centered for my liking...a good pic, though.', '2003-06-17 15:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(327911, 24513, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty garden.  Love the little waterfall.  The flowers seem "too bright", maybe a bit oversaturated, which might account for their lack of definition, whereas the rest of the pic seems nicely sharp.  Strong visual impact.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Pretty garden.  Love the little waterfall.  The flowers seem "too bright", maybe a bit oversaturated, which might account for their lack of definition, whereas the rest of the pic seems nicely sharp.  Strong visual impact.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(327913, 24188, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot for B&amp;W.  Very good subject for title (well defined).  I''m a little torn on the crop in the face (a little more - a little less maybe?  I dunno)  The glare spot on the wall is a tad too strong (IMO).  Still very representative  - 9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice shot for B&W.  Very good subject for title (well defined).  I''m a little torn on the crop in the face (a little more - a little less maybe?  I dunno)  The glare spot on the wall is a tad too strong (IMO).  Still very representative  - 9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(327917, 24175, 1005, '<td valign="top">Works pretty good for me.  I like the wing blur, stopping that blur is very hard with a digicam.  The glare on the back is a might harsh, but overall, I like this very much.  Too bad she wasn''t up to a real flower, but that''s just picking nit.  I''ve tried to get into Birds and Blooms, it''s very hard...this picture would be close, I think.<br/>9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Works pretty good for me.  I like the wing blur, stopping that blur is very hard with a digicam.  The glare on the back is a might harsh, but overall, I like this very much.  Too bad she wasn''t up to a real flower, but that''s just picking nit.  I''ve tried to get into Birds and Blooms, it''s very hard...this picture would be close, I think.9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(327919, 24218, 9131, '<td valign="top">could the bikini be any smaller? yikes!  good photo, though.  nice light.</td>', 'could the bikini be any smaller? yikes!  good photo, though.  nice light.', '2003-06-17 15:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(327921, 24271, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot of the hoverfly.  A little wider DOF might have been good as the tail and far wing are out of the range quite a bit.  The main body seems pretty good, but even the front of the face seems a bit off.  Overall, a very high impact photo and I like it!  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Neat shot of the hoverfly.  A little wider DOF might have been good as the tail and far wing are out of the range quite a bit.  The main body seems pretty good, but even the front of the face seems a bit off.  Overall, a very high impact photo and I like it!  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(327924, 24437, 4224, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be better if there was more light on the models face, and it wasn''t taken from quite so far above her.  Maybe a shorter depth of focus as well?  Just a thought.  Her hair looks good, and the pose is nice.</td>', 'I think this shot would be better if there was more light on the models face, and it wasn''t taken from quite so far above her.  Maybe a shorter depth of focus as well?  Just a thought.  Her hair looks good, and the pose is nice.', '2003-06-17 15:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(327925, 24174, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, love the tongue!  I''ll bet you''re getting heck over the sqareness of your image!  (I feel for you!!!)  Very strong image with very good details.  Color seems very good.  (Are you getting comments about the border being distracting or off color - if so...don''t sweat it - it''s not the photo, which is magnificent!  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute shot, love the tongue!  I''ll bet you''re getting heck over the sqareness of your image!  (I feel for you!!!)  Very strong image with very good details.  Color seems very good.  (Are you getting comments about the border being distracting or off color - if so...don''t sweat it - it''s not the photo, which is magnificent!  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(327927, 24464, 4536, '<td valign="top">Nice, I love backpacking and I love photography, two of my favorite things together. Great blue tones. Wish that piece of hair wasn''t next to her eye. Flipping the shot would have made it a stronger magazine contender for room for text in the traditional sense, still a beautiful shot. Where''s the backpack? :)</td>', 'Nice, I love backpacking and I love photography, two of my favorite things together. Great blue tones. Wish that piece of hair wasn''t next to her eye. Flipping the shot would have made it a stronger magazine contender for room for text in the traditional sense, still a beautiful shot. Where''s the backpack? :)', '2003-06-17 15:20:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(327929, 24200, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Seems like a NG cover to me!  Color seems a little low (increase the saturation a touch or two), but not bad.  Focus seems pretty good.  Compositionally - I think I''ve seen NG covers that looked pretty near to this, good work!!!  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice image.  Seems like a NG cover to me!  Color seems a little low (increase the saturation a touch or two), but not bad.  Focus seems pretty good.  Compositionally - I think I''ve seen NG covers that looked pretty near to this, good work!!!  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(327932, 24071, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty, contrasting flowers.  Very nice color.  Lighting - just a touch dark overall, but much lighter would have made the yellow a bit too harsh.  Nice image.<br/>9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Pretty, contrasting flowers.  Very nice color.  Lighting - just a touch dark overall, but much lighter would have made the yellow a bit too harsh.  Nice image.9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(327933, 24297, 1005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful house!  Very sharp photo.  Kinda mixed feelings about the tree shadow, but I''m not going to ask you to cut down the tree to see if it''s better!!!  I like it!  I''ve never heard of your mag, but I''m willing to go with it.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Beautiful house!  Very sharp photo.  Kinda mixed feelings about the tree shadow, but I''m not going to ask you to cut down the tree to see if it''s better!!!  I like it!  I''ve never heard of your mag, but I''m willing to go with it.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(327937, 24137, 1005, '<td valign="top">???? Why wouldn''t this be valid????  Very nice shot!  Border color is a might bit off (too tan), but that''s picking nit, really!!!  I could wish the fence wouldn''t be there, but that''s asking for too much!  Overall a cool shot!  I like it!  9 Rob the Swash</td>', '???? Why wouldn''t this be valid????  Very nice shot!  Border color is a might bit off (too tan), but that''s picking nit, really!!!  I could wish the fence wouldn''t be there, but that''s asking for too much!  Overall a cool shot!  I like it!  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(327939, 24533, 1005, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Vogue cover to me!  Pretty model.  Well taken photo, with a tiny, personal nit - I''d like to see a little more light on her face, esp. the right side.  Very pretty model!!!  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Looks like a Vogue cover to me!  Pretty model.  Well taken photo, with a tiny, personal nit - I''d like to see a little more light on her face, esp. the right side.  Very pretty model!!!  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(327940, 24512, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Vivid colors!!!!  Sharp on the bee.  A little too much light on the wings,  but that''s picking nit.  Very good details.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice shot!  Vivid colors!!!!  Sharp on the bee.  A little too much light on the wings,  but that''s picking nit.  Very good details.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(327942, 24454, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower and a nice bee shot.  Love the pollen in it''s "hair".  DOF is a little narrow, but this close...it''s going to be.  Still, I''d like the wings a bit more visible.  This is an interesting angle, but hard on the far wing.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Pretty flower and a nice bee shot.  Love the pollen in it''s "hair".  DOF is a little narrow, but this close...it''s going to be.  Still, I''d like the wings a bit more visible.  This is an interesting angle, but hard on the far wing.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(327944, 24426, 4224, '<td valign="top">damn, that railing sucks.</td>', 'damn, that railing sucks.', '2003-06-17 15:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(327945, 23998, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty sharp moon shot!  How much magnification did this take?  I really like the dark side...works well for me.  Not portrait - not a problem for me.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Pretty sharp moon shot!  How much magnification did this take?  I really like the dark side...works well for me.  Not portrait - not a problem for me.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(327946, 24532, 1005, '<td valign="top">Yummmm!  Never heard of your mag, but I''m a believer!  Very sharp, good color and lighting (no nasty glare spots, even on the silver!!)  I really like the sprigs of mint, nice touch.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Yummmm!  Never heard of your mag, but I''m a believer!  Very sharp, good color and lighting (no nasty glare spots, even on the silver!!)  I really like the sprigs of mint, nice touch.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(327947, 24390, 4224, '<td valign="top">very stunning, beautiful picture.</td>', 'very stunning, beautiful picture.', '2003-06-17 15:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(327949, 23968, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute shot!  Very clear and good color.  Is there really this mag?  I could see this for a number of publications, so don''t worry about it.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute shot!  Very clear and good color.  Is there really this mag?  I could see this for a number of publications, so don''t worry about it.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(327951, 24056, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice coneflower shot!  Good focus and color.  Framing works well.  While I''m O.K. with your mag title and all, IMO, were I doing a garden design mag, I''d be looking at a larger scene, this works for many other garden/flower mags, just seems a bit awkward with that title.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice coneflower shot!  Good focus and color.  Framing works well.  While I''m O.K. with your mag title and all, IMO, were I doing a garden design mag, I''d be looking at a larger scene, this works for many other garden/flower mags, just seems a bit awkward with that title.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-17 15:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(327955, 24110, 4224, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m supposed to look at in this picture.  My eyes just wander around and get lost.  Maybe if I knew what the magazine was, but i''m not familiar with the Big Issue.</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m supposed to look at in this picture.  My eyes just wander around and get lost.  Maybe if I knew what the magazine was, but i''m not familiar with the Big Issue.', '2003-06-17 15:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(327957, 24056, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice coneflower, the the center seems a lot redder than is natural - maybe its just late in the cycle.</td>', 'Nice coneflower, the the center seems a lot redder than is natural - maybe its just late in the cycle.', '2003-06-17 15:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(327958, 23934, 656, '<td valign="top">I could see this on the cover, but only if his eyes were in sharper focus than the foreground</td>', 'I could see this on the cover, but only if his eyes were in sharper focus than the foreground', '2003-06-17 15:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(327959, 24411, 656, '<td valign="top">seems very dark</td>', 'seems very dark', '2003-06-17 15:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(327960, 24437, 205, '<td valign="top">her face is kind of in the shadow.</td>', 'her face is kind of in the shadow.', '2003-06-17 15:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(327962, 24312, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great shot, to bad the horizontal line in the photo is there.  Otherwise I could see this on a cover.</td>', 'Great shot, to bad the horizontal line in the photo is there.  Otherwise I could see this on a cover.', '2003-06-17 15:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(327963, 24524, 205, '<td valign="top">why have the lense cap on?</td>', 'why have the lense cap on?', '2003-06-17 15:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(327964, 24217, 205, '<td valign="top">Thrasher is better.</td>', 'Thrasher is better.', '2003-06-17 15:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(327965, 24174, 205, '<td valign="top">thats almost an impossible crop</td>', 'thats almost an impossible crop', '2003-06-17 16:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(327966, 24424, 205, '<td valign="top">how would you go about putting this on a magazine? the two photographical elements are split in half you can have the strawberrry on the front and have the girl on the innerspread, which would you do?<br/></td>', 'how would you go about putting this on a magazine? the two photographical elements are split in half you can have the strawberrry on the front and have the girl on the innerspread, which would you do?', '2003-06-17 16:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(327972, 24080, 205, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen photos of this place on photosig, I think you should of tried to get more of the bridge in the shot or leave it out.</td>', 'I''ve seen photos of this place on photosig, I think you should of tried to get more of the bridge in the shot or leave it out.', '2003-06-17 16:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(327974, 24403, 205, '<td valign="top">thats cool its a pleasure to see something different</td>', 'thats cool its a pleasure to see something different', '2003-06-17 16:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(327975, 24313, 205, '<td valign="top">reminds me of photography class</td>', 'reminds me of photography class', '2003-06-17 16:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(327987, 24371, 205, '<td valign="top">my dad owns</td>', 'my dad owns', '2003-06-17 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(327992, 24532, 7711, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter a lot, but I find the plate a bit distracting. The addition of the mint was a very nice touch. I think a warmer sort of lighting might have avoided the sort of flat look some of the chocolate in the foreground has. :)</td>', 'I like the subject matter a lot, but I find the plate a bit distracting. The addition of the mint was a very nice touch. I think a warmer sort of lighting might have avoided the sort of flat look some of the chocolate in the foreground has. :)', '2003-06-17 16:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(327999, 24319, 9043, '<td valign="top">i would like to see the shot taken from a lower view point. it looks as if the shot has been cut off at the bottom. sorry to be critical, its just my opinion.</td>', 'i would like to see the shot taken from a lower view point. it looks as if the shot has been cut off at the bottom. sorry to be critical, its just my opinion.', '2003-06-17 17:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(328007, 24338, 6900, '<td valign="top">You should do this kind of shot for your own personal enjoyment.  Entering it at dpc is guaranteed to hurt your score just by being "A Setzler"</td>', 'You should do this kind of shot for your own personal enjoyment.  Entering it at dpc is guaranteed to hurt your score just by being "A Setzler"', '2003-06-17 17:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(328008, 24518, 6900, '<td valign="top">Somewhere between clear and focused lies this s hot.  Try to brace the camera on something.</td>', 'Somewhere between clear and focused lies this s hot.  Try to brace the camera on something.', '2003-06-17 17:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(328010, 24430, 6900, '<td valign="top">Her hands are blown out this time, Arnit.  I wouldn''t have cut off the top of her head or her shoulder - it''s too tight of a crop.</td>', 'Her hands are blown out this time, Arnit.  I wouldn''t have cut off the top of her head or her shoulder - it''s too tight of a crop.', '2003-06-17 17:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(328013, 24320, 6900, '<td valign="top">She looks like she''s in pain and the balding dude is distracting.  Try focusing the attention on the subject.</td>', 'She looks like she''s in pain and the balding dude is distracting.  Try focusing the attention on the subject.', '2003-06-17 17:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(328014, 24317, 6900, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem to be taken outdoors.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem to be taken outdoors.', '2003-06-17 17:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(328016, 24514, 6900, '<td valign="top">This shot is very blurry and the lighting doesn''t flatter either subject.</td>', 'This shot is very blurry and the lighting doesn''t flatter either subject.', '2003-06-17 17:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(328018, 24438, 6900, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this was done - but it''s either the best or worst picture of this challenge - I can''t decide.</td>', 'Not sure how this was done - but it''s either the best or worst picture of this challenge - I can''t decide.', '2003-06-17 17:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(328020, 24528, 6900, '<td valign="top">Unlike any cover of PB I''ve seen before.</td>', 'Unlike any cover of PB I''ve seen before.', '2003-06-17 17:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(328021, 23983, 6900, '<td valign="top">???  What IS this?</td>', '???  What IS this?', '2003-06-17 17:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(328023, 24479, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot - feels a bit busy with the bg tho.</td>', 'Interesting shot - feels a bit busy with the bg tho.', '2003-06-17 17:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(328024, 24431, 6900, '<td valign="top">Not a magazine as far as I can tell.</td>', 'Not a magazine as far as I can tell.', '2003-06-17 17:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(328026, 24422, 6900, '<td valign="top">:) hehe yeah.</td>', ':) hehe yeah.', '2003-06-17 17:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(328027, 24437, 6900, '<td valign="top">Nice color on the water.  Hot chick, strange lighting/direction.</td>', 'Nice color on the water.  Hot chick, strange lighting/direction.', '2003-06-17 17:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(328028, 24497, 6900, '<td valign="top">Not fond of the overall yellowy feel here.</td>', 'Not fond of the overall yellowy feel here.', '2003-06-17 17:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(328029, 24289, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.</td>', 'Interesting idea.', '2003-06-17 17:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(328030, 24515, 6900, '<td valign="top">I like this shot because the background is well lit, the almost-high-key works well too.  I like the inclusion of the shells to give the shot something ''extra''  nice job!</td>', 'I like this shot because the background is well lit, the almost-high-key works well too.  I like the inclusion of the shells to give the shot something ''extra''  nice job!', '2003-06-17 17:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(328031, 24055, 7711, '<td valign="top">lovely carving but the shadow is distracting. Also, I would love to see more of the detail on the duck, did you try a different angle to show more if its side? :)</td>', 'lovely carving but the shadow is distracting. Also, I would love to see more of the detail on the duck, did you try a different angle to show more if its side? :)', '2003-06-17 17:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(328041, 24442, 9454, '<td valign="top">Góður</td>', 'Góður', '2003-06-17 17:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
