(328250, 24074, 2152, '<td valign="top">You''ve got some nice scenery here, but you might want to try to get the sun at your back to accentuate the colors and get rid of that glare with shots like this.  A polarizing filter would help, as well.</td>', 'You''ve got some nice scenery here, but you might want to try to get the sun at your back to accentuate the colors and get rid of that glare with shots like this.  A polarizing filter would help, as well.', '2003-06-17 23:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(328251, 24286, 1344, '<td valign="top">The strong highlight in her right eye makes it look like a glass eye (no offense if said eye is actually glass :)  It''s a nice photo that definitely captures the action of the moment.  I like how the ring stands out!  Would have liked less blackspace up top and more of the bride.  7</td>', 'The strong highlight in her right eye makes it look like a glass eye (no offense if said eye is actually glass :)  It''s a nice photo that definitely captures the action of the moment.  I like how the ring stands out!  Would have liked less blackspace up top and more of the bride.  7', '2003-06-17 23:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
