(328264, 24110, 6938, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a slight ant-clockwise rotation is needed here.  The banners in the forground seem to have seperated the viewer from the action and the photo in general. For a mag cover I think you need to capture the police in a more "active" moment. Good focus and use of the light availible.</td>', 'Perhaps a slight ant-clockwise rotation is needed here.  The banners in the forground seem to have seperated the viewer from the action and the photo in general. For a mag cover I think you need to capture the police in a more "active" moment. Good focus and use of the light availible.', '2003-06-18 00:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
