(328334, 24315, 1863, '<td valign="top">great shot ridergal, this shone out. Even though I didn''t vote for this challenge, I glanced through the images, and I had another look at this one, several times. Well done matey.</td>', 'great shot ridergal, this shone out. Even though I didn''t vote for this challenge, I glanced through the images, and I had another look at this one, several times. Well done matey.', '2003-06-18 01:08:49.000000', NULL, 0),
