(328483, 23934, 8171, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your kind comments - here''s my respone to them.  Firstly I take on board the comments about the eyes being out of focus - I was simply just unfortunate! I had about a second to take the shot as it wasn''t posed - the boy simply looked through my fence towards my son who was playing there and then was gone. However, I''m not sure I would want it different as I think it isolates the boy as an "outsider" re: the title even more. Basically I consider myself lucky to have grabbed the decent framing in that time. Also, I perhaps would remove the reflection in the left eye in spot editing though certainly not all of it - just the line across the centre. I''ll settle for 8th any day!</td>', 'Thanks for all your kind comments - here''s my respone to them.  Firstly I take on board the comments about the eyes being out of focus - I was simply just unfortunate! I had about a second to take the shot as it wasn''t posed - the boy simply looked through my fence towards my son who was playing there and then was gone. However, I''m not sure I would want it different as I think it isolates the boy as an "outsider" re: the title even more. Basically I consider myself lucky to have grabbed the decent framing in that time. Also, I perhaps would remove the reflection in the left eye in spot editing though certainly not all of it - just the line across the centre. I''ll settle for 8th any day!', '2003-06-18 01:52:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(328489, 24460, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting/exposure. This shot definitely fit the challenge better than most. I''m personally not all that interested in the subject, but I can totally imagine it being on the cover of an architecture mag so I had to score it high. Very nice, clean work. Congrats!</td>', 'Very nice lighting/exposure. This shot definitely fit the challenge better than most. I''m personally not all that interested in the subject, but I can totally imagine it being on the cover of an architecture mag so I had to score it high. Very nice, clean work. Congrats!', '2003-06-18 01:53:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(328501, 24315, 1143, '<td valign="top">Great shot. You definitely get great shot opportunities and take advantage of them! Nice stop motion shot and capture of emotion. The blacks seem a little light - maybe a slight curves adjustment? Congrats on the well-deserved win!</td>', 'Great shot. You definitely get great shot opportunities and take advantage of them! Nice stop motion shot and capture of emotion. The blacks seem a little light - maybe a slight curves adjustment? Congrats on the well-deserved win!', '2003-06-18 01:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
