(328641, 24140, 4564, '<td valign="top">Yeah... you got robbed dude.  Just goes to show: people vote higher for things they "recognize".  Baskeball shots have been done millions of time.  Sure it''s a nice shot.  But does it belong at number 1?  Not compared to your shot.  (ok ok, not nice to compare... but sorry, it''s true!  You deserved it.)</td>', 'Yeah... you got robbed dude.  Just goes to show: people vote higher for things they "recognize".  Baskeball shots have been done millions of time.  Sure it''s a nice shot.  But does it belong at number 1?  Not compared to your shot.  (ok ok, not nice to compare... but sorry, it''s true!  You deserved it.)', '2003-06-18 02:51:51.000000', NULL, 0);
