(328653, 24415, 4564, '<td valign="top">Connie, you''re very talented. "Good Clean Fun" remains one of my favorite photos of all time (not just DPC).  This time, you pulled it off marvelously with this flower and butterfly. Just goes to show flowers (an old cliché) can still be captured in all their visual splendor. (and I don`t like flower shots! LOL!) Congratulations.  I think you well deserve your spot in the top 3 winners.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-18 02:04:42.</i></td>', 'Connie, you''re very talented. "Good Clean Fun" remains one of my favorite photos of all time (not just DPC).  This time, you pulled it off marvelously with this flower and butterfly. Just goes to show flowers (an old cliché) can still be captured in all their visual splendor. (and I don`t like flower shots! LOL!) Congratulations.  I think you well deserve your spot in the top 3 winners.', '2003-06-18 03:04:00.000000', '2003-06-18 03:04:42.000000', 0),
