(328883, 24315, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great shooting Ridergal - This picture got the only 10 I''ve given for the last 2 or 3 weeks and is just a terrific shot.  I''d be honored to share the front page with ya :P  Really, nice work here.  It''s a helluva shot.  Congrats - Bob</td>', 'Great shooting Ridergal - This picture got the only 10 I''ve given for the last 2 or 3 weeks and is just a terrific shot.  I''d be honored to share the front page with ya :P  Really, nice work here.  It''s a helluva shot.  Congrats - Bob', '2003-06-18 07:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(328887, 24269, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m with Brumos!<br/>And I must disagree with a comment below - it''s precisely the range of real expressions - from calm to excited to absolutely terrified/ in pain - that makes this such an excellent shot in my opinion.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I''m with Brumos!And I must disagree with a comment below - it''s precisely the range of real expressions - from calm to excited to absolutely terrified/ in pain - that makes this such an excellent shot in my opinion.Kavey', '2003-06-18 07:15:48.000000', NULL, 0),
