(329476, 24420, 714, '<td valign="top">I know I should have cropped a little tighter but then where would the text go?  I thought that the text could go in the empty spot..thanks DJLuba. :-)</td>', 'I know I should have cropped a little tighter but then where would the text go?  I thought that the text could go in the empty spot..thanks DJLuba. :-)', '2003-06-18 13:18:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(329580, 24460, 6912, '<td valign="top">CONGRATULATIONS!!!!!! You really did well! I liked the photo immedeatelly!</td>', 'CONGRATULATIONS!!!!!! You really did well! I liked the photo immedeatelly!', '2003-06-18 13:40:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(329610, 24173, 1863, '<td valign="top">Hi Koriyama!<br/> <br/>This is your critique from the critique club. <br/> <br/>It''s funny that I should get this picture to critique, cause I have had my eye on it for the last week or so. I saw it, and I found it immediately appealing. <br/> <br/>The lighting is superb, and so is the composition. I don''t understand what brought your score down. My only guess is that there is a slight graininess, probably from using such an extreme Aperture setting. I think if you had tried something shallower for a macro like this, it may have been less grainy. <br/> <br/>There is such a stark desolate feeling to this picture. I really like it, and had I voted, I would have given it very high marks.<br/>Great job on your first shot.<br/>-Annida</td>', 'Hi Koriyama! This is your critique from the critique club.  It''s funny that I should get this picture to critique, cause I have had my eye on it for the last week or so. I saw it, and I found it immediately appealing.  The lighting is superb, and so is the composition. I don''t understand what brought your score down. My only guess is that there is a slight graininess, probably from using such an extreme Aperture setting. I think if you had tried something shallower for a macro like this, it may have been less grainy.  There is such a stark desolate feeling to this picture. I really like it, and had I voted, I would have given it very high marks.Great job on your first shot.-Annida', '2003-06-18 13:47:19.000000', NULL, 0),
