(528182, 24175, 15407, '<td valign="top">Marjo, Thanks for your comment on my Starfish Santa photo. I may have done better in that competition than with the one I submitted for the December open challenge... I knew I should have submitted my Hummingbird shot... Your "Magazine Cover" photo is quite good &amp; I like it... I''ve been trying to get a great shot of a hummingbird for years... It''s sure difficult to get everything right because they are so quick.  I just recently got a good ''Birdfight'' photo(instead of a dog fight)and during that go round I got 3 different shots of the bird coming directly at me... an interesting shot...although not technically perfect. I may put one in my portolio section sometime soon... Tim</td>', 'Marjo, Thanks for your comment on my Starfish Santa photo. I may have done better in that competition than with the one I submitted for the December open challenge... I knew I should have submitted my Hummingbird shot... Your "Magazine Cover" photo is quite good & I like it... I''ve been trying to get a great shot of a hummingbird for years... It''s sure difficult to get everything right because they are so quick.  I just recently got a good ''Birdfight'' photo(instead of a dog fight)and during that go round I got 3 different shots of the bird coming directly at me... an interesting shot...although not technically perfect. I may put one in my portolio section sometime soon... Tim', '2004-01-01 08:32:14.000000', NULL, 0),
