(1306369, 24437, 36681, '<td valign="top">The photograph is good..the suject is beautiful thats helps with presentation, not going to down play you at all but her left foot is is distorted becuase of the water..placement will help with this..and you should use either a flash or a reflector, to help with the shadows on the face..excellent photo..</td>', 'The photograph is good..the suject is beautiful thats helps with presentation, not going to down play you at all but her left foot is is distorted becuase of the water..placement will help with this..and you should use either a flash or a reflector, to help with the shadows on the face..excellent photo..', '2005-04-19 23:37:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1502014, 24460, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow - I was just looking at your Profile and leafing through your Portfolio.  You have some AMAZING work!  This is certainly one of them - and my newest Favorite!  FANTASTIC DOF, lighting, crop, composition, you-name-it...<br/> <br/>Belated congrats on the ribbon, but congrats nonetheless on a stunning image.</td>', 'Wow - I was just looking at your Profile and leafing through your Portfolio.  You have some AMAZING work!  This is certainly one of them - and my newest Favorite!  FANTASTIC DOF, lighting, crop, composition, you-name-it... Belated congrats on the ribbon, but congrats nonetheless on a stunning image.', '2005-07-03 15:39:11.000000', NULL, 0),
