(1976841, 24218, 34365, '<td valign="top">While this is a pretty girl,I question why you would not just do a total nude?<br/>Rather than use this swim wear,which made her in my mind look like she was in pain..but the overall photo is very<br/>nice as far as color and comp. As are most of yours..I do enjoy your work and thank you for sharing.<br/>Trizia</td>', 'While this is a pretty girl,I question why you would not just do a total nude?Rather than use this swim wear,which made her in my mind look like she was in pain..but the overall photo is verynice as far as color and comp. As are most of yours..I do enjoy your work and thank you for sharing.Trizia', '2005-12-25 11:32:54.000000', NULL, 0),
